  ('zcrm_1579374000164437148', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000164437143', 'Ximena Lizama', NULL, '5-6-25 Ximena just started her new job with The Hope Institute of America yesterday, May 5th in AZ. They are 1 hour behind right now. They can join for July 1st. She is 56 and husband is 48. He has diabetes that he manages with 3 meds. Glimeciride/metformin is about $50 for 90 days, rosuvastatin calcium about $7-$17 and losartan $2-$20. They will join Secure HSA. They moved from CA to AZ and paying very little for Covered CA. She watched the video but still didn''t really understand it. So, I explained it again to her. She wants to read it as well. I read the pre-x clause exemption for diabetes to her. Otherwise, they are both healthy, no other issues, no tobacco, no family history and no meds for Ximena. She wants the 1dental discount plan for dental and vision discsounts. 

