  ('zcrm_1579374000164104164', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000164104144', 'Caitlin Hawk', NULL, '4-29-25 Caitlin is pregnant and due in July, 2025. Her husband Daniel is 27 and baby 1 1/2. They live in Carbondale, CO and were referred by Martha Rybak. Caitlin can remain on her ins paid for by employer for $0. But, when add family members it''s $1500!  So, I suggested for Daniel and baby join Premium Care and possibly HAB. Premium Care EC $1000/$481 + $200 = $681 or $1500/$433 +$200 = $633. They will use the well child checks, dental, vision, gym, labs maybe, skin check maybe. She knows of the May 1st start date for HAB and June 1st for Premium Care. They will call me tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-29 16:58:04', '2025-04-30 15:04:11'),
