  ('zcrm_1579374000159676008', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000159689001', 'Mike Badar', NULL, '2-17-25 Mike chose a Select Health Bronze Value Network EPO for $291 his cost with broker Jamie Smith. He wants to review his options bc he doesn''t like his plan now. Not sure why he won''t go back to Jamie. I looked up options outside of his account to help. He''s head a number of head injuries and needs me to talk very slowly and really wants to meet in person. I let him know I''m working remotely and can''t meet with him on person. He finally was willing to talk over the phone. He needs UC Health mostly and therefore Select Health is his best option. He can choose a Gold plan. I sent him samples to review. Probably the cheapest Select Health Value Colorado Option Gold EPO/Gold looks to be best. He will review and let me know his questions. He may need many surgeries and really doesn''t know what''s wrong with him. Lost Medicaid at the end of Jan. So, he has 60 days to make a change from Jan. 31st. He turns 65 in Oct. DOB 10-13-1960. Found me on C4 site and is in Louisville.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-17 15:45:12', '2025-02-17 15:45:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159613036', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000159630001', 'Cole Bender', NULL, '2-14-25 Here was Cole''s initial information he sent which is helpful.
