  ('zcrm_1579374000159613031', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000159630001', 'Cole Bender', NULL, '2-14-25 Cole is 26 and lives in Boulder. He''s planning to leave his job at the end of March and hike through 5 states. So, he wants to be protected as he travels. He has high blood pressure that he''s managing with meds. Valsartan HCTZ - $17-$24 and amlodipine $3-$20 on GoodRX.  It''s managed by these meds and he''s never been in the hospital for high blood pressure or in the last 36 months. I read the Sedera sharing guidelines to him about blood pressure as well. I suspect Concierge can find even better prices than this. He will do his wellness visit before he leaves his current ins.  His income will be about $50K with missing many months of work for his trip. I let him know ACA will limit his to networks and CO.
