  ('zcrm_1579374000159267018', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000158933001', 'Cheryl Branson', NULL, '2-11-25 Cheryl is unemployed and just living on her savings. She will likely qualify for Medicaid since no income. She revealed that she suddenly has knee pain in one knee. She wants to go to Panorama Ortho in Golden. I can''t find who they accept for insurance. Her DOB 2/24/61, 80453. She lost ins. as of Dec. 31st. She''s within the 60 days of her life change event. I sent her instructions to apply via C4 and likely get onto Medicaid.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-11 10:07:54', '2025-02-11 10:07:54'),
