  ('zcrm_1579374000154640112', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000154678089', 'Kristin Laue', NULL, '12-13-24 Kristin came to me via Gaia. She lives in CO 7 months and AK 5 months. She doesn''t always work while she''s in CO but anything via C4 or Medicaid won''t work on AK. She''s trying to stay within $200-$250. She is working to quit smoking so HAB $107 is excellent for her. She also wants dental, vision, wellness, etc. I realize she can use Care+ for 1 year since cheaper for membership and $50 fee vs $75. Then once she has quit we can put her on Premium Care since they don''t deem her a tobacco user for life. So, $2500/$205+$50 = $255 for Care+ and $107 which she can ultimately get reimbursed from the benefits. I let her know of the $125/$25 as well. She will research more and decide. She''s relieved that she doesn''t have to decide immediately and knows the deadlines for each month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-12-13 13:26:28', '2024-12-13 13:26:28'),
