  ('zcrm_1579374000138932008', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000073533045', 'Donald Coy', NULL, '5-10-24 Don is looking for his wife, Linda since his company was just acquired. He will be losing the current insurance as of May 31st. The new "company" will be offering a new plan for June 1st. But, he only needs benefits for June and he turns 65 in July. So, I''ve suggested that he talks with his employer about waiting to choose Cobra assuming they are offering it. He will talk with HR. For his wife, she needs a colonoscopy soon and wants a mammo. She also gets her labs done, dental cleaning, vision screening and possibly participate in nutritional health and mental health, given the opportunity. We discussed Premium CARE $285 / $1000 and HAB $107 = $392 plus $125/$25. Linda takes cholesterol meds and some supplements. I will send them the video to watch as well as written overview.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2024-05-10 12:07:12', '2024-05-10 12:07:12'),
