  ('zcrm_1579374000138497127', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000073533045', 'Donald Coy', NULL, '5-6-24 From Andrea, "I wanted to let you know that I have been working with Don Coy on Medicare.  He turns 65 in July.  His company, I believe, has just been sold and they are to get new insurance at the end of the month.  

