  ('zcrm_1579374000126713046', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000126694031', 'Karen Dame', NULL, '10-17-23  I reached back out to Karen and she was a bit short with me. She wanted answers as fast as possible. She and her husband are both self-employed. She''s 62 and he''s turning 64. They are super healthy, no meds, no tobacco. She learned of MPB on some health share group on FB. They are super healthy and holistic. However, she''s only paying $90 a month per person for Christian Health Share Ministry!  They must have a Huge AUA!  She wants the lowest cost possible. Her son is with Solidarity and is 29. She will keep everyone where they and pay very little.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-17 13:34:40', '2023-10-17 13:34:40'),
