  ('zcrm_1579374000126373016', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000118020047', 'Paolo Bonetti', NULL, '10-11-23 Paolo is going to present to his company on Oct. 23rd our option as they review solutions in the next 6 weeks. He just wanted to give me an update on his progress. This is another referral from Nancy Gentry. I''ll send him a quick email letting him know I rec''d his vm. He said no need to return his call, just updating me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-11 12:04:48', '2023-10-11 12:04:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000126278033', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000126277069', 'Angie Byrd', NULL, '10-10-23 Angie is 54 and husband is 55 with a 21 yr old daughter and 23 yr old son. Son may have employer benefits soon in the next few months and daughter is in college. They has BC/BS of South Carolina. They moved to Boulder 1 1/2 yrs ago. So, their benefits won''t really work here. They don''t have health issues. Angie take hormone replacement therapy and pays for it on her own through her naturopathic dr. They both take Valtrex for herpes which is generic and no other health issues. She''s also looking at Knew Health and Crowd Health. Crowd Health is $50 a month and then they could wind up paying $375 some months if/when another member has a problem.  She''s still curious about Knew Health. She continuing her research and will let me know if she wants to move forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-10-10 16:59:08', '2023-10-10 16:59:08'),
