  ('zcrm_1579374000124778028', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000124801007', 'Brenda Serna', NULL, '9-11-23 Brenda is 43 and same with her husband is 43. Brenda isn''t working but her husband is self-employed. She paused on the pre-x part but then confirmed that they don''t have anything. I''m not sure she''s being forthright. But, I made the pre-x clause very clear. They haven''t done any wellness visits since they don''t have ins right now. They don''t have an HSA but she understands that part better now. They earn about $60K. They have kids that are on some other plan, so they won''t be included. She is interested in doing the ACA compliant annual wellness visit. She''s also still interested in possibly waiting for open enrollment and going onto trad ins. I suspect it''s bc one of them has some health issue they''re suddenly concerned about, hence wanting ins now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-11 15:35:02', '2023-09-11 15:35:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000124570041', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000124530031', 'Patti Owens', NULL, '9-6-23 Patti is 57 and lives in PA. She''s known of healthshares for a long time and in particular Medishare. She knows with some they have reinsurance and was asking if these memberships have them or not. I let her know there''s no cap, so no. She found us via web search and also was looking at Zion. I let her know with us she''ll have far more benefits at nearly the same membership fee for a single person. She''s a nutrition coach and is leading a charter for Weston Price. She''s very health minded and believes in healing with exercise and diet. She has very mild emphysema since 2014, although her Dr. never told her. But, more recent dr. found it in her record.  She hasn''t been treated other than managing it with her healthy diet and such. She does take meds for her thyroid for 20 years and pays for those on her own.  She does ultrasounds for breast tissue. She doesn''t do mammograms or colonoscopies since she doesn''t really believe in them. She''s interested in funding the HSA. But, she''s deciding if it''s worth choosing SECURE vs CARE+.  I will send her the video since she didn''t see that yet as well as the written docs for both memberships. She''ll reach out to me if/when she wants to talk again next week after she does her due diligence. She was very nice and appreciative of my time and support.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-09-06 21:38:31', '2023-09-06 21:38:31'),
