  ('zcrm_1579374000123158006', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000122049080', 'Mark Wagoner', NULL, '8-7-23 Mark called bc he''s still deciding what to do. He called Zion and got their pricing and options as well and is comparing what they have to what MPB is offering. He''s not interested in all of the benefits offered by MPB or even the support. He''s gotten very good at finding the best prices on items in their local area. He knows where to can an MRI for $250 and mammogram for $150! He uses GoodRX already and has no interest in the mental health benefits or even virtual healthcare. They do want the mammogram and colonoscopy benefit after 6 month waiting period. He''s already paying $514 with Christian Healthshare Ministry with a $1000 AUA per person. So, they really want to bring their cost down. MPB''s memberships are more expensive that Zion and heavily leaning toward Zion right now. I sent him my link and he was afraid it would cost him more to enroll through me. I let him know it''s the same and there''s no downside to having me as his advocate. He said he''ll keep me posted on his decision once he discusses with his wife.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-07 12:29:10', '2023-08-07 12:29:10'),
