  ('zcrm_1579374000122695003', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000122673001', 'Rod Slaton', NULL, '7-27-23 Rod found MPB via search after many of his friends are on similar options like Medishare. He searched for options on his own and likes the HSA aspect of ours. They are mostly retired but still own a small LLC which gives them a group plan right now for almost $2700 a month with a $3K ded!! Barbara turns 65 on Dec. 5th, 2023 and Rod turns 60 on Sept. 28th, 2023. Barbara has slightly high blood pressure handled with med. Rod has high cholesterol which is hereditary, hypothyroidism for 20 years and BPH which is an enlarged prostate. He also  had a small meniscus tear which were both cleaned up. One was in Jan. 2022 and the other Oct 2022. Then they walked 192 miles in the UK and he plays pickle ball and bikes, etc. So, they are very active and he''s definitely tested his knees and all is well. He''s looking to make a switch more towards the end of the year and wife may just go directly onto Medicare when it'' time. He also take Repatha 140 mg every two weeks which is $560-$580 a month. He''ll still be better off if he has to pay for that cost wise. I''m researching if I can get a better deal still.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-27 11:00:06', '2023-07-27 11:00:06'),
