  ('zcrm_1579374000120982013', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000120939340', 'Stacie Hunn', NULL, '6-20-23 Stacie is 57 and husband is 56. They live outside of Philly (in Harrisburg??), PA. I don''t see any limitations for PA. Stacie just got laid off and had been getting ins through employer. Husband is a home inspector and owns their company. They have 2 employees that they might want to offer benefits to as well in the future. They are both healthy, no tobacco. Stacie takes meds for anxiety when her mom passed away. Husband takes rosuvastatin for cholesterol and another med that she doesn''t know what it''s for. I think she said Budeprion which is for depression.  She watched the video on the ASHI site. They do their annual wellness visits and they have funded an HSA. She thought she wanted a July 1st start date until I told her that today is the deadline. So, she will look towards Aug. 1st for SECURE $1000/$625. She sounded like she was in a rush at the end. I will send her the information in writing. She wants to share it with her husband before making a decision. Make sure to enroll through the ASHI link.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-20 13:19:39', '2023-06-20 13:20:48'),
