  ('zcrm_1579374000108419023', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000108418070', 'Chris Klein', NULL, '12-2-22 Chris is the President of a small company called Power Controls. He''s an engineer. He was referred by Kenny Murowski via Sarah C Kray. I thought I recognized Sarah''s name but can''t find her the CRM. His company has 12 employees. Some are familiar with MCS already. None use tobacco. 1 employee has non-insulin dependent diabetes and he''s working on it with his diet. He gives Chris a hard time since Chris can eat anything and is still skinny. He has learned a little about Zion already and wanted to understand who they are vs us. Once I explained, he said so, "You''re the people who make it easy for people like me." I thought that was a perfect analogy. He wants to pay for his employees and half of their dependents cost of the membership. He also wants to fund some or part of the HSA. He will do the math. He definitely wants his hand held in understanding how to set up the HSA with our partner and instructions. He wants SECURE for his employees. He knows of the Dec. 10th deadline for his commitment and Dec. 20th for employees.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-02 12:59:28', '2022-12-02 12:59:28'),
