  ('zcrm_1579374000100938008', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000100614001', 'Sam Waites', NULL, '8-16-22 Sam is an ASHI member, 58, no ins now. Used to be w/ LHS, then got employed with ins. Then chose to become self-employed as home inspector and now without insurance entirely. No meds, no tobacco, healthy. Had his 2nd colonoscopy in 2021. He was instructed to be on the 5 year path but after his most recent good outcome he thinks he''s back to the traditional 10 yr schedule for the next one. So, he might be fine with CARE+ since he''s not certain he can afford SECURE right now. Dr. Bark Richards in Jefferson, GA is showing in the network. I need to remember to waive the $100 fee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-19 09:06:17', '2022-08-19 09:06:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000099572013', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000014932001', 'Ashley Henry', NULL, '8-2-22 I left a vm for Ashley at 11:30 to help her and reminded her we spoke a few years ago via Jessica Foster referring her to me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-08-02 11:31:34', '2022-08-02 11:31:34'),
