  ('zcrm_1579374000084159031', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000084160016', 'Kollin Skattum', NULL, '1-7-22 Came from Big Wave Lead. He and his wife are about to turn 26. They are both on their parent''s plans right now. He needs something to start April 1st, 2022. Told him their might be a slight price change. His parents were part of something similar called Rocky Mtn Reserve via a church where they got all of their money back at the end of the year bc they didn''t use anything! They had this for 2 years but no longer.  If he gets ins through his wife''s employer it will cost $560 plus dental and vision to bring total to $650 for just him!  Cheapest C4 is about $164 Bronze and $265 for Silver with high ded and mop. He sees value of this for the lower financial risk and added value. He will watch video and share info with wife and let me know in a week or so what they plan to do.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-07 14:55:19', '2022-01-07 14:55:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084159013', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000082145025', 'Mariano Ansaldo', NULL, '1-7-22 Mariano is 55 and wife is 52. Wife doesn''t work and he works for Inter American Development Bank. It''s a multi-national unity bank focused on Latin America. The bank is owned by different countries and focus on Latin America. He does not pay any income tax the way the bank employs him. He has a contract for a defined period of time about 1 1/2 years. The bank does not offer him insurance.  He and wife are healthy, only got covid last year and are fine. No tobacco and no meds. He will read over information I send and decide about if he wants this vs health insurance. He''ll let me know. He knows of the deadlines.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-07 11:42:14', '2022-01-07 11:42:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000084159003', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000084067015', 'Dr. Marcia Schaefer', NULL, '1-6-22 Dr. Marcia is 37 and husband 38. She''s a Dr. and ran a cash pay chiro practice for the past 12 years. Now she''s opening a Birthing Center! Her husband is a police officer and he''s probably moving away from that profession soon.  She came to me via Carlene and just opened up her own PMA! Lives in WI but has connections worldwide and is planning to grow this and spread knowledge far and wide. She wants to partner to be part of a cash pay network! Told her I''d talk to Rod. She currently wants to offer this to 3 employees and plans to grow substantially. She works with and trains doulas, mid-wives and docs worldwide. She has a family and wants SECURE for $1000/$685 and she knows of price increase to $715 in Oct. of 2022. Possibly wants Feb. 1st start date for her and kids to lock in price. Possibly add husband if/when he changes jobs. Not certain they will join that fast yet. They are about to break ground for the birthing center. She''s moving fast.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-01-07 08:59:40', '2022-01-07 08:59:40'),
