  ('zcrm_1579374000082491094', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000082489161', 'Kherissa Stuart', NULL, '12-20-21 Kherissa came to me via Carlene. She has started her own ministry to start an Academy. She''s also working with a partner in the medical freedom world and thinks they want to start their own medical cost sharing ministry. She has no sense of what a huge task that is. She hasn''t been a member and was hoping to pick someone''s brain about doing so or hiring someone to do so. I helped her recognize that will take a long time to get going with the funds, people, resources, etc. They don''t have any insurance or mcs at the moment. Another ministry they are partnering with has connections to Dr. Judy Mikovich. They are looking to do this in the LA and San Diego area primarily. We both aren''t sure if the ministry removes them from needing to abide by the ACA. She will ask Carlene and I will too. The SECURE $685/$1000 is too expensive for her partner''s family. If the ministry removes them from the ACA rules then they can choose CARE+ for $550 instead. I also shared with her the CARE product since they were originally considering doing telehealth only. But, she also wants to be able to access off label drugs, I think, like ivermectin and HCQ. I told her about the deadlines.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-20 15:21:45', '2021-12-20 15:22:02'),
