  ('zcrm_1579374000081750008', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000081767001', 'Christina Turco', NULL, '12-10-21 Christina DOB 1/26/71, about to turn 51. Christina is healthy and seeks tons of naturopathic care. She believes she was vaccine injured at 3 years old and 37. The vax put her into a coma at 3 and 37! Also had head injuries and meningitis 3x 13 years ago. She has a family history of cancer and continues to do tons of holistic care to prevent any possible chance of cancer. Has had ear infections which she''s treated with antibiotics in past few years. Otherwise, all other things are far in the past now. No meds, no tobacco. She''s getting divorced officially on Dec. 27th. She runs her own massage biz and writes off so much of her life that she shows $0 income. She will apply for Medicaid via C4 per my instructions. She also has 2 kids that she will likely claim. Natalie Schuler is 20 8-22-2001 and Ben 9-29-2007. Other child is claimed by x sounds like.  She also wants good dental. Currently has Delta Dental and wants to keep DDS Dr. Rathburn with Broadway Smiles and Endodontist Steve Klyn. Will send her Spirit Dental and Dental Dental.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-12-10 15:55:16', '2021-12-10 15:55:16'),
