  ('zcrm_1579374000072284013', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000072314004', 'Cecelia Ruffing', NULL, '7-22-21 Ceal is turning 63 in Aug and Bob is turning 60 in Oct of 2021. Ceal needs an Oct. 1st start date. Their income may be anywhere from $20K - $60K. We put it at $40K for now. Bob is healthy. Ceal had a couple of hip replacements and back degeneration issues with compressed discs. So, health insurance will be best! With income at $40K their APTC will be $1414, at $60K it''s $1163. Wants PT Sandy Bertrand who I used to use! She''s at Functional Fitness in Boulder now. She also wants Dr. Hillary Browne, Dr. Edward (Ted) Parks, Dr. Stephen Dana Paul, Dr. Christine Hansen. For Bob he wants Dr. William Dobson at Dakota Ridge. Anthem is best option to keep most doctors!!  I think it only eliminated Dr. Christine Hansen. She will find new gyn.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-22 14:30:06', '2021-07-22 14:30:06'),
