  ('zcrm_1579374000071611013', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000070944001', 'Jamie Stein', NULL, '7-9-21 Spoke with Jamie''s father Fred Stein to answer his questions about how self-pay patient works. He understands better now and knows Concierge Type services are popular in S. FL. Now understands her responsibility is 3 Needs per year, ie. $3000 instead of the high ded ins plans. He will recommend his daughter joins.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-09 14:18:41', '2021-07-09 14:18:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000071573036', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000071577025', 'Todd Kovalcik', NULL, '7-8-21 Todd and wife plus 2 teenagers interested in joining and live in CA. Came to me via Bob Glah. Todd will be leaving his job soon and doing contract work as 1099. Mostly healthy family with the exception of oldest daughter who has vital induced asthma and user inhaler on occasion for maintenance. Was hospitalized 4-5 years ago. He understands the pre-clause that if she were to be hospitalized for asthma in the 1st year of membership it will be at their cost 100%. I told him to think about it and talk it over with wife to decide if they are comfortable or not. She just uses Advair occasionally. Nobody uses tobacco. Todd was paying only $400 for his family bc employer paid 100% of his plan and about 75% of rest of family.  He has looked at other health shares but is very interested in this one and seems to have a good grasp of how and why it works.  I looked up Dr. O''Connor who wasn''t showing but Dr. John Cheng is showing up for South Coast Medical Group for wellness.  SECURE $685/$1000 is the option for them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-07-08 15:45:46', '2021-07-08 15:46:06'),
