  ('zcrm_1579374000063572050', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000063552057', 'Pierre Bouguennec', NULL, '2-11-21 Corrected Pierre''s email address and I sent him the SECURE membership details. He has an enlarged prostate which he knows is considered pre-x. He and his wife are both business owners but his was hit hard this past year due to covid. Pierre is 60. Not sure age of wife and daughter. He''s French. He wanted to understand the guarantees like insurance. Told him if he wants an insurance guarantee that this is not the solution for him. Explained the backup plan in case of lack of funds in a month. He wants to discuss it with his wife after reviewing the information I sent. I will send him audio as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2021-02-11 10:28:46', '2021-02-11 10:28:46'),
