  ('zcrm_1579374000058282011', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000058279029', 'David Waldman', NULL, '10-16-20 He''s a bit of an edgy, grumpy sounding character. He wants what he wants. He hates needing to go to a PCP to be referred to a specialist. I explained that''s no necessary with this membership. I discussed the new Secure option for $275/$1000. He owns and runs his own company as an S-Corp and pays himself a W2. He''s 37 now and paying $450 for FL Blue through Fed Exchange.  He says no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. He''s asking about seeing cardiologist for check up. I made sure he doesn''t have any current pre-x and he reassured me that he does not. Explained to him if just a heart check and no symptoms he will have to pay, if symptoms then it will count towards IUA if NOT pre-x.  He wants his dad to review information and will let me know if he wants to proceed after he gets his dad''s input.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-10-16 12:29:05', '2020-10-16 12:29:05'),
