  ('zcrm_1579374000051564008', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000051560028', 'Sarah Mills', NULL, '5-27-20 Sarah Mills, turning 43 on Friday, Jonathan is 42 and B-Day in a month, kids 9 and 2. Jonathan left job a few month''s ago and is looking at new jobs but doesn''t know if benefits will be included. Cobra is $1250. Sarah and son take Flovent, .44mcg for son and .110 for her. That is expensive on GoodRX for $256. Takes every 6 weeks for 4 months of year. Also take albuterol inhaler which is typically affordable for asthma. Jonathan takes alopurenol daily for gout flairs and it''s $4. While out of work they are still bringing in $5K-$6K a month and that will increase and stabilize soon. Sarah is self-employed. Super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-27 11:40:43', '2020-05-27 11:40:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051564003', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000051560009', 'Cathy Gavette', NULL, '5-26-20 Cathy is 55, Brian 55 and boys 19 and 23. Live in IN and currently have employer coverage. Curious what''s available if Brian leaves job or gets laid off. Paying around $500-$600 now which also includes dental. Employer pays the rest. Live in Healthcare.gov state with zip code 46077, Boone County. Boys both FT students. Family is mostly health and active. Boys cyclists. Brian has exercised induced asthma and takes meds and has inhaler. Takes Albuterol and Symbicort (perhaps in past). She needs to check to see what he''s taking now. Some family members have allergies from environment like pollen and hay fever. Takes OTC and Singulair. Brian had A-fib 3-5 years ago. She''s going to look up his record to ensure more than 36 months ago. He had ablation at the time and no meds or any treatment since. Both boys are on ADD meds using Adderall XR while in school. Priced out PDHC bc of ages and is $910/$1500 level. Too pricey for them. She''s going to check back with me in a month to see if the new program (Zion) is available and how it differs and cost. They have no time deadline at the moment. This will give them freedom to leave job if find a viable solution.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-26 13:58:32', '2020-05-26 13:58:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051437021', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000051439018', 'Lindsay Buchanan', NULL, '5-21-20 Lindsay is turning 39 in June 2020, Brady is 35 and they have 2 kids. Live in Sunny Side in Denver. Working as self-employed and Lindsay is leaving job soon to join Brady in their event biz. 
_____
