  ('zcrm_1579374000048447013', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000048449009', 'Greg Ellis', NULL, '3-17-20 Greg is 48 and Ann Margaret is 49. Greg got laid off. Works in the oil and gas industry. Wife has migraines treated by botox every 3 months. Greg has allergy injections every 2-3 weeks. He thinks he''s paying around $26.50 now but not certain with the billing. Told him to find out cash price for both items to see if will work without trad ins. They see specialists for both things but wife can look into PCP for her injections possibly. There is a Dr. see was considering but he doesn''t accept ins and they will need to find out cash price for him as well. Healthy otherwise, no tobacco. He''s not sure if he''ll get a new job with benefits or contract work w/o. Told him to see if NM has STM options as well. They are curious about vision and may also get covered through eye Dr. May want April 1st but has a lot to decide. Looked at Medishare also and was more confused at what they covered. But, cheapest option was in $300''s. Told him they don''t include wellness visits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-17 13:33:49', '2020-03-17 13:33:49'),
