  ('zcrm_1579374000047214008', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000047196006', 'Summer Signer', NULL, '2-19-20 Summer is 38 and healthy. Leaving employer coverage end of Feb. Company is paying 1/2 and she''s paying half. Best guess is around $300 total per month. Doesn''t know how long she''ll be out of work bc she''s at Director level now and can take a long time to get a new job. Previous job before current one also had terrible benefits, so may want to stay put even if gets ins through a new employer. X and kids are on another plan. Suggested PDHC at $311/$500 IUA. She earns about $80K from current job that she''s leaving. But, no severance, ie. no income soon. She could qualify for Medicaid if she chooses. It''s up to her. We are reconnecting tomorrow to discuss.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-19 13:50:39', '2020-02-19 14:01:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047147011', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000046437001', 'Ronald Porter', NULL, '2-18-20 Called bc he never received my email with Latuda priced out. He found the email after looking in spam. As of 1-31-20 - I just received the best price I can find right now for Latuda 20mg x 90tabs $541.76 + $9.95 shipping. It''s basically $180.59 per month. Now looking at traditional ins for Nicholas Tyler Porter 2/10/1997. LURASIDONE is generic alternative covered by ins. He looking to make a change in the next few months and he can choose Cobra if need be in the interim. But, hasn''t quit job yet and not sure when he will.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-18 13:52:52', '2020-03-19 12:07:02'),
