  ('zcrm_1579374000046434013', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000046437001', 'Ronald Porter', NULL, '1-31-20 Ronald Tyler Porter is 52 and wife turning 53 next week. 3 kids, one is turning 26 so not eligible and the other 2 in 20''s but both listed as dependents on taxes. They all take anti-depressants. But, 23 year old son was just diagnosed with bi-polar and is taking new Latuda 20 mg per day which costs $1200+ a month! They are only paying $15 through insurance. Getting price from Reid. May need to keep him on traditional insurance. Ron is looking to quit his current job with insurance soon and run own business with one partner and other family members helping. Not sufficient for a group with MCS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-31 12:48:32', '2020-02-18 13:54:19'),
