  ('zcrm_1579374000045869008', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000045872001', 'Colleen Lohnes', NULL, '1-20-20 Colleen is extremely skeptical of this since she''s not familiar with it. She really doesn''t have any good options otherwise. Her primary residence will be in CO but they spend most of their time in FL and they are shutting down their business in CO. She wants to be able to see doctors in FL. They are part of Kaiser now but Bill will move to Medicare and she will decide what to do. She has high cholesterol slightly. She chose to go on statin but doctor wasn''t necessarily recommending it. She takes 5mg on occasion. He ratios are fine.  They were in the car so I had to repeat myself a number of times.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-20 11:48:42', '2020-01-20 11:49:42'),
