  ('zcrm_1579374000045781018', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000045780037', 'Greg Topper', NULL, '1-15-20 Greg is 53. His partner is 38 but they aren''t married and file taxes separately. Greg claims their 4 1/2 yr old child on his taxes. He''s only paying for child at $250 month. He knows there must be an adult on membership. At $1500 IUA EC PDHC is $610 and 38 yr old is $290, total $900 for all of them. He''s going to read over everything tonight and get back to me tomorrow or the next day. He does have allergies and need epinephrine. He''s seemingly struggling with thought of adding $650 to his total cost but way better than traditional insurance in Valley. He also wants me to give the $100 referral fee to Andre since he can use it most even though Adam Rothberg also referred him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-15 12:17:10', '2020-01-15 20:05:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045760013', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000040536002', 'Jodi Parker', NULL, '1-14-20 Looks like they will qualify for Medicaid with husband out of job at the moment. Jodi''s income is about $30K and they have a family of 5. If/when husband gets job Nextera / Sedera cost is $1500 IUA $501 plus Nextera''s cost of $276, therefore total cost is $777 a month. Jody got her colonoscopy in the fall and all was clear. It''s been clear for last 36 months, no issues. Knows she will pay $1200 for colonoscopy since done annually per above findings.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-14 10:49:39', '2020-01-14 10:53:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045331041', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000042886017', 'Chesney Midcap', NULL, '1-6-20 Wants to sign up for healthsharing. I don''t remember which plan we discussed. But, PSDHC is $629/$1500 IUA or PDHC is $779/$1500 IUA which still looks cheaper than with C4.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-06 12:33:53', '2020-01-06 12:33:53'),
