  ('zcrm_1579374000043400013', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000043398015', 'Jessica Romer', NULL, '11-14-19 Jessica is 35 with Lyme disease. Has Kaiser at $155 mo through employer. But, Kaiser won''t recognize and treat Lyme at all. Took 1 year to diagnose bc they don''t believe it''s a disease to treat. She''s working with Dr. Kinderlehrer who''s showing as internal medicine and charges $400 hr now! He''s not accepting ins and is now working out of house and no longer has website. Takes 4 meds that prices out on GoodRX. Also goes to Sound Clinic for PCP but does osteopathic visits with Dr. Lindsay Nailer. I need to find out how osteopathic visit is handled with Redirect.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-14 12:44:14', '2019-11-14 12:44:14'),
