  ('zcrm_1579374000043338039', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000043329055', 'Jonathan Brown', NULL, '11-13-19 Jonathan is 62 and wife 63. Healthy mostly. But Jonathan has high choiesterol and sleep apnea, wife has high blood pressure and high cholesterol, all well managed. Looking at Molina for $1153 and $8300 ded. This is only slightly lower price but better protection with IUA. He wants PDHC and Financial Commentary to read. Looking at all other health shares but told him to steer clear or Aliera and also heard bad things about Altrua and LHS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-13 19:25:12', '2019-11-13 19:26:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043338034', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000043329040', 'Jennie Baccante', NULL, '11-13-19 Jennie is 42, husband is 61, daughter is 12. They are from Canada and used to universal healthcare.  Not used to prices here. But, may stick with Canada''s option for 1 more year until Jan. 2021 at least for husband. He has A-Fib, irregular heartbeat, uses C-pap and has sleep apnea. Told her to stay put with him and then look for traditional ins after that. Priced options for her and daughter for PSDHC and PDHC. Their option on the marketplace is around $916 for the cheapest option for family with high ded and mop. Jennie and daughter are healthy. Live in NM now and may officially become Americans in 2021.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-13 19:16:00', '2019-11-13 19:16:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043258008', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000042886034', 'Callie Vardal', NULL, '11-12-19 They want to stay with trad ins bc of husbands health issues. Don''t want to move rest of family to MCS. Too nervous. Prefer Bright Health for around $1200 and doesn''t want my help. Nice but super leery and scared. Not worth convincing her. Thought she wanted this for one month. Told her not a short term solution.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-12 10:33:33', '2019-11-12 10:33:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043091013', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000043096024', 'Wil Marquardt', NULL, 'Wil is 59 and Dennis is 55. Wil turns 60 next Oct 2020. But, explained the price benefit of joining separately for cost savings once turns 60. He gets it. He left his job in March and went onto Dennis'' plan. Dennis left job in Sept and now they are on Cobra for $1200+ mo which includes medical, dental and vision. Told him to possibly keep dental and vision if he can and it looks worthwhile. Mostly healthy, no tobacco. Meds for Wil only. Zoloft and hyperthyroidism and takes synthroid and levothyroxine. PDHC with Redirect is best! He will discuss with Dennis and get back to me. Knows deadlines and may want Dec. or Jan. start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-07 14:54:33', '2019-11-07 14:54:33'),
