  ('zcrm_1579374000020452008', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000020454001', 'Darrell Sandlin', NULL, '7-19-18 They have Cobra which is running out end of Aug. Full cost is $2000+. They don''t seem to understand how terrible market is for individuals. Looking at Aliera and Solidarity as well. "Pretty Good Health" according to Darrell. He just had a hip surgery 1 week ago! He had a torn meniscus recently and had ortho surgery and also mentioned some cosmetic surgery. They understand the pre-x clause as I was pretty adamant about it. They also want to push the envelope and possibly go without coverage for 60-90 days. Darrell already did his colonoscopy. Told them about the co-pay network also but seem to think they won''t need to go to doctor beyond wellness visit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-19 15:45:02', '2018-07-19 15:45:02'),
