  ('zcrm_1579374000020421003', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000020420001', 'Jules Marie', NULL, '7-19-18 She just got bumped off of Medicaid bc filed that she''s making $2600 a month. BUT, that''s before her expenses, so it''s not accurate. She has to show her estimated expenses which will bring her income down to about $22K for 2018. She needs to let Medicaid know and then she should get about a $787 APTC. I mentioned a Cigna or Bright Health Plan. But, she''s also worried about her Advair med for asthma because it costs about $320 on Goodrx. Told her to get generic and then it will be affordable. She will call me when she has a better handle on her income and has the APTC to move forward. She is longer panicking. Her business is growing quickly and she didn''t have time to deal with this. But, now she has a grasp on what to do and that it won''t break her cost wise.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-19 12:46:54', '2018-07-19 12:46:54'),
