  ('zcrm_1579374000018366003', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000018365001', 'Creighton (Clay) Clingan', NULL, '6-13-18 Clay is 44 and may be separating from wife very soon. They are on her work plan but paying over $1000 every 2 weeks for him and his 23 yr old daughter. Wife gets her for free. He works out with Nick. No pre-x and is a body builder and daughter x-gymnast and works out with same coach in gym still. He''s low on testosterone ans was paying $18 1x per week. Now doing it on his own for $3 but thinks he needs to get labs done every 6 weeks to make sure he stays within guidelines for competing. Daughter is into naturopathic health as PT and works next to acupuncturists and those doing cupping, herbs, etc. His workout partner''s wife is an MD and recently healed herself from stage 4 cancer with naturopathic solutions! She even went down to Mexico for some treatment. Almost got her license taken away bc they wanted her doing traditional chemo and such and she wasn''t willing to do so! Clay is candidate for ReDirect Health is he can get his labs and testosterone done with a PCP. He doesn''t want to have to pay the $1500 IUA for this little stuff. So, ReDirect may be perfect!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-13 11:54:19', '2018-06-13 11:54:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017933065', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000017932121', 'Shelby Hawkins', NULL, '6-5-18 Met Shelby (and Bonnie, no longer together) on McNamara Hut trip in Aspen this winter with Joe. He connected to me via Joe on FB. He had back surgery 4-5 years ago, so non-issue. No pre-x, no meds. He''s starting his own home care and hospice business now. He''s considering 2 daughter to include in plan or to keep on ex wife''s plan. He''s not sure yet. But, he''s psyched to join even if on his own. Showed him the new ACCESS HEP Association plan. He also wants to view dental and vision. Was on Medicaid for 4-5 years and hasn''t received any notice that he''s been kicked off but wants to get ahead of it in case he does. Daughters are 8 1/2 and 11 as of July 13th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-05 20:50:38', '2018-06-05 20:56:08'),
