  ('zcrm_1579374000017211041', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000014932001', 'Ashley Henry', NULL, '5-18-18 Included her on list of clients to be grandfathered in.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-18 14:43:11', '2018-05-18 14:43:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017085019', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000017082019', 'Gregg Eisenberg', NULL, '5-15-18 Gregg is healthy but has a thyroid issue and wants to know if blood tests are covered under wellness. Thinks he hasn''t paid through Kaiser for these but seems to do them more often than for wellness. Might do them every 3-4 months which indicates it''s probably not coded as wellness for that. He will look for a new Dr. who will consider it as part of wellness, if possible. He''s only paying $400 a month with Kaiser now at age 54. He does not smoke or use tobacco and he mountain bike rides, etc. He wanted to meet in person to help compare to traditional insurance. Told him to read my email first which will help him to understand it. He knows of May 18th deadline to be grandfathered into plan with these prices.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-15 14:52:10', '2018-05-15 14:53:06'),
