  ('zcrm_1579374000015884008', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000015883025', 'Mark Cornett', NULL, '4-13-18 He''s 58 in CA and paying $680 a month for Anthem BCBS Silver plan. Wife is on Humana with Medicare. He''s fairly healthy but has a-fib diagnosed since he was 17. It''s well controlled with meds. I made the Pre-x clause very clear to him. He''s not on blood thinners or anything like that. Was planning to set up a savings account for medical expenses so likes the idea of HSA. We''ll reconvene on Monday to answer further questions and enroll if it makes sense for him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-13 15:50:36', '2018-04-13 15:50:36'),
