  ('zcrm_1579374000015337003', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000015335005', 'Michael Rose', NULL, '4-3-18 Mike-39, wife-31 and 9 mo, old son live in VA 6 months and Virgin Islands 6 months of the year. Have Aliera right now and wife got spider bite and the are now telling him he''s out of the network and no coverage. They told her to go to ER which is expensive. They are healthy, no pre-x, might want to have another child soon. Has several friends and co-workers who live in islands and have no options. He''s psyched to share this if he chooses this route. Set up 2nd appt. for Thursday, April 5th to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-03 12:02:01', '2018-04-03 12:02:01'),
