  ('zcrm_1579374000014961003', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000013429028', 'Sophia Rickard', NULL, '3-22-18 She wanted to ask about how to get lab work done and prescriptions. I told her that''s what the Concierge will help her with for pricing on both. She asked is genetic counseling is included and I told her best to get that done now before she switches. She was considering April 1 start date but missed that deadline. She might wait an entire year more since that will make it past the 36 months in remission and then pre-x is not an issue. She''s pondering.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-22 09:09:15', '2018-03-22 09:09:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014930008', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000014932001', 'Ashley Henry', NULL, '3-21-18 Ashley and family of 4 are only paying $831 with UHC for plan that''s been grandfathered in since 2008, BUT it doesn''t cover maternity and sounds like thinking of having another baby. Asked about home births and midwifes. Both children were done this way and currently IUA is waived entirely for home births! She might want to wait until Aug. 1st to start bc of diverticulitis surgery in 2014 and 2015. Mid-July was completion of visits for that. She has Hashimotos thyroid problem but uses Dr. Robin Dickinson for all of those visits. That Dr. monitors her thyroid. Everyone else in family is healthy and really only goes to Dr. for annual wellness visits. She was hoping the price was going to be cheaper since looking at LHS and other which are cheaper. Told her to be careful bc of the Guidelines which are limiting. She going to discuss it with her husband and decide and let me know. I told her we will have a new MEC+ to pair since has a DPC and also let her know the price might be slightly different AND let her know the sooner the better so the guidelines don''t change. Dr. Scot Graham and Dr. Kono in network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-21 11:17:46', '2018-03-21 11:37:18'),
