  ('zcrm_1579374000011005003', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000011004075', 'Julia Zerance', NULL, '11-20-17 Healthy, husband is covered through work. Julia''s price is going from $400 to $800 this year as an individual. She had pre-cancerous polyps removed last year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2017-11-20 09:12:09', '2017-11-20 09:12:09'),
