  ('zcrm_1579374000182845299', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177095006', 'Karly Anderson', '3/20/2026', 'Spoke to Karly she was requesting to do a preliminary search for the best pricing for Lo Loestrin FE. On rx valet it was $219 we found on good rx there was a coupon for $99 that I had sent her via email .Will follow up to ensure it went well...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-20 13:45:43', '2026-03-20 13:45:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182853150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163494009', 'Katherine Totten', NULL, '3-20-26 Kate got a new job with benefits. I sent her the cancellation form to complete ASAP before billing. But, I let her know they will reimburse her if it''s not completed within the 15 when we talked. She will complete it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-20 13:45:20', '2026-03-20 13:45:20'),
