  ('zcrm_1579374000182907152', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024130', 'Julie Meko', NULL, 'Wendy was not available so member called me back wanting to change her membership to just "Emergency".  I clarified that that would be the Care Plus (Medical Cost Sharing).  I sent out the link and directed her to fill out right now.  Member called back and I had to step her thru the filling out for the form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-20 13:24:12', '2026-03-20 13:24:12'),
