  ('zcrm_1579374000182846203', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176658001', 'Ivan Myers', NULL, '3/20/26<br>member called to get some providers info for a in network mammogram center. sent her the info on a search i performed for her zip code and also sent her the link to update her email as requested.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-20 13:01:40', '2026-03-20 13:01:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182906229', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182865025', 'Ana Maria Ramirez Lopez', NULL, 'Sent an email to Member &amp; Advisor with a Member Update form to add her social security number to the file, as it was missing from the application. Member submitted Member Update form with her social.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-20 12:58:50', '2026-03-20 13:09:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182845291', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153932019', 'Cora Reynolds', '3/20/2026', 'Cora called in wondering about a referral she had from a telehealth provider months ago that she never used.I spoke to telehealth about it,they informed me and I relayed this information to Cora that she would need to make a new PCP appointment to get the referall...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-20 12:51:31', '2026-03-20 12:51:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182846198', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178970004', 'Willow Ruth', NULL, '3/20/26<br>helped member on sales IQ by sending her the welcome call schedule link after they requested it.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-20 12:50:18', '2026-03-20 12:50:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182907127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177067041', 'Marco Cruz-Gasca', NULL, 'Member called in and asked if he could put his membership "on hold".  I said no so he will be cancelling.  I will send him the cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-20 12:45:14', '2026-03-20 12:45:14'),
