  ('zcrm_1579374000182845286', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154953001', 'David Byrne', '3/20/2026', 'followed up with Lindsey about the issues she was having logging into Zion with their emails. I assured her everything had been fixed on my end and before we start a three way call if she could try logging into Zion one last time since it had been a little while. She confirmed she was able to get into her account now and everything was fixed..r.c', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-20 12:43:30', '2026-03-20 13:23:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182846173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176543037', 'Hunter Christensen', NULL, '3/20/26<br>member reached out through email to find out what to do with a bill she received for a childs well visit. Let her know to try and get the provider to mail the bill in to ARM but if they will not just get a copy of the itemized bills with the CPT codes on it and mail it to ARM for payment. Also let her know to reach out if she needs assistance with that. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-20 12:37:33', '2026-03-20 12:37:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182907122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024130', 'Julie Meko', NULL, 'Member called in and asked me to "explain her membership" to her.  She said that she only used this once.  I explained the differences between Preventative &amp; Injury/Illness, the IUA, presenting as cash pay etc.  Member said that she would like to go to just "Emergency" (Medical Cost Sharing).  I then directed her to Wendy and advised her of the Change Deadline later today.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-20 12:33:21', '2026-03-20 12:33:21'),
