  ('zcrm_1579374000182845266', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176242025', 'Keith Nadon', '3/20/2026', 'Called and left a voicemail for Keith, i also sent an email saying we tried to reach him: <br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Keith, </span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">I hope all is well; we tried to reach you looks like we may have caught you at a bad time. If you need assistance feel free to give us a call back or send an email!....rc</span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-20 11:55:03', '2026-03-20 11:56:41'),
