  ('zcrm_1579374000182718063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175880017', 'Agnes Eide', NULL, '3/18/26<br>Husband called to see what documentation he should use for his sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 09:58:29', '2026-03-18 09:58:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182719096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026291119', 'Lesley Erb', NULL, '3/18/26<br>Lesley called to find out what price we could get Zepbound for. she ended up saying she found it for around the same price i was quoting her so she will attempt to use a compounding pharmacy to see if they could provide it for cheaper. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 09:50:33', '2026-03-18 09:50:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174988022', 'Kristi Laws', '3/18/2026', 'Spoke with Krisiti about a referral she had from the telehealth provider but the provider was not answering her to gt it sent out, I spoke with Cierra at lyric about the situation and she let me know that provider specifically they "don''t know what''s going on he hasn''t answered anyone this week." Cierra relayed the message to Kristi that she would need to make another primary care appointment to have that provider send the referral over to where she wanted to go. set follow up task for next week...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 09:21:26', '2026-03-18 09:33:31'),
