  ('zcrm_1579374000182761076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153932002', 'James LeVeque', NULL, 'Concierge sent a request via Teams chat to email member 1095-C. I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-18 09:19:32', '2026-03-18 09:19:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174989009', 'Lindsey Warren', '3/18/2026', 'Spoke with Lindsey about the PHCS network list, we did a preliminary search for family medicine doctors in her area, she is in rural Vermont so there was a few options but she let me know she is going to call then and make an appointment...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 09:17:28', '2026-03-18 09:17:28'),
