  ('zcrm_1579374000182774001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179715002', 'Vincent Troiano', NULL, '03.18.26 - Spoke to Suzanne regarding her concern of the physician being mislabeled as a breast surgeon, who then referred to a breast surgeon. Told her that it is up to the practice how the doctors are categorized and we do not have control over the Multiplan website, advised to contact the practice and that they should have notified her at booking that the doctor is not what she is looking for. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-18 09:04:22', '2026-03-18 09:04:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182760125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178455005', 'Katharine Rushton', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent an email to reschedule the welcome call. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 09:04:17', '2026-03-18 09:04:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182718053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153932002', 'James LeVeque', NULL, '3/18/26<br>Requested 1095 C AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 08:58:06', '2026-03-18 08:58:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149209292', 'Brenda Kuehn', '3/18/2026', 'Spoke to Brenda about a sharing request and needing to get logged into the Zion portal, she told me she was busy and if there was someone she could call. I gave her the Zion number to get the activation I said if you run into issues when you have time please call us back that way we can initate a three way call..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 08:57:45', '2026-03-18 09:18:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175761017', 'Jeffrey Thompson', '3/18/2026', 'Spoke to Jeffrey about mail order, I let him know it typically does take 10-14 days for them to receive the e scribe and what he would need to do is give the 855 (rx) number a call to check the status on that e scribe from his provider..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 08:48:06', '2026-03-18 08:48:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182766013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation eff 4/26 because they moved and got employer benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-18 08:36:21', '2026-03-18 08:36:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182761068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138128002', 'Justin Caid', NULL, 'Concierge requested via Teams chat for 1095-C to be emailed to member &amp; spouse email.  I will process.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-18 08:22:46', '2026-03-18 08:23:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692197', 'Scott Ritterbuck', '3/18/2026', 'Spoke with Scott about getting logged into the MPB app which we were able to successfully do, then we spoke about how telehealth works and walked him through the process of scheduling an appointment. After the call, I sent Scott an email with the instructions on how to operate the PHCS network list with step by step instructions for when he wants to schedule an annual wellness appointment...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 08:00:46', '2026-03-18 08:00:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182766003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181140002', 'Christopher Underwood', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 4/26 after less than 1 month on the membership citing the fact that "the plan is not going to work for me like I hoped".  He says that his new membership has "Direct Primary Care".  So we tried to get in touch with Whitney Kline, the healthcare advisor in the hopes that she could possibly save this by re-selling the member the Direct Membership.  But as usual sh was unreachable after multiple emails vm''s &amp; texts.  I will process member''s cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-18 08:00:11', '2026-03-18 08:00:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178732007', 'Cheryl Zimmerman', '3/18/2026', 'Spoke with Cheryl about sick visits to a provider saying they do become an out of pocket expense, you have access to the telehealth PCP''s at no cost, and they can prescribe antibiotics. She was aware of that but wanted to go in person. I also sent her the full list of preventive services from <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://healthcare.gov/"><u>healthcare.gov</u></a> that way she could look as well...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 07:58:23', '2026-03-18 07:58:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182719091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176632007', 'Robert Baty', NULL, '3/18/26<br>re sent the welcome packet email due to member stating they did not receive it. Let them know it is not really a packet and more of a letter with a quick reference guide. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 07:49:26', '2026-03-18 07:49:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182718048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047033001', 'Robert Meyerson', NULL, '3/18/26<br>Spoke with Laura about how to use her plan and explained what is eligible for sharing, i advised her to utilize the telehealth services AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 07:48:12', '2026-03-18 07:48:12'),
