  ('zcrm_1579374000182728059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173934001', 'Katelyn Smith', '3/18/2026', 'Spoke with Katelyn about getting logged into Sedera, Initiated a three way call with them that way they could properly assist her getting logged in and answer specific questions about a possible upcoming surgery. The representative at Sedera was able to get her logged in and answer the questions, she is all set...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 07:01:10', '2026-03-18 07:01:10'),
