  ('zcrm_1579374000182721029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041659570', 'Jane Pulliam', NULL, '3-17-26 Jane used to be on PSDHC and she wanted to re-enroll. We looked at her C4 option which was going to cost over $1K for just her since Drake is moving to Medicare for April 1st. So, that was not going to work for them. They were only paying $4. Premium HSA is closest to what she used to have and is the most affordable. She chose $1500/$336 and I waived the $100 since she was a member previously. I forgot to quote her the new rates for June. I''ll call her back. Done, I let her know it will be $357/$1500 for May 20th billing for June, 2026. No problem!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-17 15:44:57', '2026-03-17 15:47:12'),
