  ('zcrm_1579374000182721011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, '3-17-26 Jonathan called to cancel bc they moved to UT and got a new job with benefits that started on March 1st.  His wife has an open cancer Need. I let him know she will want to speak with her Needs Coordinator to make sure she has everything submitted and agreed upon as shareable before she cancels.  I let him know to cancel by March 19th to avoid getting billed on the 20th or by March 30th and would have to be reimbursed for April''s payment at that point. He knows they will have to start over with a deductible on his employers plan. I will send him the cancellation form link and he will proceed. He was not in front of the computer.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-17 15:11:10', '2026-03-17 15:11:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038052', 'Brian Walsh', '3/17/2026', 'Spoke with Brian about how to collect bills for a "possible" upcoming surgical cost.Luckily it does not sound like Cancer and hopeful the imaging comes back clear.  (If) he has it done he is going to follow up with us and ask for assistance, but he was guided in the right direction of gathering all the itemized bills for anything that exceeds his IUA amount of $1250 and we can submit for sharing...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 14:38:43', '2026-03-18 10:25:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159250002', 'Lexi Baldwin', '3/17/2026', 'Spoke with Lexi about missing the call from the telehealth provider, I got her transferred over to lyric for further assistance...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 14:35:11', '2026-03-17 14:35:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182721006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182741002', 'Megan Salmon', NULL, '3-17-26 Megan and Steve decided to go with Care+. They can pay for the entire year with Healthy Connections and that gives them 3 in person doctor visits that they can use for their wellness needs. She realizes the self-pay for a mammogram should be less than $500 and likely much less. They can upgrade to include wellness at a later date if they want to add have some self-employment income at the time. She also knows her gyno exam will be cash pay and no reimbursement. Care+ $668/$1250 and $125/$25. They also referred Anne Hamill to me. I let them know about the referral program. One of them has a meniscus issue, Steve I think, and is fine if he has to pay for surgery for that since it will still be less than if they paid for ACA all year. He doesn''t currently need anything to be done for the meniscus. They are good to go for April 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-17 14:34:33', '2026-03-17 14:34:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182742001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177179001', 'Mary Akin', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 5018 Question : I was chatting with Ace and was disconnected…I am in need of copies of my paid invoices to present to my RHRA to be reimbursed for my monthly premiums. And possibly a schedule of payments to be made in the future', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-17 14:31:28', '2026-03-17 14:31:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182726032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182741002', 'Megan Salmon', 'Member & Sp $1250 IUA Care +', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-17 14:27:27', '2026-03-17 14:27:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133541002', 'Amber Cannon', '3/17/2026', 'Called Amber back, no answer. Mailbox is full...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 14:25:07', '2026-03-17 14:25:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105906002', 'Derick Brooks', '3/17/2026', 'Followed up with Derick via phone call, and we did a three-way call with Zion. I told the representative everything was good on our side him his spouse each have separate emails and the account is fully active. She said she needs to call planstin and confirm it is good on their end along with reach out to her admin team to make sure the emails are squared away for login purposes. I then confirmed with Aba everything is good on our end, which the Zion rep did confirm and it was more of a file issue on their end at this point. She (Eden) said she would be following up with Derick specifically once she got answers, I  have scheduled a follow up task for later this week to confirm things have been fixed or are actively working towards that....RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 14:21:18', '2026-03-17 14:21:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182736001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177179001', 'Mary Akin', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 5017 Question : I am in need of a statement of sorts showing how much I am paying each month in order to be reimbursed for my premiums from my RHRA…Can you help me?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-17 14:20:50', '2026-03-17 14:20:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105906002', 'Derick Brooks', '3/16/2026', 'Spoke to Derick about his account that was inactivated on Feb 28th and reactivated on March 1st, and Zion deemed his claim ineligible because they thought he was a smoker. He went to his provider got an addendum and Zion accepted it but the account got all messed up with file transfers...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 14:17:39', '2026-03-17 14:17:39'),
