  ('zcrm_1579374000182719056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129829002', 'James Benvenuto', NULL, '3/17/26<br>Spoke to member on sales IQ about her options for therapy. Explained the virtual benefits and that any in person stuff would be out of pocket. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 12:40:30', '2026-03-17 12:40:30'),
