  ('zcrm_1579374000182721001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', NULL, '3-17-26 Tanya was trying to understand her membership and find ways to lower the cost. She has Medicaid and isn''t sure if she''ll re-qualify after April with her self-employment income. Medicaid paid for everything for her since she was recently diagnosed with early stage breast cancer. She wants to also treat it with acupuncture and with the help of her naturopath. So, she will keep Care+ and she knows anything alternative MUST be pre-approved. They are not going to share on her ongoing screenings after 6 months. She''s really keeping Care+ purely for the alternative care options. It doesn''t make sense for her to change her IUA from $1250 to $2500 since she already opened her sharing request in Nov. 2025. She will leave everything as is for this year and evaluate again next year. Her income might be around $30K before subtracting expenses. So, she will likely be able to qualify again for Medicaid in 2026. She''ll get her traditional care handled by Medicaid and alternative hopefully shared via Care+.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-17 12:31:24', '2026-03-17 12:31:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182718001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175165052', 'Christopher Bramley', NULL, '3/17/26<br>Transfered to lyric AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 12:24:32', '2026-03-17 12:24:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182704013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111229002', 'Kenneth Baugh', NULL, '3/17/26<br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Explained MCS, cash pay patient, IUA, the need must be in the guidelines and medical necessary, and submission process.  Will set f/u task and remember to ask if arthritis treatment helped/are you feeling better.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">AJ</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 11:50:46', '2026-03-18 11:07:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182704001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176632007', 'Robert Baty', NULL, '<p style="background-color:transparent;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;">3/17/26: member reached out through sales IQ to get their ID cards. Let them know they should get them soon.They also requested proof of membership letters</span></p><p style="background-color:transparent;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;">AJ </span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 11:45:39', '2026-03-17 11:47:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182656017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174259001', 'James Sheehan', NULL, '3/17/26<span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">: Member needed education on how to utilize their benefits. </span><br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;"><p style="background-color:transparent;display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Explained MCS, cash pay patient, IUA, the need must be in the guidelines and medical necessary, and submission process. </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;"><p style="background-color:transparent;display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Explained preventive care - she needed diagnostic so i explained the difference</span></p></li></ul><p style="background-color:transparent;display:block;margin-inline-start:24px;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;"><br></span></p><p style="background-color:transparent;display:block;margin-inline-start:24px;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;">AJ</span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 11:41:21', '2026-03-17 11:41:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182660057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172698008', 'Teresa Hubbard', '3/17/2026', '<p style="background-color:transparent;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;"> Member Teresa needed education on how to utilize their benefits. </span></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;margin-inline-start:24px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Explained Telehealth: urgent care, primary care, mental health, pet care, RXValetand benefits card....rc</span></p></li></ul>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 11:39:20', '2026-03-17 11:39:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182660052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', '3/17/2026', 'Jatin missed a call from the telehealth department, I called him back to get him transferred over to lyric for further assistance...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 11:37:03', '2026-03-17 11:37:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182660047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179715002', 'Vincent Troiano', '3/17/2026', 'I spoke to Suzanne about the mammogram she had done. Her OBGYN saw something that she wanted a definitive answer on from the imaging from  a breast surgeon whether it was to be of concern or it was fine. Without consulting with us, she used the PHCS network list to search for a "Breast Surgeon" in her area. A surgeon in her area did pop up and he treated her and billed her but let her know due to him not specifically being a breast surgeon he was not totally sure and she needed to see an actual specialized BS. <br><span><br></span>I told her when it comes to diagnostic (symptom oriented) incidents stemming from her OBGYN the network is taken out of the picture and she could''ve gone to any breast surgeon in her area.I also let her know since it was diagnostic at this point it would be an out of pocket expense anyway. I also let her know luckily.. if anything stems from this it could all go towards her a sharing request. She said she understood all of that and appreciated me breaking it down but was misinformed by the website and is blaming us for the mess up and she should not be responsible for the bill, and called the situation she was in unsatisfactory with the website. <br><span><br></span>At that point she requested the situation be escalated to management for further assistance, Julia is out of the office today I will relay the message on Wednesday...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 11:34:27', '2026-03-17 11:46:13'),
