  ('zcrm_1579374000173343011', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000151107254', 'Lauren McGregor', NULL, '11-11-25 Lauren is interested in Secure HSA but is comparing to ACA. She wants skin check, dental cleanings and vision screening. I let her know that''s not included in ACA plans or MCS. Now I''m clarifying again with Darrel if Finray Solar is paying the full cost of MCS. If so, then I think Lauren will go with MCS.<br>UPDATE Finray Solar will contribute $100 towards Secure HSA, so her cost will be $226/$1250. I called her back and let her know. She will decide soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-11 12:19:55', '2025-11-11 12:22:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000173260139', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000173219031', 'Audrey Dunn', NULL, '11-10-25 Sent email and left vm to meet tomorrow. Hopefully she responds in time or we will have to pick another time. She was referred by Patrick Murphy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-11-10 17:07:45', '2025-11-10 17:07:45'),
