  ('zcrm_1579374000171057001', 'lead', 'zcrm_1579374000169948001', 'Tiffany Exstrom', NULL, '9-22-25 Tiffany and Dudley are ready to move forward. They fully understand the pre-x clause. Dudley understands his knee is pre-x and the injections will likely be deemed as a maintenance medication, not shareable since it''s not working towards resolution only management. Tiffany might possibly work an extra month or two and keep her benefits covered through her employer. She''s going to find out if that is a real possibility or not. They will get back to me. They also understand I can help with all options, including ACA plans and other solutions available. They will call me as soon as they decide on a start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-09-22 11:34:36', '2025-09-22 11:34:36'),
