  ('zcrm_1579374000182845219', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092142002', 'Austin Pitts', '3/20/2026', 'Spoke to Austin about annual wellness exam with a PCP in his area, I let him know with his membership it is an out of pocket expense, however what I did is emailed him a list of PCP;s from Zoc Doc in his area for him to look at...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-20 07:45:59', '2026-03-20 07:45:59'),
