  ('zcrm_1579374000182845214', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155308040', 'Natalie Lawlor', '3/19/2026', 'Emailed Natalie instructions for the change form how to add/remove children.. <br><ol style="list-style-type:decimal;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=" display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">On the change form, fill out the top and click "Zion health share" </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=" display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">It will prompt you with "qualifying life event" just hit other </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=" display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Type of change hit Add/Remove child</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=" display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">In the comment box at the bottom you can add specifics</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=" display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Hit submit ...RC</span></p></li></ol>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-20 07:38:28', '2026-03-20 07:38:28'),
