  ('zcrm_1579374000182907001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177162004', 'Corinne Eisenman', NULL, 'Member left VM after hours asking how to add her spouse to the membership.  I will send her the link to the Change Form &amp; contact her.  Member submitted Change Form.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-20 06:56:57', '2026-03-20 07:30:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182906011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182888018', 'Michelle Kellond', 'Member & Fam $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-20 06:53:21', '2026-03-20 06:53:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182906001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182412135', 'Thomas Sigman', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Premium Care', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-20 06:46:13', '2026-03-20 06:46:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182892031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182741002', 'Megan Salmon', NULL, '3-19-26 Megan decided to add their son since they are having a terrible time getting him onto Healthcare.gov. He might qualify for Medicaid and then he''d have both and she''s fine with that. That could cover his pre-x. If he doesn''t qualify then they have a very high ded and mop. So, it''s worth adding him to their membership for April 1st as well. She completed the form.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-19 17:28:41', '2026-03-19 17:28:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182892001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '3-19-26 Michael called to verify that Zion will truly pay for his Need now that the cost will be much higher. He''s actually been thrilled with MPB so far by helping with getting his meds for free or for $25 and they were expensive meds. He had to hop off quickly and will call me back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-19 15:23:33', '2026-03-19 15:23:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182846094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175165052', 'Christopher Bramley', NULL, '3/19/26<br>answered members email asking what to do with bills for some bloodwork he has gotten done. Walked him through where to submit and how to start a need with Sedera. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 14:59:11', '2026-03-19 14:59:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182845203', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169952002', 'Camilla Vetere', '3/19/2026', 'Spoke to Camilla about a preventive services and diagnostic v. preventive blood work...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 14:57:11', '2026-03-19 15:06:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182845198', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173398002', 'Dave Carpenter', '3/19/2026', 'Spoke to Kim Carpenter about how Alternative therapy works and how pre membership conditions work stated straight from guidelines: Pre-membership medical conditions have a phase-in period wherein sharing is limited.<br>Starting from the membership start date, there is a one-year waiting period before pre membership medical conditions are eligible for sharing. After the waiting period, the amount<br>eligible for sharing increases with each membership year.<br>Amounts eligible for sharing for pre-membership medical conditions:<br>• Year One: $0 (waiting period)<br>• Year Two: $25,000 maximum per sharing request<br>• Year Three: $50,000 maximum per sharing request<br>• Year Four: $125,000 maximum per sharing request<br><span><br></span>When prescribed and performed by a licensed medical professional for a specific illness,<br>injury, or disease to the musculoskeletal, and related to an eligible sharing request, expenses<br>for therapeutic treatments are eligible for sharing up to either a maximum shareable amount<br>of $7,500, or a maximum total of 35 treatments.....RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 14:54:44', '2026-03-19 14:54:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182844114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, '3/19/26<br>Adam wanted to know where to submit the bill for reimbursement  AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 14:47:51', '2026-03-19 14:47:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182846089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129915002', 'Jigish Patel', NULL, '3/19/26<br>member called to request physical ID cards. Sent in request to ARM to send him two new ones. Also gave him guidance to the ones in the app and let him know that the bill he has needs to be sent to ARM for payment. he received a copy but i do not see a copy in the ARM portal so i guided him to get the provider to send it in or we can show him where to amil it if the provider will not send it. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 14:44:39', '2026-03-19 14:44:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182844109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076023', 'Amie Brown', NULL, '3/19/26<br>Sent txt to follow up on sharing request AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 14:30:11', '2026-03-19 14:30:11'),
