  ('zcrm_1579374000182846032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159677037', 'Stacy Otis', NULL, '3/19/26<br>Stacy called to get assistance with a colonoscopy provider trying to make her pay up front for her colo. Lori from ARM is going to call the provider and try and convince them to honor their contract and accept the info from ARM to send the bill in for payment. will follow up when i hear back from Lori.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 13:03:58', '2026-03-19 13:03:58'),
