  ('zcrm_1579374000182846009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180199004', 'Joshua Hatton', NULL, '3/19/26<br>spoke with Martina about her issues with the Zion portal. The info is still redacted and she can not get her account activated in Zion portal until they fix the issues on their end. They told MArtina they would call her back when they get it fixed and they also let her know she can call to start a share request if something happens in the meantime. I will follow up in a week to make sure they are taking care of what they need to. especially since Martina specifically mentioned i am the only one who follows up with her and she really likes the customer service here at MPB!<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 12:14:50', '2026-03-19 12:14:50'),
