  ('zcrm_1579374000182845160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', '3/19/2026', 'Spoke to Tanya and let her know the account with Zion is all fixed, if she still see''s preventive on her end to refresh the page. I also spoke to her about alternative care as well. I let her know the best way to go about it moving forward is to get pre-approval from Zion before paying for anything and having services done. She had also asked about limited approval with her request, I let her know in that regard due to HIPPA I would not be to see specifics with her sharing request, however she can reach out to her sharing / need coordinator for further assistance..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 11:52:19', '2026-03-19 11:52:19'),
