  ('zcrm_1579374000182854012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117877002', 'Angela M Gutierrez', NULL, '03.19.26:  I called Sergio again at 323-554-1116 and I got a message that this number is no longer in service. I emailed Sergio again to let him know I''m trying to reach him re: enrollment for Angela &amp; Alfredo. I mentioned the phone nunber on his email is not working. Asked him to let me know the status of their request to enroll in the CARE PLUS plan. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2026-03-19 09:46:44', '2026-03-19 09:46:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182845076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101280089', 'Jack Taylor', '3/19/2026', 'Spoke to Jack again, he was very frustrated because lyric called him late last night to cancel his appointment. He is a delivery driver for a big company they are paid by the day he can just step away for an appointment so he took the whole day off and now has no appointment. <br><br>I called lyric back on his behalf explaining the situation and they had stated since it was a PCP appointment they can have longer wait times. I expressed the frustration he was having and the urgency of the matter. Was told to have him go through the portal to schedule a new one. <br><span><br></span>Escalated the situation to Julia to see if there is anything to be done...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 09:39:51', '2026-03-19 10:09:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182854007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117877002', 'Angela M Gutierrez', NULL, '03.18.26:  Emailed Sergio to ask if Angela and Alfredo want to enroll for April 1 and reminded him of due date of 3/20 to enroll. Tried to call Sergio but did not get access.  JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2026-03-19 09:34:46', '2026-03-19 09:34:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182848001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176454001', 'Jason Churchwell', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 5020 Question : I need to mail in my children’s well visit receipt receipts to get reimbursed. I need to know what address to send it to.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-19 09:23:59', '2026-03-19 09:23:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182846001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176220021', 'Kara Nevin', NULL, '3/19/26<br>Member called having trouble setting an appointment with the telehealth. She was able to get on the desktop and make an appointment. the issue was with the app on the phone. Will let IT know about the issues for the future.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 09:16:23', '2026-03-19 09:16:37'),
