  ('zcrm_1579374000182833006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176632007', 'Robert Baty', NULL, '3/19/26<br>Attached proof of membership letter to email as requested by member<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 08:18:28', '2026-03-19 08:18:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182813024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107450016', 'Tammy Rossi', '3/19/2026', 'Spoke to Tammy about needing a prescription refill, which I directed her to telehealth. We also spoke about diagnostic labs she had done for her hyperthyroid and I let her know that would be an out of pocket expense. However, if anything were to come of it with imaging etc... they could go towards and IUA sharing request...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 08:17:26', '2026-03-19 08:17:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182833001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111395009', 'Eric Hove', NULL, '3/19/26<br>responded to members email trying to find receipt for medications ordered through us and our website. Gave her the number to rx valet in case that is where she ordered them and let her know if she is talking about the supplements or somethign else to tell us so we can help her. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 08:14:01', '2026-03-19 08:14:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182813019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154678003', 'Derek Friday', '3/18/2026', 'Derek emailed back: <br><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">The membership is extremely difficult to navigate and, frankly, feels misleading.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">Since you recommended that I see this specific doctor, it should have been clearly communicated upfront that any bloodwork needed to be coordinated in advance to receive coverage or discounted pricing. That is a critical detail.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);">I emailed: </span><br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">I understand your frustration it is different than traditional health insurance so there is a tendency to have a bit of confusion. I''m sorry this experience has felt unclear and disappointing. My colleagues have tried to follow up and assist your multiple times, but it appears they weren''t able to get in contact. </span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">You’re absolutely right; that coordination is a critical part of how the membership works, especially when it comes to services like bloodwork.  Additional services still need to be arranged through us in advance so we can direct you to the appropriate facilities and secure the best available pricing. </span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">However, if any additional eligible medical expenses result and your total costs exceed your Initial Unshareable Amount (IUA) of $1,500, those expenses may be eligible for consideration through a sharing request.</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">We certainly don’t want this to feel misleading, and your feedback is important. In the meantime, we are here to help coordinate any future services so you can fully benefit from the membership.....rc </span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 08:12:14', '2026-03-19 08:12:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182811019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178939004', 'Jayme Carlton', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 4/26 due to financial reasons.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-19 08:01:14', '2026-03-19 08:01:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182814033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182824002', 'Timothy Duncan', 'Additional Dependent/ Child 6', '<p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Ozzie Atwood</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(127, 127, 127);">ID:</span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> 19475429</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(127, 127, 127);">Address:</span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> </span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">2831 South 350 West Vernal, UT 84078</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(127, 127, 127);">Phone:</span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> 385-227-1474 </span><span style="color:rgb(127, 127, 127);">Email:</span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> </span><a style="color:rgb(40, 119, 171);display:inline;background-color:transparent;text-decoration:none;" target="_blank" href="mailto:duncantim17@gmail.com">duncantim17@gmail.com</a></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(127, 127, 127);">Relationship:</span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> Child </span><span style="color:rgb(127, 127, 127);">Date of Birth:</span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> 9/10/2021 </span><span style="color:rgb(127, 127, 127);">Age:</span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> 4 </span><span style="color:rgb(127, 127, 127);">Gender:</span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> F </span><span style="color:rgb(127, 127, 127);">Social Security #:</span>889833156</p>', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-19 07:53:41', '2026-03-19 07:53:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182811011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631112', 'Whitney James', NULL, 'We were notified by Zion that that since this member moved to WA that she could no longer be on the membership.  The member informed Zion that she would be moving to Oregon in the next 2 mos.  Zion has given her 90 days to do that and to be reinstated.  I will cancel her membership and await further direction.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-19 07:50:22', '2026-03-19 07:50:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182814025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182824002', 'Timothy Duncan', 'Member & Fam $1250 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-19 07:47:11', '2026-03-19 07:47:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182813011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175184020', 'Cindy Zacks', '3/19/2026', 'Emailed Cindy about Dermatology and how to upload pictures: <br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">you do have 3 free visits per family - per year. When you access your MPB health app or the member portal through MPB.Health you will see the telehealth tab. </span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><ol style="list-style-type:decimal;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=" display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Click on the telehealth tab, then click on dermatology. </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=" display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Follow the prompts until "What''s the reason for today''s visit" </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=" display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">It will say on top "describe reason(s) and below "Attach Images" </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=" display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Click on add image, you will need a minimum of two. ....RC</span></p></li></ol>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 07:42:01', '2026-03-19 07:42:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182823001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170988008', 'Allyson Karberg', NULL, '3/19/26<br>Assisted Allyson with booking a telehealth app AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 07:38:56', '2026-03-19 07:38:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182813006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176630024', 'Amber Nefzger', '3/19/2026', 'Spoke with Amber on Sales Iq about how to get a dr Appoinment scheduled. I sent her the link to fill out and send back to us that way one of our team members could work on it....rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-19 07:23:37', '2026-03-19 07:42:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182814020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173762019', 'Anthony Langley', NULL, 'Emailed member 1095-C per request from Concierge.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-19 07:23:01', '2026-03-19 07:23:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182817001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176630024', 'Amber Nefzger', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 5019 Question : Good Morning! Can you assist me in scheduling my colonoscopy? I’m in Fargo ND and would prefer Dakota Gastroenterology Clinic.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-19 07:16:42', '2026-03-19 07:16:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182811006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181167004', 'Molly Johnson', NULL, 'Advisor emailed in again re: Welcome Packet.  I let her know that it was re-sent on 3/17 and that the email on file has been blocked and that they would have to change it via the Member Change Form.  I also suggested that the member do their Welcome Call that has not been scheduled as yet.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-19 07:03:35', '2026-03-19 07:03:35'),
