  ('zcrm_1579374000182811001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181167004', 'Molly Johnson', NULL, '3/17/26-received an email from advisor letting me know that member hadn''t received Welcome Packet.  I requested one from Jacobo', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-19 06:53:29', '2026-03-19 06:53:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182797013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', NULL, '3-18-26 Julia let me know Tanya has been contacted about the discrepancy in her account and it''s getting worked on.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-18 17:48:49', '2026-03-18 17:48:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182797008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, '3-18-26 <span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Colton Grabau, is not showing up in Zion''s system. Zion says their account was cancelled as of Feb. 28th which is not true. They are active and paid. The were upgraded to Secure HSA as of 3/1/26. However, Zion thinks they cancelled.  Colton has an open Needs Request from an ER visit and Zion won''t help since they think he''s no longer a member.  He''s worried about the bill getting sent to collections. I let Colton know to pay his $1250 IUA immediately and he''ll have to show proof of that to Zion once his account is fixed. I submitted a ticket for MPB to communicate with Zion showing proof of their active status and simple change to add the MEC for 3-1-26. They are calmed down a bit. They need to know as soon as the account is fixed and Coltan can login to his account via MPB &gt; Zion to proceed with the Sharing Request. He knows of the 6 month limit and wants to make sure he meets all deadlines. </span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-18 17:37:49', '2026-03-18 17:37:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182797003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081107338', 'David Sepac', NULL, '3-18-26 I left Andy a vm to help him cancel but looks like he''s completed the cancellation already.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-18 17:16:02', '2026-03-18 17:16:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728211', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171961019', 'Sonya Mehta', '3/18/2026', 'Spoke to Sonya about her cancelation form. She was brining up certain subjects in matter to refunds and pro rate''s. I was unaware of the answer and she called at 5pm, our billing team was not here. I advised to call back in the morning for further assistance...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 15:04:36', '2026-03-19 08:28:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728199', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176988023', 'Max Dolberg', '3/18/2026', 'Spoke with Max about his telehealth appointment he missed the call, I got him transferred over to lyric for further assistance...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-18 14:55:34', '2026-03-18 14:55:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182728194', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168397002', 'Yvonne Hawkins', '3/18/2026', '<p style="background-color:transparent;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;">Member called inquiring about scheduling their preventive (service). Informed of the PHCS Specific Services network. Checked to see if their selected provider is in network and/or guided towards the MPB APP to conduct a search.  </span></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;margin-inline-start:24px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Informed to present the MPB/ARM card as form of payment.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;margin-inline-start:24px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Informed of balance billing if out of network.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;margin-inline-start:24px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Informed of diagnostic codes not being part of the plan and member would need to opensharingrequest if applicable.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;margin-inline-start:24px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Informed to fill out Custom Quote Request for blood work</span></p></li></ul><p style="background-color:transparent;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;">Member Called in with assistance in finding (provider).  </span></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;"><p style="background-color:transparent;display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Guided to telehealth.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;"><p style="background-color:transparent;display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Member needed to see an in-person provider for (diagnostic) reasons.</span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">
