  ('zcrm_1579374000182544156', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154678003', 'Derek Friday', '3/17/2026', 'Spoke to Derek about blood work he got and reimbursement.... I sent him this email: <br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Unfortunately, once services have already been completed, we are not able to secure the discounted pricing through the membership.</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Additionally, there is no option for reimbursement for bloodwork that was completed outside of the membership pricing process. However, if any eligible medical expenses resulted from those labs and you end up surpassing your Initial Unshareable Amount (IUA) of $1,500, those related expenses could potentially be submitted as part of a sharing request...rc</span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-17 06:52:15', '2026-03-17 06:52:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182617012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182604002', 'Mary Jo Hassan', 'Member & Fam $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-17 06:46:05', '2026-03-17 06:46:05'),
