  ('zcrm_1579374000182584031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182741002', 'Megan Salmon', NULL, '3-16-26 They are leaning towards Care+ since they want Zion and are comfortable with it. They''ve read the ratings as well. They are in Mexico now. They have some global insurance for accidents and they aren''t concerned about issues while they are abroad. They just pay cash and move on.  Waiting for them to return my call for our appt now. Megan is planning to keep their son on his current ins plan bc he had a pelvic issue/accident and they''ve already paid the Ded and he may need more PT. Plus he''s graduating in May and they hope he gets a job with benefits.So, once they talk with their ins person tomorrow, they can move forward with me for ES.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-16 13:09:31', '2026-03-16 15:03:51'),
