  ('zcrm_1579374000182544095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180600007', 'Shelley Staehr', '3/16/2026', 'Shelley called in looking for a specific Advent Health was on the PHCS network using their NPI number. With that number I did confirm they where on the list but she would need to call and verify for making the appointment. I even offered to start a three way call with ARM to confirm what I said after she said "why cant you tell me" I said it is up to the provider / facility when they take themselves in and out of network and sometimes they dont take Themselevs off the list....rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-16 11:35:51', '2026-03-16 11:35:51'),
