  ('zcrm_1579374000182544001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177096001', 'Roger Walker', '3/16/2026', 'Spoke to Roger about his son having abdominal pain and needing to go to Urgent care and what to do if he should use telehealth first or not. I let him know for more emergency situations for abdominal pain they typically are going to refer you to go in person first anyway but you could always try. I also mentioned it will be an out of pocket expense however if anything came from it and it exceeded his IUA he could submit for sharing....rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-16 08:20:40', '2026-03-16 08:20:40'),
