  ('zcrm_1579374000182474112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081146002', 'Lisa Doughty', NULL, '03.16.26 - Sent bill to Rachelle Planstin for consideration. Rachelle stated that she will check with Planstin, but the provider would have to submit the bill, if Planstin denies, then appeal. <br><span><br></span>(Final) Rachelle stated that Planstin paid the bill on 09.05.24 and Lisa is being mailed a copy of the EOB. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-16 08:07:28', '2026-03-18 13:28:39'),
