  ('zcrm_1579374000182462244', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442408', 'Jacquelynn Mariest', '3/16/2026', 'Jacquelynn emailed back saying " I dont have access until 4/1??" I emailed back saying <span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">In regard to having access to the concierge, you still have that now. However, accessing the telehealth that will be effective on 4/1/26 due to file transfers and processing. In the meantime, you have access to us. We can assist in finding the best pricing for labs, procedures, imaging, written prescriptions, and assist in general questions....rc</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-16 07:43:29', '2026-03-16 07:43:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182463240', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171985017', 'Bradley Handlin', NULL, '3/16/26<br>Member called to find out if blood work would be covered. explained that if it is preventative and coded properly it will be covered at 100%. Also explained what happens when you are out of network since the member mentioned his dr is out of network. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-16 07:09:10', '2026-03-16 07:09:10'),
