  ('zcrm_1579374000182462081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156430031', 'Wendy Urschitz', '3/12/2026', 'Spoke to Wendy about needing to get logged into her Sedera member portal, I initiated a three-way call to have a Sedera representative help her get logged in, which we were able to do....rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-13 11:17:50', '2026-03-13 11:17:50'),
