  ('zcrm_1579374000182481001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '3-13-26 Carolyn chose Care+ $1250/$668 EC for April 1st. She got an additional 3 months of Zurtec for her migraines. However, she hasn''t had to use the meds for 2 months now. So, she''s hopeful that is done for good. I let her know if that is considered a maintenance med then it will be at her cost always. She doesn''t think it''s a maintenance med but I told her to ask her Dr. Her daughter is a sophmore in college and was just offered a mechanical engineering job for the summer and will be paid $50 an hour and will be given a living stipend plus benefits to include health insurance. This will be in Sunnyvale, CA for the summer. She will remove Jillian when the time comes. Carolyn also knows anything that is on her record from the past 24 months will be considered pre-x even if there''s no diagnosis. She understands and is willing to pay for whatever is necessary on that front. She is super proud of her daughter and isn''t even really sure what the job entails. She''s all set for April 1st start date with a Welcome Call scheduled and QRG downloaded.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-13 10:57:31', '2026-03-13 10:57:31'),
