  ('zcrm_1579374000182429001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631170', 'Zack Aker', '03/12/2026', 'Gabrielle called in today with basic questions about her plan, I answered her questions and got her logged into her app, I advised her to schedule a welcome call afterwards and sent her the email to use for that. I also explained concierge working hours in case she calls outside of concierge hours again.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-03-12 17:38:41', '2026-03-12 17:38:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182412163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182412135', 'Thomas Sigman', NULL, '3-12-26 Tom was Andrea''s client. He''s not good with computers, emails, mail. etc. He failed to upload his tax docs to show proof of his income. So, his APTC was removed and his premium went to $1184.04 from $200 ish with Cigna.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-12 16:47:03', '2026-03-12 16:47:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182412125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171948133', 'Sarah Whelden', NULL, '3-12-26 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hi Wendy, thought I would touch base with you to let you know everything went smoothly with the update to my income with Select Health.... atleast I have not heard  differently....Thankyou for all your help.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-12 16:28:08', '2026-03-12 16:28:08'),
