  ('zcrm_1579374000182373074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176505004', 'Austin Rollins', NULL, '3/12/26<br>Catherine called because she was under the impression she had to mail the her own claim to the po box on the back of her card i explaied it has to be the provider AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 14:31:39', '2026-03-12 14:31:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182386044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173025002', 'Trina Oyloe', NULL, '3/12/26<br>made colo  appointment for tuesday june 2nd with gregory austin. let her know to call the hospital to verify appointment and make sure the prep meds go where she needs them to.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 14:28:28', '2026-03-12 14:28:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182373069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141578002', 'Anthony Bertasi', NULL, '3/12/26<br><br>Sent an email to the member clarifying their benefits, as Susan’s previous explanation was not accurate. The email outlines that they do not need to stay in a network, should present as self-pay during pregnancy, and need to reach their IUA of $2,500 before any expenses are eligible for<a style="" target="_blank"> sharing.AC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 14:25:29', '2026-03-12 14:25:29'),
