  ('zcrm_1579374000182412100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447148', 'Marie-Christine Carel', NULL, '3-12-26 <b>New Sales Notification from Delta Dental of Colorado</b><br>Dear WENDY SCIPIONE,<br>Thank you for choosing Delta Dental of Colorado as your client’s dental benefits provider. You’ve been noted as the broker of record for the following subscriber:<br>MARIE-CHRI CAREL<br>PRODUCT NAME: Clear Plan<br>POLICY EFFECTIVE DATE: 2026-04-01<br>If your client has questions, please advise them to contact our individual customer support at 888-899-3734 or at <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank"><u>customersupport@deltadentalcoversme.com</u></a>.<br>We appreciate your business.<br>Sincerely,<br>Delta Dental of Colorado<br>6465 Greenwood Plaza Blvd., Ste. 900<br>Centennial, CO 80111', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-12 14:12:39', '2026-03-12 14:12:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352198', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163125', 'Sharon Linnebur', '3/12/2026', 'Spoke with Sharon about the Zion guidelines for therapeutic treatment as far when prescribed and performed by a medical professional with injury, illness, musculoskeletal reasons then yes they have allocated $7500 for 35 treatments. I emailed her the plan overview, plus the guidelines...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 14:11:29', '2026-03-12 14:11:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182375191', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081699002', 'Marcia Johnson', NULL, 'Spouse submitted Dependent over 18 to submit info for him and 2 dependents  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-12 14:08:14', '2026-03-12 14:08:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182375183', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088732002', 'Sean Saulsbury', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in letting me know that she would be getting a divorce and wanting information on splitting the membership.  I told her that her spouse would have to submit a change form to remove her and possibly any dependents.  I advised that she then would have to re-enroll and to be in contact w/ Leslie about this.  I also advised to hold off until she speaks to a judge as her husband might be required to pay for Helathcare for the children.  She will be in contact with Leslie.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-12 14:06:32', '2026-03-12 14:06:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182373059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503008', 'Timothy Schaewe', NULL, '3/12/26<br>asked for ryan Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 14:03:00', '2026-03-12 14:03:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352193', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131540068', 'Shoshana Kressler', '3/12/2026', 'Spoke to Shoshana about finding a provider under the PHCS network, and gave her instructions on how to do so. We also spoke about her bloodwork. I told her first find out if it is preventive or diagnostic because if it is preventive and coded as such it is covered if not we can find you the best pricing...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 13:56:23', '2026-03-12 13:56:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352183', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182418002', 'Lauren Williams', 'Member & Fam $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-12 13:41:36', '2026-03-12 13:41:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352178', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109777001', 'Rachel Hinckley', '03/12/2026', '<span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Justin (rachel''s husband) is reaching out on behalf of his wife Rachel regarding a potential medical diagnosis that may cause them to exceed their $5,000 IUA. He asks for a step‑by‑step explanation of how to properly document and submit their medical expenses to ensure full reimbursement, as well as an estimate of reimbursement timelines.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">In response, I provided a detailed process:</span><br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Present as </span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b>cash pay</b></span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> for appointments (except preventive care).Request </span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b>itemized bills</b></span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> for every service.Open a </span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b>sharing request</b></span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> in the Zion HealthShare portal and upload all bills.Zion typically responds </span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b>within two weeks</b></span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> and payments usually occur about </span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b>two weeks from the initial request</b></span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">, assuming all documents are provided.Reimbursements can be paid directly to them or to providers once the IUA is met.</span><br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">I also offered further assistance and wished Rachel a smooth recovery.</span>', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-03-12 13:40:58', '2026-03-12 13:40:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182375170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114121002', 'Morgan Munday', NULL, 'I received the Change form from this member to add her newborn.  I will process. No change in price since already Member &amp; Ch', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-12 13:34:10', '2026-03-12 13:34:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182416001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841172', 'Shoshana Kressler', NULL, '03/12/2026 - Member sent in a request for quote. Did not elaborate on what she needed. Left vm msg. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 13:33:52', '2026-03-12 13:33:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503008', 'Timothy Schaewe', '3/12/2026', 'Spoke with Lisa Schaewe and she was stating having some lyric telehealth issues where it would allow her to get almost complete with her pre registration for an appointment and kick her all the way back and it happened six times. Tried to see if lyric would make the appointment but they will not schedule PCP appointments over phone. Julia got in contact with a lyric rep to help. They asked for a model of phone. I got the answer it was an iPhone they are looking into the glitching waiting to hear...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 13:26:08', '2026-03-12 14:16:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352156', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169727001', 'Amanda Kuhn', '03/12/2026', '<span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Amanda reached out to confirm her coverage for an annual physical and bloodwork with her primary doctor, Dr. Angelov. I explained that these services fall under preventive care and are fully covered with a $0 copay as long as she stays in-network. I provided guidance on how to search for in-network providers, how to use her ID card, and offered support via our concierge line if needed.</span>', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-03-12 13:15:04', '2026-03-12 13:15:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182375151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089149002', 'Daniel Connelly', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to add spouse''s email and add 2 dependents email as well.  I will add in CRM &amp; A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-12 13:10:21', '2026-03-12 13:10:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182376014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179492002', 'Ximena Lizama', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 5006 Question : I would like to know if this provider is with MPB ; Makensey Durant from Gilbert Neurology', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-12 13:07:45', '2026-03-12 13:07:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182412090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182412037', 'Ethan Greene', NULL, '3-12-26 Sara adamantly didn''t want Medicaid. She was finally able to add her income showing about $105K and choose a full cost gold plan for Jett. With her income changes it was still telling her Jett might qualify for CHP+ or Medicaid. I let her know they are allowed to choose a full price plan like she did and don''t have to be forced to go onto Medicaid. She was relived and all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-12 13:05:10', '2026-03-12 13:05:10'),
