  ('zcrm_1579374000182386026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180199004', 'Joshua Hatton', NULL, '3/12/26<br>f/u with Martina to let her know she is good to go and we called Zion together to verify her issue was solved. They found another issue but it is on Zions end and they will fix it and notify member when it is done. The info is being redacted and she cat see it but Zion is dealing with it. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 12:31:01', '2026-03-12 12:31:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182386021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179877004', 'Michelle Pomeroy', NULL, '3/12/26<br>answered her email about maternity waiting periods. I initially thought she would not be covered due to pre ex and wait period but i called Sedera and they said if the due date is after the 9 month window not the coneption date then it will be shareable. She can get the request going now and Sedera needs coordinator can verify due date and help her through the process.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 12:29:38', '2026-03-12 12:29:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179259002', 'leticia sousa', '03/12/2026', 'I helped leticia update her plan to secure hsa with a 5000 iua and monthly cost of 320, I explained her plan would be billed on the 20th of march and her new plan would kick in april, i advised her to reschedule a welcome call after april so we can explain everything to her.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-03-12 12:28:45', '2026-03-12 12:28:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182386016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178107002', 'Matthew Zaideman', NULL, '3/12/26<br>member reached out through sales IQ to ask about RX benefits. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 12:28:03', '2026-03-12 12:28:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182386011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841172', 'Shoshana Kressler', NULL, '3/12/26<br>shoshana called to ask more about what is avaiable under preventative care beefits. Explained how all of that works and guided her through the app to find things like where to get a quote or how to find prices for labs. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 12:27:14', '2026-03-12 12:27:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182350059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174107002', 'Katharine Pritsos', NULL, '03/12/2026 - Scheduled both Katharine &amp; Brian for their requested colonoscopies. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 12:26:55', '2026-03-12 12:36:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182356009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163360001', 'Blythe Burge', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 5005 Question : Hi, My husband is Curtis Burge and is my household member on my policy. He’s going to the dermatologist for an annual check up. The Dermatologist is in the PHCS Provider network. Does he present them with the PHCS card? How does this work. We’re new and I still don’t really understand. Thank you', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-12 12:11:09', '2026-03-12 12:11:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182388035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156164001', 'Anthony Cottrell', NULL, '3/12/26<br>spouse called back saying telehealth still not working but we have not been notified yet if this issue has been resolved yet. will update member when we find out issue and he can then use his telehealth. <br>AJ', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2026-03-12 12:09:54', '2026-03-12 12:09:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182412014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447148', 'Marie-Christine Carel', NULL, '3-12-26 Hi Ameritas,<br><br>On behalf of our mutual client and AOR, please remove Paul Breitenwischer (DOB - 08/30/1955) from her policy effective 3/13/26. <br><br>Her agent and Marie are copied on this email so please reply all.<br><br>We originally sent this to SpritIndividual Team on 3/9/26 but haven''t heard back.<br><br>Many thanks!<br><br>Quendy<br>Consumer Direct Team<br><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:alisha@directbenefits.com"><u>directbenefits@directbenefits.com</u></a> | 844-833-8440 | 7900 International Drive, Suite 1040, Bloomington, MN 55425 <br>CA Agency License: 6004965', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-12 12:09:35', '2026-03-12 12:09:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182373054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', NULL, '3/12/26<br>Geo called in because she is having issues loging into te zion portal escalted this to IT <br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 12:09:05', '2026-03-12 12:09:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174031002', 'Cheryl Roth', '3/12/2026', 'Spoke to Cheryl about needing a prescription refilled and I let her know she would need an order to be refilled first that way she can fill out the quote request form so we can help.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 12:01:42', '2026-03-12 12:01:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182412006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182741002', 'Megan Salmon', NULL, '3-12-26 Megan is 58 and Steve is 59 and they have a 22 year old son. They live in OR now but spend time in Mexico and Idaho to ski. They might move to UT or ID sometime in the next year or so. International will be best with Premium Care. They pay for Dr. Jeffrey Horacek at Healthy Connections who is more of an integrative medicine doctor. He helped Steve to change his sub clinical thyroid back to the proper levels with diet and exercise/lifestyle changes. So, that''s no longer an issue. Megan just started HRT and does have some compounded meds. She likes to do her gyn check up and derm check up. She does mammos every year due to family history. They are currently paying $2965 a month plus a monthly membership fee to Dr. Horacek! Their 22 year old son just fractured his hip 3 weeks ago skiing (I believe). But, it will heal on its own. There''s no surgery necessary. They will save $2K per month which can easily pay for any PT if that''s even necessary. They didn''t mention that. I reiterated the pre-x clause for Premium Care and they totally understand. I gave them the pricing for April and May and also the pricing for June onward. They wished they had done this Jan. 1st. They were hoping Congress would pass the additional tax credits and now they realize that''s not happening. They will review the information tonight and we are scheduled to walk through enrollment tomorrow at noon for Premium Care.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-12 11:58:11', '2026-03-12 11:58:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170461002', 'Adam Rowe', '3/12/2026', 'Adam called and needed to give lyric updated payment for mental health visit, I transferred over to lyric..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 11:54:24', '2026-03-12 11:54:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182410009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174031002', 'Cheryl Roth', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 5004 Question : Hello, I was supposed to be sent an email to fill out my prescription information to determine the best possible price. It’s been about half an hour and it has not arrived so I thought I would get in touch just in case.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-12 11:53:00', '2026-03-12 11:53:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182392004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176724060', 'Rosemary Kerpics', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 5003 Question : I had a chat opened already. Following up on that question.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-12 11:50:49', '2026-03-12 11:50:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182410001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176724060', 'Rosemary Kerpics', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 5002 Question : My primary care physician has recommended a GLP1 and asked me to research any available benefits. How would I check to see if any reduced costs were available through a MPB pharmacy recommendation? I have not yet agreed to the suggestion and do not have a prescription at this time. Researching options.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-12 11:47:35', '2026-03-12 11:47:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174031002', 'Cheryl Roth', '3/12/2026', 'Spoke with Cheryl about getting a prescription refilled and how to find the best pricing.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 11:46:36', '2026-03-12 11:46:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170902001', 'Val Hunter', '3/12/2026', 'Val called in asking for Zion help, confirmed his emails for him and his spouse are different but its reverting back, I forwarded information to IT..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 11:21:14', '2026-03-12 11:21:14'),
