  ('zcrm_1579374000182345182', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179259002', 'leticia sousa', NULL, 'Spoke to member she will reschedule the welcome call after her start date of April 1, 2026. Sent an email to do so. She will get in contact with Leonardo Moraes with pricing of Secure eff 4/26 and the different IUA''s.V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 11:13:00', '2026-03-12 11:14:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182345153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178107002', 'Matthew Zaideman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with wife Kristin. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 10:55:46', '2026-03-12 10:55:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129753002', 'Christopher Rape', '3/12/2026', 'Spoke to Radiology Assist because we were struggling to find a prostate MRI specifically they let know its a camera they use for pelivic MRI''s a 3t camera and its specific locations, I sent him this email: <span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">In your area we did a preliminary search together while on the phone and they told me the Pooler Diagnostic  Imaging center is a spot where they have the 3t located which you will find in the attached PDF. Through the resources we use, we were not able to specifically see prostate MRIs</span><br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">With some more info as well...rc</span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 10:52:24', '2026-03-12 10:52:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178425002', 'Matthew McIntyre', '3/12/2026', 'Spoke to Matthew about him having a kidney stone and already had a initial visit plus a CT scan to confirm he wanted to understand how it would work with Sedera, I let him know your IUA of $5000 all of this could go towards a need. Anything above your IUA they will reimburse you specifically, he also wanted a list of endocrinologists in his area filtered by quality of care which I sent him as well....rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 10:46:20', '2026-03-12 10:46:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182345148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173818002', 'Benjamin Govero', NULL, 'Spoke to wife Kathleen directed her to member forms the plan discussion authorization form that Benjamin needs to submit so we could discuss the plan with her since she is not on plan. Sent an email to reschedule the welcome call. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 10:45:57', '2026-03-12 10:45:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182345131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180927001', 'Abbey Jones', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 10:35:48', '2026-03-12 10:35:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182278002', 'Robert Karbowski', '3/12/2026', 'Sent an email to Cheryl with proof of sharing letters for Alex and Kennedy the dependents at college and sent another copy for proof of coverage with ARM...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 10:29:33', '2026-03-12 10:29:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182375113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180564042', 'Raymond Pung', NULL, 'While on the Welcome Call w/Tupac it was discovered that Spouses SS# was incorrect.  I corrected in CRM &amp; Admin123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-12 10:23:46', '2026-03-12 10:23:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157242002', 'Christopher Mitchell', '3/12/2026', 'Spoke to Lyric on his behalf and they said there was not anything I could do. He would need to call the 888-507-0435 number to speak with them with his specific case number...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 10:17:47', '2026-03-12 10:17:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182350054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174107002', 'Katharine Pritsos', NULL, '03/12/2026 - Responded to Katharine''s e-mail regarding appointments for both she &amp; husband for colonoscopies. Asked if either have a preference as to male or female also asked for several dates and times.  SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 10:12:20', '2026-03-12 10:12:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182375093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166942005', 'Daniel Shawhan', NULL, 'Member called to cancel membership eff 4/26 I will send out the cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-12 10:11:18', '2026-03-12 10:11:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182371009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, '03.12.26 - Matthew called concerned that the Concierge did not provide him with proper guidance that a referral or an order is needed at an imaging center before they can take the x-rays. I attempted to explain to him that he can speak to virtual PCP to obtain the order and the doctor could also read it to see if a specialist is needed. This would help him save $ instead of going to an ortho appointment. Unfortunately, Matthew was not very receptive to having any conversations other than expressing his concern of the lack of instructions from the day before. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-12 10:11:02', '2026-03-12 10:11:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182373049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, '3/12/26<br><br>The member called in because he was upset after going to an imaging center and being turned away. I asked if he had gone with a referral, and he stated that he did not.<br>I advised him to speak with a <b>telehealth provider</b> in order to obtain a referral. The member expressed frustration that he was not previously informed that a referral might be required. I explained that each facility can have different policies and requirements, and it is not always possible for us to know the specific requirements for every location.<br>The member requested to speak with a <b>supervisor</b>.<br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 10:08:20', '2026-03-12 10:08:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182352067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123511002', 'David Toomey', '3/12/2026', 'Spoke with Spouse Helene about getting logged into the app, we were successfully able to do so...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-12 10:05:10', '2026-03-12 10:05:17'),
