  ('zcrm_1579374000182306001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to add spouses email to membership.  However they did not put an email on the form.  I reached out to member to verify email that was in CRM was the one they wanted to use.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-11 14:11:21', '2026-03-11 14:21:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182286031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, '3-11-26 Laura never received my email response to help her decide if she wants to upgrade to add MEC. Once I explained it further and resent the email she thinks they''ll stay with their current membership and not add the MEC. They gets their shots at a local clinic for $20, they aren''t old enough for mammo or colonoscopy yet and they are fine with paying the cash price for a well check visits here and there. They are also getting their meds through one of the options I shared with them. She will also pay for her specialist visit for her asthma. She might try the mental health counseling if she''s willing to give up her counselor and knows she can upgrade to the paid versions also, if need be. They are all set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-11 14:10:21', '2026-03-11 14:10:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182291025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '3/11/26<br>member called to get email situation with zion straightened out. got her to submit update form to get email changed in e123. once that happens i will call her back to let her know to call zion for them to fix it on their end. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 14:05:43', '2026-03-11 14:05:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182291017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176505004', 'Austin Rollins', NULL, '3/11/26<br>Catherine called after getting a bill for the pediatrician. Let her know she needs to just submit the bill for payment by sending it to ARM. As long as it is all preventative and coded as such then it should all be good. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 13:48:09', '2026-03-11 13:48:09'),
