  ('zcrm_1579374000182261051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179877004', 'Michelle Pomeroy', NULL, '3/11/26<br>Leo requested i reach out to speak with her since they are playing phone tag. i left a VM. she called back and wanted to see what would be covered if anything for her pregnancy. she is due November 9th and began on February of this year. going to send her the guidelines in writing so she knows what is covered and what is not in this situation. going to let her know that since she is pregnant now and this is during the waiting period even if her birth is outside of the waiting period it will still be looked at as a pre existing condition. She will probably want to switch due to this information but it is also because she probably can not get any sharing on the pregnancy or birth due to the recent start date.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 12:31:30', '2026-03-11 12:58:41'),
