  ('zcrm_1579374000182273022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182477018', 'Gene Greene', NULL, '3-11-26 Sara calculated her income to be $96949. But, when completing the app it was more like $91K. But, the way the system calculated the income, it''s still putting Ethan (Jett) onto Medicaid! She doesn''t want Medicaid. The system was asking for her husband''s income before expenses which she didn''t know the answer to. Then we tried to just get Sara and Gene enrolled into MCS. But, she can''t decide between Premium Care and Premium HSA. She''s deciding on her business name possibly today. She''s putting $5 income for herself since the system wouldn''t allow $0. She has no idea what she''ll make this year with her business. Now she''s wondering if they should have an HSA. She will talk it over again with Gene and we''ll try to get it done one final time tomorrow. We also checked for Dr. Alissa Rosen who is showing up in the network for their wellness screenings.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-11 12:07:19', '2026-03-11 12:07:19'),
