  ('zcrm_1579374000182261011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630172', 'Jessica Lynn Showalter', NULL, '3/11/26<br>Responded to email about member having wrong address on her payment receipt from us. I looked and was able to verify that the address on the receipt was not the same as what we had on file in e123 or zoho. Asked member to just verify correct address and i will make sure it gets updated on everything. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 09:32:53', '2026-03-11 09:32:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182261006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179715002', 'Vincent Troiano', NULL, '3/11/26<br>Suzanne called back to verify benefits after the provider said they could not verify. I gave her the number we have to ARM instead of what is on the card and they were able to finally verify benefits and let her get her appointment. She should be good to go now. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 09:32:43', '2026-03-11 09:32:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182261001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180199004', 'Joshua Hatton', NULL, '3/11/26<br>called to f/u after being informed the email issue should be resolved. Left VM telling Martina that her issue should be resolved now and to reach out to us and let us know if she is still having problems. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 09:31:27', '2026-03-11 09:31:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182206039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179715002', 'Vincent Troiano', '3/11/2026', 'Suzanne called in having issues accessing her digital card at the providers office, I emailed copy of back of card to where the claims need to go, also sent her the member ID and group number just incase...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 09:16:32', '2026-03-11 09:16:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182217017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181061001', 'Bishoy Michaels', NULL, '03/11/2026 - Member is asking if Quantiferon Gold test is covered under Secure HSA plan? Need to investigate more.   Able to locate discounted lab at Quest Diagnostics, Southlake, TX.   SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 09:11:02', '2026-03-11 12:54:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182206034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112215002', 'Brenda Harms', '3/11/2026', 'Called and left a voicemail for Brenda...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 08:59:05', '2026-03-11 08:59:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182206029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082440', 'Robert Weiffenbach', '3/11/2026', 'Robert emailed and said what do I do about this months coverage, I took his name and gave it to Julia to reach out for a possible exemption, In my email I let him know there was no guarantees but we will try...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 08:51:57', '2026-03-11 08:51:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182206024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081146002', 'Lisa Doughty', '3/11/2026', 'Emailed Lisa and told her to send me the itemized bill from 2024 and we will take a look at it, because it may need to go to planstin, waiting for email back...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 08:50:50', '2026-03-11 08:50:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182217010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947150', 'Gretchen Reeves', NULL, '03/`1/2026 - Member reached back out to us for clarification about her membership card and Rx Valet. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 08:50:17', '2026-03-11 08:50:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182254006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089510002', 'Tyler Farrish', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to add spouse ''s email address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-11 08:43:46', '2026-03-11 08:43:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182254001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135629002', 'Lawrence Mosley', NULL, 'Member contacted me on 3/10 because she was unable to submit her last bills associated with her Maternity need.  I advised her that there had been some issues with dependent emails and that I could escalate to get it fixed.  Per Aba this has been fixed.  I emailed member because her VM was not set up.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-11 08:40:33', '2026-03-11 08:40:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182217005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947150', 'Gretchen Reeves', NULL, '03/11/2026 - Sent e-mail to member regarding any questions about Rx Valet. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 08:23:07', '2026-03-11 08:23:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182206016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166942005', 'Daniel Shawhan', '3/11/2026', 'Spoke to Daniel about diagnostic laboratory work he needed done. I let him know it would be an out of pocket expense and that we could find him the best pricing. However, he let me know it was urgent because of swelling in his hands and feet and they wanted to do the blood work on site. I let him know the ARM card submit bills there he could get the PPO discount because his clinic does not do cash pay discounts. I also sent an email with the link for rx lab request...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 08:14:42', '2026-03-11 11:07:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182206011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170902001', 'Val Hunter', '3/10/2026', 'Val called in and he had said his spouse had bit of an emergency with an ER visit. I let him know that he is responsible for his IUA amount of $1000 and the rest of it he could submit for sharing. I also called lyric on his behalf to make sure his wifes medical needs and texts / records would be attached to her number not his...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 07:48:51', '2026-03-11 08:16:42'),
