  ('zcrm_1579374000182159008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106693017', 'Deirdre Bingman', NULL, '03.11.26 - Deirdre emailed that she can not get into telehealth. Checked the Lyric portal, and it''s active. Let her know to reach out if problem presists to troubleshoot. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-11 07:28:38', '2026-03-11 07:28:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182206001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174925002', 'Gary Ingles', '3/11/2026', 'Spoke to Gary about preventive v. diagnostic blood work, I let him know he needs to speak with his provider to find out which one they are because off of preliminary thoughts they do sound diagnostic. I let him know the preventive are covered but diagnostic becomes out of pocket...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 07:25:19', '2026-03-11 07:25:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182203020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169135002', 'Adam Jackson', NULL, '03/11/2026 - Sent member name, address &amp; phone # of gastro to consider for her colonoscopy. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-11 07:23:36', '2026-03-11 07:23:36'),
