  ('zcrm_1579374000182144120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122567002', 'Alexandra Novo', NULL, '3-10-26 Alexandra got a new job with benefits and needs to cancel for 3-31-26. I sent her the link to do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-10 16:02:20', '2026-03-10 16:02:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182144115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '3-10-26 Carolyn is thinking she will choose MCS and either Care+ or Premium Care where her income doesn''t matter. She wants April 1st. She also wants to review C4 options one last time. She knows the deadline which I reinterated in the vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-10 15:31:27', '2026-03-10 15:31:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182143135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152342047', 'Jeremy Klepper', '3/10/2026', 'Spoke to spouse Sarah about how to set up a preventive annual wellness exam, walked her through the PHCS network and how to find a provider, i also emailed her the link to <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://healthcare.go/"><u>healthcare.go</u></a>v with all the preventive services for adults and for children...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 15:03:15', '2026-03-10 15:03:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182148084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089510002', 'Tyler Farrish', NULL, '3/10/26<br>Bria called in to add her email address on file so she could open a share request with Zion. She needs to start a maternity need and with the recent Zion issue with the file transfer we need to make sure we update the email on our end then we can reach out to Zion and let them know we updated it so they can then update it on their end. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 14:56:34', '2026-03-10 14:56:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182143130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', '3/10/2026', 'Spoke to Zion on Kallie''s behalf in regard to a file transfer issue with her spouses email, I emailed Kallie with an update <span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">I spoke with Zion on your behalf, and they received the file transfer today. It took a little longer than originally expected. In regard to your husband''s account, the representative had mentioned to me that it looked like he was able to register yesterday afternoon, is that correct? Now that they received the file and the emails are correct, I will try again. He may need an activation email for his account which the representative had mentioned he can reach out to Zion....rc </span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 14:54:09', '2026-03-10 14:54:09'),
