  ('zcrm_1579374000182143120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081146002', 'Lisa Doughty', '3/10/2026', 'Spoke to Lisa about a bill from a Dexa scan she was getting all the sudden from 2024, I told her unfortunately I cant even back date that far on my end we would need to get in contact with ARM directly to see, she said no worries I will give them a call personally...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 14:37:29', '2026-03-10 14:37:29'),
