  ('zcrm_1579374000182143110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082440', 'Robert Weiffenbach', '3/10/2026', 'Robert called in trying to change his card on file, I spoke with Michele and then sent him this email: <span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">After speaking with our billing department, they informed me that after several notices they did have to unfortunately cancel the membership effective 3/1/2026. What you will need to do is reenroll with your advisor Analisa Cleland for the date 4/1/2026. Now, if you have any open needs with Sedera, I can escalate that to my manager to reach out to Sedera and see what can be done. If you have any further question feel free to reach out!...rc </span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 14:05:41', '2026-03-10 14:05:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182159003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142862002', 'Victoria Shavlik', NULL, '03.10.26 - Sent Victoria an email explaining that urgent care is for common acute illnesses and for diagnostic needs, virtual primary care would be the best option. She can also message a doctor through telehealth, however, this would not be for diagnostic cases. Provided a gift card ($75) for a basic vitamins and minerals test through ultalabs since MPB is not able to assist in the bill that resulted from the Inperson visit. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-10 13:57:03', '2026-03-10 13:57:03'),
