  ('zcrm_1579374000182144081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167090002', 'Shannon Guild', NULL, '3/10/26<br>Shanon called again with questions on how to get her mammogram covered i explained to verify the provider being in network and provide her mpb health card, she later said the provider told her that health share do not pay these bills, I explained that when it comes to preventative she does not need to tell the provider its a health share AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 13:18:13', '2026-03-10 13:18:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182144073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174988022', 'Kristi Laws', NULL, '3/10/26<br>KIrsit called because she needed assistance logging into the mpb health App AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 13:17:23', '2026-03-10 13:17:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182148076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177126001', 'Anthony Dal Porto', NULL, '3/10/26<br>Kathleen called in to verify if doctor would be covered. we called ARm together since the dr. shows on the multi plan website but at the wrong address. they also have providers showing up at the proper address but ARM told us that Kathleen should get the provider to reach out and update the multi plan website since it does go by address sometimes. Let her know if she is having issues to let us know so we can clear it up with the provider or get the provider to speak to whoever they should be speaking to.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 13:16:22', '2026-03-10 13:16:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182176031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168250023', 'Kevin Isenberg', NULL, '03/10/2026 - Member was able to see Dr. Todd Hendrickson to fill his Rx.   SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 13:09:13', '2026-03-10 13:09:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182148068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173394002', 'Stephen Prince', NULL, '3/10/26<br>answered members email about sleep studies. They wanted to know if that was shared on. Let them know unfortunately no it is not an eligible shared expense therefore it would be out of pocket<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 12:37:37', '2026-03-10 12:37:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182148063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153824002', 'Samuel Young', NULL, '3/10/26<br>reached out again for a 1095. Let accounting know and asked them to please expedite this if possible and send them one in the email to get to them faster.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 12:32:29', '2026-03-10 12:32:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182150016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182058108', 'Janina Buldrini', NULL, '3/10/26<br>Sent Janina f/u message to let her know the payment went through and her account is set to become active on April 1st. gave her link to schedule welcome call since the auto emails did not seem to be sent out as they should have been, <br>AJ', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2026-03-10 12:22:57', '2026-03-10 12:22:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182144068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182215004', 'Kevin Hartigan', NULL, '3-10-26 <span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">He was referred to me by Ariel Tidwell. </span>Kevin is 51 and his wife is 40.  They each have a 21 year old kid. One is moving to Philly, PA and will have to find his own plan. They are done supporting them. They were paying about $1900 per month for EF, $1500 ES, $800 EO. Kevin has RX for sleep and depression/anxiety and his wife has an anti depressant and levothyroxine for hypothyroidism and hashimotos. Kevin is the owner of a 24 hr workout facility. His wife is a P RN and also an office manager for an architecture firm. Kevin likes to take vitamin D, C and other supplements. I explained Premium HSA and Secure HSA. He''s thrilled to join Premium HSA at $720/$1000 or $655/$1000 and knows of new amount for May 20th billing for June which is $771/$1000 or $700/$1500. I''m not sure if I mentioned the $125/$25!  I forgot to ask for his email as well. We are meeting again tomorrow at 10:00 am to complete the enrollment process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-10 12:14:08', '2026-03-13 15:27:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182143097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126137002', 'Sean Trebus', '3/10/2026', 'Sean called in saying he thinks the telehealth was trying to reach him, i confirmed they were with lyric so i got him transferred over there...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 12:02:00', '2026-03-10 12:02:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182158084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130140011', 'Abe Degnan', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update dependent email &amp; Contact number information.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-10 11:52:33', '2026-03-10 12:06:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182143092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176977029', 'Amy Fisher', '3/10/2026', 'Spoke to Amy about getting a telehealth appointment set up to refill prescriptions, I also sent her an email with directions on how to get them through rx valet and her app...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 11:50:35', '2026-03-10 11:50:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182138104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095867002', 'Jennifer Tibbetts', NULL, 'Member called in requesting to cancel her son''s membership that she paid for.  I could not find any membership in her son''s name, George Tibbetts.  I advised her to contact her advisor to inquire about that.  She was not sure who it may have been with.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-10 11:50:31', '2026-03-10 11:50:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182148058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081871010', 'Tiffany Brodt', NULL, '3/10/26<br>responded to members email. Let her know we just need to verify the email for her husband and once we do that we can make sure it is correct on our end. Then she needs to call zion to get them to change it manually on their end due to the ongoing file transfer issues they have been having. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 11:43:19', '2026-03-10 11:43:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182143087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169959013', 'Lisa Side', '3/10/2026', 'Responded to Lisa''s email about how to find payment history with: <br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> payment portal where you can update the payment method, access personal information and view payment history!</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">If you haven''t accessed the portal before, please (when you click on payment and it prompts you to login):</span></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Click on "Forgot Password" on the portal login page.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Enter your email and Member ID.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">You will receive an email — click the link in the email.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Set a new password. We recommend using the same password as your app for convenience.....RC</span></p></li></ul>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 11:42:13', '2026-03-10 11:42:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182176024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947150', 'Gretchen Reeves', NULL, '03/10/2026 - Called member to discuss Rx plan Call went to vm. Left mag.  SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 11:40:14', '2026-03-10 11:40:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182158077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088422001', 'Michael Ford', NULL, 'Member called with lots of questions.  First he told me that he was told that his membership was inactive.  Member was transitioned from Planstin in 2024 so they typical tell members that they are cancelled.  I told members that his preventative portion of the membership was transitioned to ARM at that time .  He had not good things to say re: getting in contact with the Conciergie.  He never was able to reach them.  I advised him to have another Welcome Call as a refresher and directed him where to schedule that.  He asked about Prescriptions and using his card, I told him that he was not to use the card for that.  I asked if he had downloaded the app.  He had not, I directed him to the website to download.  I also told him about the Health Wallet benefit re prescriptions.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-10 11:36:41', '2026-03-10 11:36:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182144048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '3-10-26 Kim submitted her Form 8962 which showed $86,473 which has made her lose her entire APTC for 2026. Her cost went up to over $1K! She can''t afford that. The cheapest plan is $865.37. She has cancer diagnosed Nov. 2022 and surgery in Dec. 2022. Then 18 months later she was cleared of cancer by her oncologist which brings it to about June 2024 or so. She''s definitely not willing to risk going onto MCS since it will fall within the pre-x clause for now. She did lose a client that brought it $5K-$7K per year. She''s going to figure out her total deposits for Jan-March of 2026 to see her most accurate amount for 2026. She would call her accountant but isn''t sure she''ll get a response since it''s crunch time. She''ll call me back later with her newest number.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-10 11:36:11', '2026-03-10 11:36:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182148048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131743016', 'Anna Suchowian', NULL, '3/10/26<br>member called to find out what is covered for a mammo and if ultrasound is covered. Let her know that she needs to talk to zion about an appeal since they denied part of the treatment course. I let her know we do not make those decisions and if she has trouble let us know and we can possibly escalate for her to appeal. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 11:31:41', '2026-03-10 11:31:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182148026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176973013', 'Christy O''Reilly', NULL, '3/10/26<br>Tried to do welcome call, left VM, sent email and text as well to try and get her to re schedule.<br><span><br></span>She texted back a little later saying she cancelled the welcome call that she scheduled and i did not see the email stating she cancelled. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 11:02:06', '2026-03-10 12:40:13'),
