  ('zcrm_1579374000182143067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174153001', 'Amanda Greene', '3/10/2026', 'Spoke to Amanda about getting her husband logged into the app, also walked them through Mail order. I let her know for all prescriptions you do need a valid order for a medical professional and have them E-Scribe it to the Advanced Pharmacy number. i also went ahead and gave her directions on how to find the mail order guide for help...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 10:33:52', '2026-03-10 10:33:52'),
