  ('zcrm_1579374000182158046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166682002', 'Cathy Cole', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 4/26 due to getting employer benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-10 10:10:00', '2026-03-10 10:10:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182144035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182481088', 'Jeff Mcilroy', NULL, '3-10-26 Jeff is turning 52 in July, 2026. He is an employee of Justin Acker. Justin called recently and let me know he may be sending me some of his employees. He''s not going to set up a group and he''s not planning to pay any portion. So, the employees will be on their own and might not qualify for the MEC. Jeff lives in Mesick, MI. He''s more hands off on the construction/building for work. He did have back surgery on Jan. 31st, 2023. He recovered very quickly and was back to work before they expected! He was working again in April. He''s not sure of the exact date. He''s borderline outside of the pre-x clause. He''s not sure of the exact date without digging up his records. He understands the pre-x clause. I also read to him the tobacco section. He''s willing to quit and has great incentive to do so with the limitations and the $75 surcharge. I read to him how to prove that he''s quitting as well. He''s happy to quit. His wife has her own policy and daughter is in Canada and on their system. Due to the tobacco, it was best to put him on Premium Care so he could quit and not be penalized forever. He chose Premium Care $1500/$267+$75=$342. I forgot to give him the new rate for the $1500 level. I gave it to him for the $1000 IUA.  I''ll send him an email. I waived the $100 fee since he an employee of Justin Acker''s group. Justin is Not creating a group with MPB. But, Jeff is an employee, not self-employed. Either way, I waived the $100  for Jeff.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-10 10:08:02', '2026-03-13 15:31:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182138084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182481088', 'Jeff Mcilroy', 'Member Only $1500 IUA Premium Care + Tobacco', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-10 09:55:38', '2026-03-10 09:55:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182158036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176959012', 'Sophia Daigle', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to add spouses email in order to connect his Zion Account.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-10 09:43:22', '2026-03-10 09:43:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182143054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169135002', 'Adam Jackson', '3/10/2026', 'Olivia called in complaining about scheduling an appointment saying none of the providers she was calling from the list were actually in network, I reassured her if you are having trouble and would like us to try and take care of it for you, I will send an email with the appointment schedule request form so one of our team members can get it scheduled...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 09:41:56', '2026-03-10 13:09:26'),
