  ('zcrm_1579374000182143039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167090002', 'Shannon Guild', '3/10/2026', 'Spoke to Shannon on what to actually say to the provider when scheduling an appointment, i told her when asking the office you will want to confirm "Dr (insert name) is still operating under the PHCS multi plan network." if they say yes then you are good to go...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 08:59:20', '2026-03-10 08:59:20'),
