  ('zcrm_1579374000182143034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176273003', 'Clarence Burnett', '3/10/26', 'Spoke to Clarence''s wife about a certain prescription Wegovy which is very expensive, I sent the coupon to them as they requested and I also gave instructions on how to access the Rx valet weight loss section. On top of that the wife had expressed total confusion with the plan in general I got them set up for a welcome call for March 12th @11:00 am...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 08:55:19', '2026-03-10 08:55:19'),
