  ('zcrm_1579374000182137060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173981002', 'Fernando Silva Noguera', NULL, 'Welcome call completed.Member was scheduled 3 different times on calendar so I decided to call and check if he had further questions. Member stated the welcome call was not done on 2/25/26. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 08:02:40', '2026-03-10 08:04:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182144006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176459022', 'Robin Yost', '3/10/26', 'Robin called requesting assistance finding an OBGYN in her area who is in-network. After conducting a provider search, there were no in-network providers available within a 100-mile radius of her location.<br>I informed Robin that, given the lack of in-network providers, she could see her preferred out-of-network provider and present her MPB Health card since the visit is for an IUD. I also advised her to speak with the provider beforehand and request that services be coded as preventive if applicable. Additionally, I informed her not to discuss any symptoms she may be experiencing, as that could result in the visit being coded as diagnostic and potentially lead to balance billing.<br>Robin later called back stating that the provider requires a one-patient agreement in order to see her. I attempted to contact ARM for assistance, but Lori and Kelly were not available at the time.<br>Provider information:<br>Dr. Sherry L. Niccoli, MD<br>Phone: 970-641-2885<br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 07:46:17', '2026-03-10 07:46:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182144001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, '3/9/26<br>Hilary called stating that her son is currently in active treatment/sessions with a therapist and that they have already used all of their visits. She requested an extension of visits. She also mentioned that when she spoke with the intake clinician, they reported having no record of ongoing sessions.<br>I asked Hilary for additional context to determine which service her son had been using, as it could have been either MSEAP or Lyric. Hilary initially made it seem like she was using Lyric. We then completed a three-way call to clarify the situation. During that call, it became clear that Hilary was actually referring to MSEAP, which is our old service.<br>I explained to Hilary that MSEAP is no longer an active service and that her son would need to transition to the new service. Hilary stated that she had to go and would call back later.<br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 07:40:55', '2026-03-10 07:40:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182143009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170721005', 'Harish Kuram', '3/10/2026', 'Spoke to Harish, he wanted to confirm he told the provider the right information for the network, I said the "PHCS Multi Plan" network." Which I confirmed. I said your annual wellness is covered and you will ned to present your ARM card for the method of payment...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-10 07:35:49', '2026-03-10 07:35:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182138017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182101012', 'Vaughn Teuscher', 'Member & Sp MEC + Essentials', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-10 07:26:44', '2026-03-10 07:26:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182138006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182094019', 'Cynthia McClendon', 'Member & Sp  $5000 IUA Secure HSA + Tobacco', 'Sent email to advisor to verify and confirm the Tobacco status for Member &amp; Spouse because the tobacco fee was on the enrollment but the question dot was filled in as "No" for both members.  Advisor confirmed via email that the husband/spouse is a smoker.  I updated the record in A123', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-10 07:11:05', '2026-03-13 13:24:50'),
