  ('zcrm_1579374000182086050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109381009', 'Bryan Felberg', NULL, '3-9-26 Bryan got a new job with benefits that started on March 1st. He''ll complete the cancellation for March 31st and he has the form from Patti just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-09 13:43:00', '2026-03-09 13:43:00'),
