  ('zcrm_1579374000182095003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180572005', 'Sue De Santo', NULL, '03/09/2026 - Member called asking questions as to how to get refills of meds, etc. Guided member to member forms. Member also inquired about HAS account.   SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 13:40:32', '2026-03-09 13:40:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182086045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152148', 'Justin Acker', NULL, '3-6-26 Justin has about 25 employees in his business as a builder. He wanted to let me know they aren''t the healthiest bunch of employees since some smoke, vape, drink, etc. So, ere on the side of caution when speaking with his employees. He works out payment for them on the backend. Therefore, they will pay on their own. He has no interest in setting up a group membership. Some take responsibility for their health and wellness and others don''t. Many have benefits through a spouse. Others are asking for benefits. I may hear from a guy names Jeff who is a Supervisor for Justin. I will make sure to share the nuances of pre-x, tobacco, etc. to make sure it''s a good fit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-09 13:39:26', '2026-03-09 13:39:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182062158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149291002', 'Donna Boysen', '3/9/2026', 'Spoke with Donna about a 1095-C, I let her know I will put in a request for one to be emailed...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 13:33:05', '2026-03-09 13:33:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182056022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166682002', 'Cathy Cole', NULL, 'Member called in requesting to cancel the Membership.  Sent the cancellation link.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-09 13:28:49', '2026-03-09 13:28:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182086040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137619002', 'Laura Shymkus', NULL, '3-9-26 Laura called veyr upset bc Tim has been diagnosed with stage 3-4 colorectol cancer and it''s been about a month and Zion still hasn''t approved his Sharing Request yet. He''s paused any treatment until he gets approval. So, they are very nervous and frustrated. Apparently the person working on his Need was promoted and it''s been dropped and he hasn''t been able to get answers. I just left Tim a vm now as well to get all of the details, times, dates, people he''s talked with etc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-09 13:28:17', '2026-03-09 13:28:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182056014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182094002', 'Shelby Cooper', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Premium Care', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-09 13:21:16', '2026-03-09 13:21:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182065016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165196002', 'Paul DiCicco', NULL, '3/9/26<br>paul called because the provider he went to told him his account was cancelled. Called dave at ARM once i saw he was not pulling up in the portal and dave verified they had cancelled him. I checked and made sure he was supposed to be active and told dave to go ahead and re activate Paul''s membership. Called paul to let him know he should be good to go now. he did not answer so i left a VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 12:41:00', '2026-03-09 12:42:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182057022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182058108', 'Janina Buldrini', NULL, 'Janina called in due to her losing her coverage and needing to get new coverage. she lives in Connecticut and is 57. signed up for member only. Her brother is a member and i will also be reaching out to send them the referral agreement so he can get his $100. she did not have 1099 so she signed up for care +. she is retiring soon. Let her know also about the possibility of 1099 qualification being removed for her to get the preventative care in the future. <br><span><br></span>Ran into IT issue when we tried to enroll her. Something about the username verification error. They are going to fix it and since we already have all of her information and she also gave me permission to we will push the enrollment through and then she and I should get the auto email showing she enrolled. <br>AJ', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2026-03-09 12:24:04', '2026-03-09 12:26:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182066018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115994009', 'Patrick Graue', NULL, '3/9/26<br>Assisted Patrick with loging into the payment protal AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 12:15:50', '2026-03-09 12:15:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182086011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179240006', 'Megan Meek', NULL, '3-9-26 I called Megan again and told her my experience of getting hung up on being nice and stern. She will call back one more time since she has proof of her calls in her call log, if need be. I gave her the Billing and Enrollment Dept # 877-484-5967. She will give it a whirl. Her mom says she only has to work in CO for one day and should qualify for a CO plan. She files her taxes in WY, not CO. So, this tax time enrollment might not work. I mentioned another option LifeX as a last resort since it has practically the same cost at $469 at the $750 ded level and her state doesn''t matter and the network is nationwide. This might be better anyhow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-09 12:10:35', '2026-03-09 12:10:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182059126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130059020', 'Elizabeth Wiersma', NULL, '03/09/2026 - Spoke to member requesting 1095C be e-mailed to her. Will send Karina request. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 12:08:10', '2026-03-09 12:08:10'),
