  ('zcrm_1579374000182059069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', NULL, '03/09/2026 - Left vm msg for member regarding 200mg of doxycycline. Can only locate 100mg. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 11:28:29', '2026-03-09 11:29:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182086001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179240006', 'Megan Meek', NULL, '3-9-26 Megan is still having problems with Cigna to pay and they''ve cancelled her plan for sure. They say C4 has to reinstate. C4 says Cigna has to reinstate since they cancelled it on their end due to non-payment. C4 has no ability to reinstate since it''s connected to the payment problem. Cigna told Megan to wait until they fixed their platform to pay. She did and the system still didn''t work since they can''t find her in the system. She and I are going in circles. C4 suggested that Cigna calls and does a 3-way with us to get it resolved. Worst case scenario she can do a tax time enrollment. She has not filed her taxes yet. Therefore, she must choose Tax Time Enrollment or note it on her taxes when she submits them with the state. That will open up the enrollment period. I spoke with Cigna - Bianca and got hung up on, then connected with Nikita who promised me C4 has to submit the enrollment, then spoke with Barbara from C4 who gave me the most useful help. Next time she can also just call in her payment or I can do it on their portal somehow. Ref # is CAS-656676-K1F3D3. Now on hold with Cigna one final time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-09 11:25:33', '2026-03-09 11:25:33'),
