  ('zcrm_1579374000182062112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130373002', 'Lisa Wiesen', '3/9/2026', 'Lisa called and we spoke about international coverage. I let her know: Medical expenses for emergency and acute care incurred outside the United States or Puerto<br>Rico will be considered for sharing based on the Member Guidelines. All other medical<br>expenses are ineligible for sharing...RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 09:41:39', '2026-03-09 09:41:39'),
