  ('zcrm_1579374000182062098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170404002', 'Tara Albrigo', '3/9/2026', 'Spoke with Tara, about getting logged into the app and then I got her logged into health wallet...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 09:05:26', '2026-03-09 09:05:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182062089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174061001', 'Pamela Price', '3/9/2026', 'Spoke to Pamela about a Dexa scan for preventive, I told her had to be post menopause and for preventive only not osteoporosis related.I also let her know about a CT scan she was having done for diagnostic related reasons and I let her know everything can go towards that IUA amount of $2500...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 08:29:14', '2026-03-09 08:29:14'),
