  ('zcrm_1579374000182062066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', '3/9/2026', 'Spoke with Jatin about a telehealth appointment, he called lyric around 8 am and they said theyd be calling him in about 45 minutes, and he wanted an update since it is now 10 am. I transferred to lyric for better help. I also sent him an email with step by step instructions on how to long into the app...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 08:06:19', '2026-03-09 08:13:42'),
