  ('zcrm_1579374000182065001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159262002', 'Julie Lohr', NULL, '3/9/26<br>Member called after the provider told her that her account is inactive. I checked everywhere and her account is good. It sounds like user error on the provider searching the network. They mentioned a PHCS network i had not heard of so i believe they chose the wrong one when searching. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 07:49:14', '2026-03-09 07:49:14'),
