  ('zcrm_1579374000182062011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178888002', 'Matthew Blum', '3/9/2026', 'Completed ARM card request...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 07:39:44', '2026-03-09 07:39:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182062006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165092002', 'Cecile Walters Trotter', '3/9/2026', 'Cecile called in, asking about her husband''s back injury that he sustained. i let her know as far as diagnostic purposes go wherever you feel more comfortable and remember you have the IUA of $1000 and the rest can be shared if it goes over...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 07:35:34', '2026-03-09 07:35:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182055045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180997002', 'Lewis Flinn', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent an email to reschedule the welcome call. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 07:33:24', '2026-03-09 07:33:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182058023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', 'New Membership eff 4/26', 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-09 07:26:31', '2026-03-09 07:26:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182062001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176224019', 'Dustin Young', '3/9/2026', 'Emailed Sarah at health wallet on behalf of Amy Young trying to get a prescription reimbursement for a medicine that was labeled $0.00 and she ended up having to pay for it...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 07:26:03', '2026-03-09 07:26:03'),
