  ('zcrm_1579374000182059005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180925001', 'Jarrod Eastman', NULL, '03/09/2026 - Completed Rx request. Cost Plus not available. Sent member Walgreens info.   SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-09 07:04:26', '2026-03-09 07:04:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182058005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176465005', 'Laura Ruiz', NULL, 'Member alled in and wanted to know why her spouse could not get into access telehealth.  I told her that there is no email for her husband and that one had to be submitted.  I will send out Change From.  UPDATE: Member has submitted email &amp; contact # for spouse I will add.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-09 06:51:32', '2026-03-09 07:06:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182056001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169813019', 'Nicholas Boyd', NULL, 'Member updated payment method via member portal', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-09 06:38:20', '2026-03-09 06:38:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000182043005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172087002', 'Jamie Frees Miller', NULL, '3/8/26<br>member requested 1095 C, sent request to accounting<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-08 17:17:54', '2026-03-08 17:17:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181986090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155863360', 'Paula Jessen', NULL, '3-6-26 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hi Wendy,</span><br><br>Thank you again so much for your help. We just found out today that they were able to add our newborn to my husband’s employer based health insurance. Just in time as I was going to select a plan today! I am sorry for the inconvenience and just wanted to let you know how much I appreciate you’re being so available and willing to help. I’ll definitely be reaching out if we end up needing health insurance in Colorado in the future. <br><br>Enjoy your weekend! <br>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-06 20:46:59', '2026-03-06 20:46:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181986075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, '3-6-26 I called Caterina per Patti''s request. Caterina is not pleased with Analisa since she learned about the $100 referral fee and asked Analisa if she could be paid for referring Amy Langley. Analisa said we don''t do that anymore and didn''t really know about it. I sent Analisa a full update on how the referral program is working to make sure she''s up to speed on Feb. 26th. Caterina also communicated with her on that day. There''s been no further communication and response from Analisa to give Caterina the $100. She''s feeling lied to and has no interest in working with Analisa anymore. I let her know I''ll see if there''s anything we can do about this referral for Amy. I also let her know the best way to do so moving forward. She also missed a payment in Jan. So, she re-enrolled for Feb. 1st and is fine that the pre-x starts all over. I also let her know there''s a 6 month wait before she has access to the mammo and colonoscopy. She''s totally fine with that. She says she usually has to pay more for the mammo each year as well. She was very nice and is happy to have my help. I was very clear with her that I didn''t want to step on Analisa''s toes and she made it clear that this is her decision and wants nothing to do with Analisa moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-06 15:04:19', '2026-03-06 15:04:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181913212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173025002', 'Trina Oyloe', NULL, '3/6/26<br>I have been speaking with Trina back and foward trying to help book an appoitment AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:59:32', '2026-03-06 14:59:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181908223', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107281002', 'Devorrah Moss', '3/6/2026', 'Spoke to Devorrah about doing a preliminary search for an OBGYN in her area, and walked her through the PHCS list. I also sent her via email the results...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:52:11', '2026-03-06 14:52:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181955128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122246010', 'Mikaila Cameron', NULL, '3/6/26<br>member called to get transferred to lyric to get a hold of some orders she requested.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:50:56', '2026-03-06 14:50:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181986070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, '3-6-26 Julia and I discussed the upgrade from Care+ to Secure HSA. She was paying $537 for Care+ and $165 for HAB. She thought the was going to have to pay $537+$646 for her wellness. Now she understands the total monthly amount will be $646 to add the ACA wellness screenings and HSA compliance. She was multiple businesses and EIN''s. She used her interiot design EIN for the upgrade which will take effect April 1st. She''s happy and now understands she can also find everything in the new MPB.Health app. Yay!  All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-06 14:44:48', '2026-03-06 14:44:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181913207', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136714002', 'Jana Miller', NULL, '3/6/26<br>Sent change form to add husbands email AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:44:47', '2026-03-06 14:44:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181908218', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172725002', 'John Emge', '3/6/2026', 'Spoke to Kimberley about Zion sharing portal, realized her email is attached to primary John and she needs to change it, sent change form...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:43:47', '2026-03-06 14:43:47'),
