  ('zcrm_1579374000181955111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174151001', 'Adam Stratton', NULL, '3/6/26<br>Reached out to follow up with member to clear up any confusion and make sure they know how the program works. left VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:38:34', '2026-03-06 14:38:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181955106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095868002', 'Joshua Platt', NULL, '3/6/26<br>member called to ask about ID cards and some other general membership information. let her know they do not get a card on Care +. Also explained a little more about how the membership works since it is for her son and she wanted to know how he would get medications and thing like that. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:38:02', '2026-03-06 14:38:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181955101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, '3/6/26<br>Hillary called to get the lab order they are trying to get through the telehealth. Had to transfer her to lyric for them to help her get those orders<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:37:03', '2026-03-06 14:37:03'),
