  ('zcrm_1579374000181913180', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180526002', 'Sheldon Maughan', NULL, '3/6/26<br>Sheldon called he needs to open a sharing request for an injury. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:23:05', '2026-03-06 14:23:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181955096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175165020', 'Brian Black', NULL, '3/6/26<br>Called Brian to say thank you for the shout out on the news. Left a VM and will attempt again to reach him to try and get him to do a video testimonial at the request of Catherine. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:20:10', '2026-03-06 14:20:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181958105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176219046', 'Kevin Miller', NULL, '03/06/2026 - Member requested an itemized list of tests to be done at a discounted price. New York is a highly regulated state and will not permit labs to discount their fees. Notified client regarding this issue. Member was also notified to ask for an itemized statement so that he can apply the cost of these tests to his IUA.  SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:15:16', '2026-03-06 14:15:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181908197', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159268002', 'Cheri Johnson', '3/6/2026', 'got Cheri logged into the app I also emailed her the change form for her daughters email..r.c', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:13:37', '2026-03-06 14:13:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181913175', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178071246', 'Ann Inai', NULL, '3/6/26<br>Called to ask if we cover a breast mri due to her state mandate it is preventative, I informed her we go by what is federally mandated and at this time only a regular mammogram is covered AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:12:37', '2026-03-06 14:12:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181955091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280209', 'STEVEN FRADIN', NULL, '3/6/26<br>Steven called to get a refresher on how to start a share request. walked him through the process and helped him activate his Zion portal by calling Zion so they could send him the activation link. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:12:33', '2026-03-06 14:12:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181913167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172735002', 'Gerardo Negrete', NULL, '3/6/26<br>Gerardo called he needed help logging in Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:08:11', '2026-03-06 14:08:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181913162', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175880017', 'Agnes Eide', NULL, '3/6/26<br>Husband called to open a new sharing request for son he got n a motorcycle accident AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:07:20', '2026-03-06 14:07:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181986051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '3-6-26 Michael was appreciative that I had him get pre-approval for his upcoming heart tests. He''s been pre-approved for up to $50K w/o medical records. Further sharing will be pending upon review of medical records. He''s happy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-06 14:06:30', '2026-03-06 14:06:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181913157', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176873021', 'Ron Rochester', '3/6/26', 'Ron called in because he received a text early in the morning that his telehealth appointment was ready two hours before his scheduled time. i transferred him to lyric', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 14:06:16', '2026-03-06 14:06:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181986038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '3-6-26 Suzy was wondering why I didn''t recommend Medicaid or a subsidy since she now says she earned $4K and $5K the last two years. I could see in my notes that she told me she will earn $50K. I let her know that and then she revealed that includes alimony. She says she doesn''t include alimony on her taxes. But, that is part of the equation for her income for C4. So, she would not have qualified for Medicaid and might have gotten some sort of APTC. But, she chose MCS instead and her income doesn''t matter.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-06 14:02:50', '2026-03-06 14:02:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181967259', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107479018', 'Steven Wagar', 'New Membership eff 4/26', 'Member Only $1250 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-06 13:54:10', '2026-03-06 13:54:10'),
