  ('zcrm_1579374000181986025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179240006', 'Megan Meek', NULL, '3-6-26 I called C4 bc Megan''s plan has been cancelled due to her not being able to make her payment. She tried calling Cigna many times the first being on Feb. 6th to make the payment. Cigna had an error on their end so she couldn''t make the payment. She called them back multiple times to pay and after many times they said they are still working on it and she doesn''t need to call back again. They will notify her when it''s fixed. Since that time they terminated the account due to non-payment even though they have a ticket in their system and should have records of all of her communications. C4 can''t reinstate the plan. Cigna has to do so and when they do they will let C4 know to add it back. I spoke with Tanisha at C4 and she gave me a Ref. # CAS655582V4S6T4. I called Megan back and she will call Cigna yet again to get it resolved. Worst case, Tanisha said we could enroll her directly with Cigna on the Cigna platform not through C4 for April 1st. I just double checked that notion and it''s not true. You still need a Life Change Event to open up a SEP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-06 13:52:54', '2026-03-06 13:54:25'),
