  ('zcrm_1579374000181990006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144777002', 'Thomas Newton', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4993 Question : I know that dental is not covered. However, I am going to have a tooth extraction this week. There is a small risk of infection getting in to the bone. Worst case scenario is that I might have to be hospitalized because of it. Again, that is the worst case scenario. If this were to happen, what should I do?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-06 13:14:52', '2026-03-06 13:14:52'),
