  ('zcrm_1579374000181913126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176537001', 'Philip Skinner', 'Decline of New Membership Enrollment Fee of $125', '3/6- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm to update payment method by Wednesday March 11th or enrollment will be cancelled.<br>3/11-Member called in to request us to make a payment.  He updated the payment method on his old membership to Amex 1006.  I directed him to update his payment method on this new Membership profile.  I reran Enrollment fee with new Amex 1006.  Approved.  He is paycheck to paycheck.  Explained how the billing cycle works automatically on the 20th each month, and that his next billing date is on 03/20 for the April share amount. Told him to reach out to us before the last business day of the month with any billing issues, to avoid cancellation and lapse in Membership.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-06 11:47:27', '2026-03-11 09:01:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181908170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176128017', 'Kelly Locke', '3/6/2026', 'Spoke with Karen she had a telehealth visit and the provider refilled all her prescriptions and forgot one of them, I went ahead and transferred over to lyric so they could fully Asisst her..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 11:45:08', '2026-03-06 11:45:08'),
