  ('zcrm_1579374000181908135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176465005', 'Laura Ruiz', '3/6/2026', 'Spoke with Laura, she had questions whether an annual wellness and a pap smear where covered for preventive, I said yes they are both covered you just need to use a provider operating under the PHCS network...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 09:58:46', '2026-03-06 09:58:46'),
