  ('zcrm_1579374000181955026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109593019', 'Shannon Wallace', NULL, '3/6/26<br>Member James called after falling and hitting his head. Wanted to know what the next steps were so i walked him through beginning a share request. Let him know to gather all of the itemized bills related with this injury and then if he needs we can help him get in his portal to begin a share request and upload his bills. He is good to go and said he would call if he needs help starting his share request.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-06 08:32:39', '2026-03-06 08:32:39'),
