  ('zcrm_1579374000181908083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174164001', 'Carl Peterson', '3/5/2026', 'Spoke with Carl about the following: <br><ol style="list-style-type:decimal;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgba(51, 51, 51, 1);font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Preventive v. Diagnostic appointments and blood work </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgba(51, 51, 51, 1);font-style:normal;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">ARM, how to submit </span></p></li></ol><p style="">I also sent him an email to <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://healthcare.gov/"><u>healthcare.gov</u></a> showing all the immunizations covered that he requested to see...rc </p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-05 14:48:23', '2026-03-05 14:48:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181908078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529495', 'Keith Purcell', '3/5/2026', 'Spoke with Keith, he had a telehealth appointment last night. Lyric reached out to him twice via text saying the provider is running behind we will be with you shortly. They never ended up calling, I went ahead and spoke to lyric, they are going to speak with management and told me to transfer them....rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-05 14:46:57', '2026-03-05 14:46:57'),
