  ('zcrm_1579374000181910093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142862002', 'Victoria Shavlik', NULL, '03.05.26 - Provided an update to Victoria that she needs to contact Zion''s needs coordinator to see if her sharing request can be extended due to not being able to obtain itemized bills. Regarding her telehealth concern of not being able to see a doctor and sent to an in person visit. Lyric stated that urgent care is for common acute symptoms and injury/pain that would require diagnostic x-rays etc are generally handled by PCP. Waiting on Lyric to provide clarification if the member was properly guided on scheduling primary care appts before providing information to Victoria. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-05 14:09:06', '2026-03-05 14:09:06'),
