  ('zcrm_1579374000181908068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174684001', 'Lisa DeBerard', '3/5/2026', 'Spoke with Lisa about finding a facility in network for her mammogram. We did a preliminary search and found a place close to her that was on the list. But I said please call and verify they operate under the PHCS Multi Plan network before booking. We also tried to get her logged into the app and Zion but realized the email for her was attached to spouse and dependent so I sent her the change form..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-05 13:55:20', '2026-03-05 13:55:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181908063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', '3/5/2026', 'spoke to Christina in regard to a foot procedure she is having done. I let her know this could all go towards her IUA amount of$1250. told her to start collecting the bills including the GFE she got to start submitting to Zion...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-05 13:22:56', '2026-03-05 13:22:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181955011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105831009', 'Dariusz Szteborowski', NULL, '3/5/26<br>member called to get a list of ear doctors. sent a list from bluebook.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-05 13:16:13', '2026-03-05 13:16:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181908058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176377009', 'Lindsay Phillips', '3/5/2026', 'Spoke with Lindsay about a provider she had searched for and some of the providers at the location being in network and that specific one she was looking for not popping up. I gave her the explanation of yes it is up to the providers when they take themselves in and out of network, and how sometimes all providers in a facility can be covered it is best to stay on the side of caution.I also initiated a three way call with ARM so Lindsay could hear from one of the representatives there that it is better to be safe in a scenario like this...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-05 13:04:48', '2026-03-05 13:04:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181955006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180199004', 'Joshua Hatton', NULL, '3/5/26<br>Martina called to get help getting into her zion portal. we had to call zion to get the link sent to her for activation. Let zion know we edited her email on our end so they can go ahead and manually edit it on their end. they needed to confirm with us that we changed the email on our end before they could do it on their end. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-05 12:58:43', '2026-03-05 12:58:43'),
