  ('zcrm_1579374000181908043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178742002', 'Princy Varughese', '3/5/2026', 'Spoke to Princy about telehealth referring her to an OBGYN because of symptoms she was having, i advised her this would become Diagnostic and she would be responsible. I also advised this appointment and anything after that may be a result of can go towards her IUA amount of $2500. I emailed Princy the sharing guidelines and a list of providers in her area..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-05 11:22:19', '2026-03-05 11:22:19'),
