  ('zcrm_1579374000181908038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066577036', 'John Malloy', '3/5/2026', 'Elizabeth emailed in saying she submitted a change form but hit "add spouse" instead of changing contact information. I emailed her back saying: <span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Just to confirm, somewhere on the form you indicated your email needed to be updated, and you included the email address that needed to be added? Just let me know in regard to that and we can proceed. waiting to hear back...rc </span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-05 10:53:05', '2026-03-05 10:53:05'),
