  ('zcrm_1579374000181908033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177150062', 'Frank Grigoli', '3/5/2026', 'Emailed spouse Angela: <br><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">The email that is attached for Frank Grigoli and you are the same (</span><a style="display:inline;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);" target="_blank" href="http://grigoli.angela@gmail.com/"><u>grigoli.angela@gmail.com</u></a><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">). I have attached the change form for you to fill out and submit back to us. In the comment box at the bottom of the page, when you have completed it, please specify "keep my email the same, but change Frank''s email to (insert email)."</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Once you submit the change form, it typically takes 24 hours to manually go and change it on our back end. From there we can initiate a file transfer with Zion to get that synced. It may take a few days....RC</span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-05 10:32:51', '2026-03-05 10:32:51'),
