  ('zcrm_1579374000181908008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087741002', 'Richard Feickert', '3/5/2026', 'Spoke with Richard about getting his spouse set up with the Zion portal. I initiated a three-way call with Zion and ultimatley all they needed to do was send Susan an activation link, but they could''nt do it with spouse Richard only. The Zion representative told Richard to have Susan call the Zion number and select option 7 for member services to have the activation link sent over...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-05 08:42:57', '2026-03-05 08:42:57'),
