  ('zcrm_1579374000181861072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179868021', 'Tyler Penson', NULL, '3-4-25 Hello TYLER PENSON,<br> <br>We’re writing to let you know that we have terminated your medical insurance with Cigna Healthcare. Your policy is no longer in effect as of <b>February 28, 2026</b> due to your request.<br> <br>We appreciate your business and thank you for allowing us to serve all your health insurance needs.<br> <br>If you''d like to apply again for new coverage, please must contact <b>Connect for Health Colorado®, Colorado''s state-based health insurance marketplace</b>. You can call them directly at <b>1.855.752.6749</b> or visit <span><a href="http://connectforhealthco.com" style="" target="_blank"><b>connectforhealthco.com</b></a></span>.<br> <br> <br>If you need help reading this notice due to language or disability, help will be provided to you at no cost. For TRS or TTY services, dial 711. You can also have documents read to you and some may be sent to you in your language.<br> <br>Sincerely,<br> <br>Cigna Healthcare, Individual and Family Plans', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-04 19:39:00', '2026-03-04 19:39:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181861024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, '3-4-26 Suzanne is turning 65 in April and Alaska is turning 26 in April as well. So Alaska is re-enrolling in Care+ for April 1st and made note of her original start date of 1/1/21. She is all set to go! Suzanne is aware of her own membership ending and moving to Medicare as well for April 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-04 17:27:35', '2026-03-04 17:27:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181861016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181311002', 'Mark Schaefer', NULL, '<span style="">3-4-26 Not sure where my original notes are. But, Mark called and asked for a change of his start date from April 1st to June 1st since he will be traveling and already has travel insurance for that entire time. I submitted a ticket to request the change on his behalf. He was super nice and appreciative. He will also move his Welcome Call to after June 1st. He''s all set for now</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-04 17:03:46', '2026-03-04 17:03:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181861011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181311002', 'Mark Schaefer', NULL, '2-24-26 Mark came to me via Hans Erickson in Aspen. Mark is 46 and doesn''t have any insurance now. He''s a W2 employee with no self-employment. He''s fine with not including wellness. His only health event was stitches in his finger a week ago which was handled by worker''s comp. He did Cologuard and all check out well. He''s healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. He chose Care+ $1250/$298, $125/$25. He enrolled and is all set with his welcome call scheduled.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-04 17:03:01', '2026-03-04 17:07:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181861006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, '3-4-26 Playing phone tag with Julia to give her a refresher on her membership. She''s confused now that HAB has ended and what she''s paying for and what she has for wellness.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-04 16:53:08', '2026-03-04 16:53:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181861001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182477018', 'Gene Greene', NULL, '3-4-26 Sara is trying to figure out her income with Gene''s for April 1st onward. Her severance is ending March 31st and insurance ending the same time unless she chooses Cobra. Gene earns about $30K which then qualifies them for Medicaid which she does not want. She''s planning to start her own business and really has no idea how quickly she''ll bring in money for that. So, we guessed a $10K income for a starter and that gets them into an APTC range of about $1800. Even when I increased their income to $73,888 by adding in unemployment of $844 a week they still get a $1789 APTC. The APTC barely changed. But, she might not apply for unemployment since she''s not looking for a job. She''s planning to start her own biz. She has too many variables to nail it down. I suggested she speaks with a CPA and her husband to best determine their ath moving forward. She will do so and we will meet again next week. She might do all C4 or split between C4 and MCS. Sara''s son Jett is 16, Sara is 51 and Gene is 62 in a week. They live in Arapahoe County, 80120.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-04 16:26:53', '2026-03-04 19:12:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181805119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', '3/4/3036', 'Spoke with spouse Hillary about her son''s labs that lyric was saying they could do for $300, I relayed the information from representative at lyric that she sent Julia, which was: we offered the lab program for the most affordable option lyric offers, if the member would like to go outside of their lab pricing their more than welcome to request a generic lab order from lyric and print it out and take to their desired lab for testing. After Hillary continued to yell at me for what lyric told her son I had mentioned I understood the frustration. The only way we can fix it is speaking with lyric to go ahead and send that laboratory order to your son that way he can take where he would like. From there I went ahead and transferred Hillary to lyric for further assistance...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-04 14:57:38', '2026-03-04 14:57:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181818124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, '2/27/26<br>Hillary called because she claims that the telehealth provider was trying to charge her for son wellness labs. they wanted to take a payment of 300$, I advised her that while that was an option she can also just request a lab order and take that to a lab and show her mpb health card AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-04 14:51:32', '2026-03-04 14:51:32'),
