  ('zcrm_1579374000181812053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160692002', 'Charles Ritenour', NULL, '3/4/26<br>Member called in to see what to do after getting lab orders from dr on telehealth. showed him where to find the orders and let him know he can take those to the lab and get his blood work. Told him to show his ARM card and if everything is preventative it will be taken care of and anything not preventative they will send hi ma bill for the balance.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-04 13:08:29', '2026-03-04 13:08:29'),
