  ('zcrm_1579374000181806035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133663012', 'Steven Hitchcock', NULL, 'This member submitted cancellation eff 4/26 due to getting employer coverage.  Member stated He was never notified that his request to add his spouse had been processed.  I sent member 3 emails in the 12/25 -1/26 timeframe.<br>1st email dated 12/4 - verification of addition of spouse<br>2nd email dated 1/15- answering members questions by directing him to have his spouse reach out to the Conciergie for help on the following: downloading the App, scheduling a Welcome Call &amp; answering any questions she may have.  I also directed him where to get the Change Form to submit for when they move.<br>3rd email dated 1/26 - verification of address change.<br>I will process Members cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-04 08:18:27', '2026-03-04 08:18:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181805031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080702012', 'Jonathan Bill', '3/4/2026', 'Spoke to Jonathan about getting his wife logged into the app. He also expressed to me he was able to Zion with his accoutn and his spouses account about two weeks ago and now they are unable to do so. I let them know we have been having a file transfer issue and are activley working to resolve the issue. I highlighted his name in thr daily log....rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-04 08:18:03', '2026-03-04 08:25:13'),
