  ('zcrm_1579374000181740125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110083002', 'Benjamin Stephan', '3/3/2026', 'Spoke with Benjamin about a vasectomy. I let him know that in this case it would not be preventive and he could go to wherever he felt more comfortable for the procedure and would be responsible for his IUA of $1250. I also let him know per his second question a general eye exam would not be covered..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-03 13:40:13', '2026-03-03 13:40:13'),
