  ('zcrm_1579374000181748257', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133663012', 'Steven Hitchcock', 'clarified notes - 03/03/2026', '<b>Member report:</b> In <b>late Dec 2025</b>, member’s advisor/agent requested <b>physical ID cards</b> be mailed. This request was made <b>after the plan was set to change to “Member + Spouse” in Jan 2026</b> (wife added effective January).<br><br><b>Issue:</b> After spouse was added, member states there was <b>no new Schedule A / Welcome Call email</b>, <b>no confirmation email</b>, and <b>no update/notification</b> sent regarding the plan change. Member felt it was unacceptable that they <b>only noticed the change in the app</b>, while they were <b>charged a higher premium</b> with <b>no additional info</b> provided.<br><br><b>Verification:</b> I checked email history — <b>last outbound email located was October 2025</b>. No additional automated/notification emails found after the spouse addition.<br><br><b>Impact:</b> Wife never received the expected onboarding flow (welcome scheduling) and <b>never got her own app login</b> / onboarding opportunity.<br><br><b>Member actions:</b> Member reported this to his agent. Agent advised she <b>requested physical ID cards</b> and told member to <b>call Concierge</b>. Member waited for cards, assuming they would arrive soon, and <b>did not call </b><br><b>Concierge</b>, expecting delivery “any day.” Member reports waiting <b>~3 months</b> for cards.<br><br><b>Current status:</b> Member has moved/ is moving to an employer plan.<br><br><b>Retention note:</b> Member stated he <b>may consider returning in the future</b> if the employer plan doesn’t work out, <b>especially if there is an incentive</b> at that time.<br><br><b>Request:</b> Please have <b>Concierge Head</b> review:<br><ol style="list-style-type:decimal;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Why no post-change confirmation/onboarding emails were triggered after spouse addition</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Status/timeline of the </span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-style:normal;"><b>ID card request</b></span><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> and mailing process</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">How spouse onboarding/app access should have been handled, and what failed here</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Preventative fix so “member + spouse” changes trigger proper communications going forward</span></p></li></ol>', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-03-03 13:20:44', '2026-03-03 13:23:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181757130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129734002', 'Pamela Tuck', 'New Membership eff 4/26', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-03 13:20:31', '2026-03-03 13:20:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181740117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173870026', 'stephen Costello', '3/3/2026', 'Spoke with Stephen about how to find a provider within the PHCS network: <br><ol style="list-style-type:decimal;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="display:inline;"><a style="display:inline;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="https://providersearch.multiplan.com/"><u>https://providersearch.multiplan.com/</u></a><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">  (this is our provider link to the list). </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">You will (only ever) need to sort it by "PHCS Specific Services" </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">From there you can search by zip code, specialty, facility, name </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">For you specifically enter your zip and gastroenterology</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">It will show you all the providers operating under the network in your area.</span></p></li></ol><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">When making an appointment, please verify with them when you call that the doctor of your choice is still operating under the "PHCS Multi Plan Network." </span><br><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span>RYAN', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-03 13:20:14', '2026-03-03 13:20:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181757125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129734002', 'Pamela Tuck', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to increase her IUA to $5000 eff 4/26.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-03 13:19:55', '2026-03-03 13:19:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181757115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153824002', 'Samuel Young', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add email &amp; phone number for spouse.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-03 13:14:13', '2026-03-03 13:14:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181774058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175165052', 'Christopher Bramley', NULL, '3-3-26 Chris called to ask about upgrading for immediate benefits for small things but not for wellness. So, no need to upgrade. He also asked about dental but has super healthy teeth and no cavities. He splits in time between Silverthorne, Hawaii in 96708 and might even move to Boulder. So, a dental discount plan can work if he needs something down the road. But, it''s not worth the money at this point.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-03 13:13:15', '2026-03-03 13:13:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181739252', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181782001', 'Todd Hilvitz', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Premium HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-03 13:12:10', '2026-03-03 13:12:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181740112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176946015', 'Julie Alley', '3/3/2026', 'ARM card request has been completed...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-03 13:09:29', '2026-03-03 13:09:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181748237', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133663012', 'Steven Hitchcock', '03/03/2026', 'says his advisor requested cards be mailed to him in december after his plan was changed to member + spouse in january and they requested the cards at the end of december, there was never another schedule a welcome call email or even an update or some type of notification email after his wife was added to the plan and he found it crazy they never got any confirmation after the plan change, just got charged more and no additional info or notification. i checked emails and the last one was sent on october 2025, the only change he noticed was in the app, and he never got a chance to have his wife schedule a welcome or get her own app login. he reported this to his agent and she said she request physical id cards and advised him to call the concierge. he was waiting on the id cards thinking they wouldn''t need to call until he got the cards which he expected any day for 3 months. Said he would consider coming back if there was an incentive to do so later on in the future if the employer plan didnt work out', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-03-03 13:06:14', '2026-03-03 13:16:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181740107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171901002', 'Kelli Cooper', '3/3/2026', 'Spoke with Kelli, about needing to cancel membership, I sent her the cancellation form. She refused to fill it out, I escalated the situation to billing...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-03 13:03:14', '2026-03-03 13:03:14'),
