  ('zcrm_1579374000181739242', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123636002', 'John Nichols', 'Primary Member Turning 50 Eff 05/26', '3/3- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-03 12:50:52', '2026-03-03 12:50:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181739234', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124978001', 'Rob Martin', 'Primary Member Turning 50 Eff 05/26', '3/3- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-03 12:44:37', '2026-03-03 12:48:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181774053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000150772201', 'Adlai McMahon', NULL, '3-3-26 Adlai needs dental for his family. He was accidentally kicked off his Cobra dental plan by accident and it''s been a nightmare getting it back through his former employer. Cobra will end March 31st or April 30th. He''s not sure but realizes he doesn''t want a lapse in coverage either way. Zip is 81224. He currently has MetLife and they have some buy up option for ortho. I don''t have any plans with MetLife. He definitely needs ortho for his kids and nothing else is super important. They al go to Crested Butte Dental and it looks like they will bill all insurance plans for their patients.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-03 12:42:59', '2026-03-03 12:42:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181757083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175517002', 'Sandy Harden', 'New Membership eff 4/26', 'Member Only $1250 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-03 12:41:39', '2026-03-03 12:41:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181748232', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181723002', 'Mary Mele', '03/03/2026', 'I sent her an email in regards to an accidental email i sent her husband clarifying she can disregard it and that we have the proper contact info for her on file, also I sent an email to Leo regarding her cancellation for march and reenrollment for April and cc''ed her as she requested.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-03-03 12:38:04', '2026-03-03 12:38:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181747078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178587006', 'Steven Richards', NULL, '3/3/26<br>Transfer to lyric because he was having issues with booking his own appoitment AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-03 12:35:18', '2026-03-03 12:35:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181739229', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663891', 'Matthew Tidball', 'Primary Turning 50 Eff 05/26', '3/3- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-03 12:33:28', '2026-03-03 12:33:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181747073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130571025', 'Charlotte Cadieux', NULL, '3/3/26<br>Charlotte called regarding a pending bill from LabCorp. She stated that her provider informed her the visit would be coded as preventive.<br>Upon further review and discussion, it was confirmed that the claim was coded as an illness visit under acute vaginitis and not as preventive care. Charlotte insisted that because the test results were negative, the visit should be considered preventive. It was explained to her that coverage is determined by how the provider codes the visit, not by the test results.<br>She expressed frustration and stated that she did not consent to services being coded this way, as she believed she was only attending a wellness check.<br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-03 12:33:01', '2026-03-03 12:33:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181739217', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161657002', 'Sharon Greenberg', 'Primary Member Turning 50 Eff 05/26', '3/3- 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-03 12:25:54', '2026-03-03 12:25:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181774048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032752077', 'Mui Suri Fisher', NULL, '3-3-26 I spoke with Chris Buffington who wanted to hand me off to Mario Ojeda and thanfully helped me instead. Mario was busy but they communicated via chat. He showed me that the numbers on the quote are correct. It will only save them about $300 per month. They are going to see if level funded is an option after removing the 67 year old. It''s likely not an option. So, there may not be any solutions to bring down the cost even more. Right now the re-rated quote is $9229.40 down from $9572.76. They new rate quote is with the same Bronze w/ 12 EO at $526.51 and 1 EF at $1500.54 to equal $7818.66 plus 2 EO Gold at $705.37 = $1410.74 to make the total $9229.40. They are trying to do what they can to keep the group. Mario is sending an email now and will let me know what he learns as quickly as possible. Mui also let me know that 30-40 of their staff are from Mexico with a green card but not legal status. So, that''s why she didn''t know how to complete the forms. Therefore, many employees don''t really qualify for benefits. I''m not sure how to handle that when calculating employee numbers, etc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-03 12:25:33', '2026-03-03 12:25:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181748227', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180199004', 'Joshua Hatton', '03/03/2026', 'Martina was sent incorrect information regarding how her preventive care worked, from her advisor, I notified reba and she''ll be contacting the advisor about it. I also educated the member on how preventive care worked and let her know we''ll be looking into the incorrect info she was provided.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-03-03 12:25:30', '2026-03-03 12:25:30'),
