  ('zcrm_1579374000181649142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148917016', 'Herman Kirby', NULL, '3-2-26 Brianna called for help with C4 and I called her back and left a vm just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-02 16:13:05', '2026-03-02 16:13:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181649127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '3-2-26 I called Michael to update him about the response from Zion about Kyle $9K in labs. Michael answered while he was in Spain and sleeping due to the time change. <br>_____________________________________<br><span><br></span>This was escalated this to the VP of Zion and it appears he has received the final determination on the matter.<br><br>Bear in mind, appeal doesn''t mean a reversal - rather a reconsideration.  The details for the determination would like have stood and a medical doctor is part of the review.<br><br><br>Couple things to point out:<br><br><ol style="list-style-type:decimal;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">I noticed that part of the determination letter reflected that some of the services provided by Labcorp and ordered by the doctor were deemed ineligible for sharing as follows:</span></p></li></ol><br><br>There are tests for chicken pox, tetanus and also $4800 worth of tests "not shown".<br><br><br><br><br><ol style="list-style-type:decimal;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> The invoice date was 10/24 and was sent to Kyle, says Labcorp and tests requested by their doctor:</span></p></li></ol><br><br><br><ol style="list-style-type:decimal;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">The determination reads:</span></p></li></ol><br><br><br>Lab work was performed at Labcorp and office visits took place at Veros Health.<br><br><br>Please note:<br><br>And see  <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__www.labcorp.com_patients_billing_good-2Dfaith-2Destimate&amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;r=dVT6mh2rJEvNldIIymVnN6cN9mVnz23yakDKr-Yqv6Q&amp;m=PWtsHNT-kIJDcBoQCjnOnXPU-v7Y56ew_SZmnui6YEHOhaHgwFZC6e-XpNyF35O1&amp;s=jBXOQ7fVRoRO9HuBHp8tXHyeKSVWPvOlopt35JHkeHw&amp;e="><u>Good Faith Estimate | Labcorp</u></a><br><br>I would recommend going back to Labcorp and tell them that these labs should have been billed at the cash pay / uninsured rate.<br><br>They might be willing to rerate them.<br><br>I would also recommend requesting assistance in advance in the future.  Medical Advocacy comes with he membership and is tremendously helpful with navigation as they can recommend lab services locations and options that are substantially less expensive, i.e. <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__zionhealthshare.org_resources_medical-2Dadvocacy_&amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;r=dVT6mh2rJEvNldIIymVnN6cN9mVnz23yakDKr-Yqv6Q&amp;m=PWtsHNT-kIJDcBoQCjnOnXPU-v7Y56ew_SZmnui6YEHOhaHgwFZC6e-XpNyF35O1&amp;s=GVKOVYSyBc_riVWyMAleKq3XSf-iNeWoBOhfBAOtSRY&amp;e="><u>Medical Advocacy | Zion HealthShare</u></a><br>Healthlabs is a great resource to order and pay for your labs as they provide fair cost for self-pay patients and have multiple lab options in your area.<br><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__www.healthlabs.com_&amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;r=dVT6mh2rJEvNldIIymVnN6cN9mVnz23yakDKr-Yqv6Q&amp;m=PWtsHNT-kIJDcBoQCjnOnXPU-v7Y56ew_SZmnui6YEHOhaHgwFZC6e-XpNyF35O1&amp;s=zsR38NwxPn6ibCtVKM6TF_Vz7VSx-w-XMh9-HMgcWeY&amp;e="><u>https://www.healthlabs.com</u></a><br>Own Your Labs is a great resource to order and pay for your labs as they provide fair cost for self-pay patients.<br><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__ownyourlabs.com_&amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;r=dVT6mh2rJEvNldIIymVnN6cN9mVnz23yakDKr-Yqv6Q&amp;m=PWtsHNT-kIJDcBoQCjnOnXPU-v7Y56ew_SZmnui6YEHOhaHgwFZC6e-XpNyF35O1&amp;s=JZBMODRtJRFQEO-P21J5caTH7PsZ_URCEldjhdwVqzc&amp;e="><u>https://ownyourlabs.com/</u></a><br>Let me know if you have any questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-02 16:02:06', '2026-03-02 16:05:14'),
