  ('zcrm_1579374000181649117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, '3-2-26 Mindy called bc she got a $3K lab bill from Helios for her preventive visit. She already submitted the other stuff to HAB but this one is too late and most won''t be on their list anyhow. She spent 1 1/2 hrs on hold with Quest to ask for a self-pay discount. They said they don''t have self-pay discount at all.  Sounds like a lie! She got the labs done at Helios. So, I suggested she talks with Helios since they should have discounted rates with the lab company. She will try that. She''s also having trouble logging into her MPB Portal and never received the email notification to change her password. I told her to call back and ask for help again with that. Acelyn helped her with providing MPB with Coltan''s email address to be able to create his own account with Zion and virtual heathcare. Coltan just had an ER visit and needs to create a new Need.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-03-02 14:58:08', '2026-03-02 14:58:08'),
