  ('zcrm_1579374000181649107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180571002', 'Joanne Scurato', '3/2/2026', 'Emailed Craig back letting him know he was on the correct plan, and we need him to add an email to his account that way we can regiser for the app. I sent him the change form to fill out and submit back...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 14:39:11', '2026-03-02 14:39:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181649102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174010021', 'Alan Pomeranz', '3/2/2026', 'Spoke with Miriam about finding specific providers within the PHCS network, I walked them through the website and how to use the network. Preventive v. Diagnostic. We also spoke about the PCP recommending him go to a cardiologist for diagnostic reasoning. At that point I advised them they no longer need to worry about being in network for diagnostic visits..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 14:34:57', '2026-03-02 14:34:57'),
