  ('zcrm_1579374000181671049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142862002', 'Victoria Shavlik', NULL, '3/2/26<br>Did  a 3-way call with zion to see what the issue is with this members sharing request the processor is out of office and they will follow up with Victoria as soon as they are back Ac', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 12:30:03', '2026-03-02 12:30:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181647069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177371008', 'Jeffrey Miller', NULL, '3/2/26<br>reached out to help with a telehealth login issue. no answer so i left a VM<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 12:22:51', '2026-03-02 12:22:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181647064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176632007', 'Robert Baty', NULL, '3/2/26<br>Robert reached out on sales IQ to ask where their ID cards were and how to open an HSA. Explained how to go open an HSA and let them know to reach out for proof of membership letters if they need them. Also ordered another card for them just in case but they were printed on 2/20/26.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 12:21:57', '2026-03-02 12:21:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181647059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178071092', 'Colleen Irvin', NULL, '3/2/26<br>colleen called after having issues getting her medication. They said she needed the coupon and is having trouble with the app. We need to connect her with RX valet on the 855 line for them to speak with her pharmacists as well and they keep attempting the concierge line thinking that is where they need to call to resolve this. I let her know she should be able to use her RX valet card and she thinks she needs a specific coupon for the medication. We need to call the 855 line for Rx valet with her to get this cleared up since the app is giving her issues. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 12:20:42', '2026-03-02 12:20:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181647054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175689002', 'John Kaminski', NULL, '3/2/26<br>Lori called after breaking both shoulders. She needed to get logged into Zion portal. Connected her and Zion so they could give the link to activate the portal and Lori can begin her share request. Also gave Lori an update form when we realized the phone number was incorrect on E123. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 12:19:41', '2026-03-02 12:19:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181671044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176271003', 'Steve Dayton', NULL, '3/2/26<br>Transfer to lyric AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 12:14:30', '2026-03-02 12:14:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181649084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156834039', 'Andrew Thomsen', '3/2/2026', 'Spoke with Michelle about getting logged into the app, I got her all squared away and logged in and i showed her how to access the document manager...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 12:11:10', '2026-03-02 13:16:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181649073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175848001', 'Amity Brereton-Preis', '3/2/2026', 'Spoke to Amity about Zion still not having the correct email. I did a three-way call with Planstin and got it changed on their end so it would stop reverting back. With that being said the Planstin representative had mentioned it takes about 24-48 hours to get that file over to Zion...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 11:58:06', '2026-03-02 11:58:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181707008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058247082', 'Anne-Marie Marron', NULL, '03/02/2026 - Responded to member''s questions  regarding  lab order from a physician as well as putting $580 doctor''s (cardiologist) bill toward satisfying $1,250 IUA . SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 11:55:40', '2026-03-02 11:55:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181652102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176750006', 'Michael Kreger', 'Note from Member date 2/25:', '<span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Hi. I know I signed up with Zion Healthshare, and my account with them is in good standing.</span><br><br><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Question is, who are YOU? I don''t recall ever talking to MPB Health before. And I''m not keen to pay twice for healthshare.</span><br><br><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Is there a reason for me to have both Zion and MPB? Is one better than the other? I''m not even sure how this would have happened.</span><br><br><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Please help to ease my troubled mind and soothe my scrambled brain. I don''t remember ever being on a website to sign up for this, and I certainly don''t know about any membership information that I would need to check things on a website.</span><br><br><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Thanks!</span><br><br><span style="color:rgb(36, 36, 36);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Michael Kreger</span>', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-02 11:42:11', '2026-03-02 11:42:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181651088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176465024', 'Christiana Donovan', '03/02/2026', 'Welcome Call Complete', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-03-02 11:32:46', '2026-03-02 11:32:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181651062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180064002', 'Molly Anders', '03/02/2026', 'Welcome call missed, left vm sent email', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-03-02 11:29:58', '2026-03-02 11:29:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181649068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116114008', 'Robert Hunter', '3/2/2026', 'Spoke to spouse Lisa, about getting her daughter Reagan logged into the app. I walked her through the steps..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 11:26:48', '2026-03-02 11:26:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181649060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746011', 'Laura Seraydarian', '3/2/2026', 'Laura called in about a mammogram bill with CU Boulder from 2025, Ultimatley they had the wrong billing address and thats why they were not sending it. We did a three way call with the provider. I gave them the updated billing for where to submit claims to ALT Risk P.O Eagan MN etc.... Ultimately the billing department messed up for the last year. Submit to ARM and we can explain the circumstances...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 11:18:56', '2026-03-02 11:21:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181692006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116114008', 'Robert Hunter', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 4980 Question : I recently had a cracked tooth that had to be removed. That part is done, but there may need to be an implant put in after a few months. Is this sort of thing covered as an event or whatever we call it?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-03-02 11:11:08', '2026-03-02 11:11:08'),
