  ('zcrm_1579374000181649031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164241002', 'August Williams', '3/2/2026', 'Spoke with August spouse about their sharing request denial, he submitted it through Zion instead of ARM. I also explained the sharing request for a possible torn rotator cuff in the future if need be...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 09:28:29', '2026-03-02 09:40:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181649026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', '3/2/2026', 'Spoke to spouse Allison about preventive and diagnostic lab testing, I let her know if they are coded as preventive you can walk into your local labcorp, quest, etc.. and present your card. For diagnostic labs you can get the order send it to us and we can find you the best pricing for your area...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 09:22:16', '2026-03-02 09:22:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181646041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180959018', 'Ryan Hlubb Jr.', NULL, '3/2- Ryan Hlubb Jr called in regarding the confusion with his Membership and his father''s Membership.  He stated that he needed to add "Jr" to his profile, so we can differentiate between the two Memberships.  Patti updated this membership with "Jr".  It was the father''s Membership that declined and the Member has since updated the payment method via website portal and I reran the father''s declined payment.  Approved.  He is all set.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-03-02 09:17:12', '2026-03-02 09:18:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181652038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180277002', 'Bryan Koemptgen', NULL, '03/02/2026 -  Sent international information to member per his request.  SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 09:15:37', '2026-03-02 09:15:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181652033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180959018', 'Ryan Hlubb Jr.', NULL, 'After speaking with this ember to verify his account I added the prefix Jr to his membership due to the fact that his father has a membership also with the same name.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-03-02 09:15:15', '2026-03-02 09:15:15'),
