  ('zcrm_1579374000181649006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172810003', 'Rachel Schrock', '3/2/2026', 'Sent spouse James an email, letting him know ARM cards where printed on 2/20/2026 and they are working on getting them out. Also how to access his digital cards in the meantime...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-03-02 07:31:23', '2026-03-02 07:31:23'),
