  ('zcrm_1579374000181572021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120678002', 'Michael Hand', NULL, '2-27-26 Michael paid according to Patti and is all set to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-27 12:02:42', '2026-02-27 12:02:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181572013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117738002', 'Douglas Weller', NULL, '2-27-26 I called Doug back after talking with Patti. Doug was very gracious and he will see what he can do to meet your Tuesday, March 3rd deadline. He originally said he''s getting funds wired to him from Chile today but it takes 3-5 business days. That brings us to March 5th. So, he understands the urgency and will see what he do.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-27 12:01:38', '2026-02-27 12:01:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181553070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178289002', 'Jayne Valentino', '2/27/2026', 'Jayne called in and was wondering if her provider was in network and facility was in network. I let her know for primary care they were not in network and the facility for Princeton might be because we do see a provider that works there. Either way let her know she would need to call and double check...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-27 11:59:03', '2026-02-27 13:23:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181572008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117738002', 'Douglas Weller', NULL, '2-27-26 I spoke with Doug and he''s being wired money today from Chile for payment for his work. It takes 3-5 business days usually to be accessible in his account. I''ll notify Patti and see what can be done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-27 11:49:36', '2026-02-27 11:49:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181585024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154953001', 'David Byrne', NULL, 'Member submitted emails for spouse &amp; dependents.  I will update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-27 11:37:44', '2026-02-27 11:37:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181553062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156186015', 'Noah Burleson', '2/27/2026', 'Spoke to Noah in regards on how to find a provider within network using the PHCS list and always make sure to double check with the provider to make sure they are still operating within the network...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-27 11:37:10', '2026-02-27 11:48:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181553057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154953001', 'David Byrne', '2/27/2026', 'Spoke to spouse Leissa about how to get logged into the app using her specific email, also told her when her children go to create their app login they will need all separate emails for login purposes. She also submitted the change form for the kids emails...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-27 11:27:54', '2026-02-27 11:27:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181553052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175761017', 'Jeffrey Thompson', '2/27/2026', 'Spoke to Jeffrey and he was wondering about mail order. I let him know the first step was getting the prescription order e-scribed over. I emailed him instructions taken straight from the guide. He was having app issues for telehealth, I went ahead and transferred over to lyric..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-27 11:09:47', '2026-02-27 11:09:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181553047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176979001', 'Gerona Berdak', '2/27/2026', 'Gerona called in wondering how to present herself at the preventive service Dr appointment. I let her know just to show her card.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-27 10:58:07', '2026-02-27 10:58:07'),
