  ('zcrm_1579374000181572003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137479002', 'Kimberly Zimmerman', NULL, '2-27-26 Kim is trying to submit her final bills to HAB for preventive from 2025. But, she had a colonoscopy that she thought had been paid for 100% already. But, now UHC is billing her another $600 for the anasthesia. She put in a dispute back in Dec. and they have been telling her to wait anothe 3-5 days many times over. Now she''s at the deadline and can''t wait. I recommended she calls HAB to ask them for the best path and possibly give her an extension in case she can get the bill removed entirely.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-27 10:02:28', '2026-02-27 10:02:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181537036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165434002', 'Parson Hicks', NULL, '2/27/26<br>Parson called to get reimbursed for her mammogram, her adviser miss informed informed her and told her that she got reimbursed up to 600$ for her mammogram. I advised her that would not apply to her plan, and that we could submitted for reimbursement how ever we can not generate she will be fully reimbursed since she went out of network  AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-27 09:58:09', '2026-02-27 09:58:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181571001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177226025', 'Emilio Parisca', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4972 Question : Why is my wife no longer appear under the list of dependents?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-27 09:57:17', '2026-02-27 09:57:17'),
