  ('zcrm_1579374000181569006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176175017', 'Valerie Alloix', NULL, '2/27/26<br>responded to members'' email asking if mammogram is in network. she is going to the same facility that we already confirmed for her primary care visit so she should be good to go. Let the member know this as well as the answer to her question about yearly blood work and where to go. Gave her a list of labs for that and explained just like everything else it is more about the codes on the bill. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-27 09:55:51', '2026-02-27 09:55:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181569001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176472047', 'Gopal Krishnan', NULL, '2/27/26<br>responded to member email inquiring about OB/GYN appointment. Let the member know we are working on it and will update them when we have some options for them to set an appointment. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-27 09:45:57', '2026-02-27 09:45:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181564023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178900002', 'Samuel Mumpower', '02/27/2026', 'Welcome Call Complete', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-02-27 09:37:14', '2026-02-27 09:37:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181553033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176401001', 'Mark Walters', '2/27/2026', 'Mark and spouse called in frustrated about the PHCS network and not being able to verify any providers for their appointments and requested we do them. I answered a few general questions in regard to how we go about scheduling them and what they need to do. I also emailed Mark the link to request an appointment be scheduled....rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-27 09:35:20', '2026-02-27 09:35:20'),
