  ('zcrm_1579374000181537031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153932054', 'John Littlefield', NULL, '2/27/26<br>John called requesting his 1095 c AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-27 09:28:07', '2026-02-27 09:28:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181553020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174009020', 'Charles Wiederhold', '2/27/2026', 'Spouse Carley texted in sales IQ wondering how to go about preventive appointments and diagnostic appoinments. I said the following: you will only present yourself as a cash pay patient for diagnostic visits (anything symptom oriented). We always recommend starting any Dr. Visit with an appointment with telehealth if your daughter is sick because it will save you an office visit fee and is at no cost to you.For annual routine checkups, you will want to use a provider operating under the PHCS Multi Plan network. <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://providersearch.multiplan.com/"><u>https://providersearch.multiplan.com/</u></a> which you can find here. When in the network list the only filter you will ever need is the "PHCS Specific Service" filter. When making appointments we always say to double check the provider is operating under the network.<br>You will present you digital or physical copy of your card for payment for preventive services<br><span><br></span><span><br></span>RYAN', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-27 09:15:14', '2026-02-27 09:15:14'),
