  ('zcrm_1579374000181427071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109410002', 'Kelly Bentley', NULL, 'I received a call from this member who didn''t know what we were charging her for.  I explained what this was and she told me that she had not been able to reach Misty and that she had spoke to someone over a HSA for America.  She did not tell me what was said  but it seemed like she was under the impression that her membership had been cancelled because she now has BCBS. I advised her that the last note in our system was 6/25 when she spoke to Angie no mention of cancellation in that encounter.    Member will submit form and is ok with a refund of the 3/26 Share Amount', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-26 13:33:30', '2026-02-26 13:33:30'),
