  ('zcrm_1579374000181423034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031476065', 'Michelle Sangster', NULL, '2/26/26<br>Member called to inquire whether an ophthalmologist visit, PCP visit for diabetic screening, and EMT services would be covered under the preventive portion of her plan. Advised member that these services are <b>not covered as preventive</b>, but they <b>may be eligible for cost-sharing</b> under her plan benefits. AC<br>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 12:53:29', '2026-02-26 12:53:29'),
