  ('zcrm_1579374000181470010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, '02/26/2026 - Advised Marc Krawatsky that son Raphael does not have a current e-mail address on file with us. Suggested that he obtain it for future communications from us.   SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 12:48:59', '2026-02-26 12:48:59'),
