  ('zcrm_1579374000181428087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135312001', 'Jennifer Lloyd', NULL, '2/26/26<br>Quinn called saying they were having some email issues. I went ahead and edited the email addresses on the dashboard and got everyone logged in. They should be good to go now but let them know if zion is still giving issue let us know so we can make sure they have the updated info.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 11:25:58', '2026-02-26 11:25:58'),
