  ('zcrm_1579374000181424080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178742023', 'Peter Wickersham', NULL, 'Welcome call complete verbally. Not able to get into APP.  She will get in touch with the Concierge when she has more time. Also once APP issue is resolved she can schedule a refresher call to go over plan details in APP. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 10:53:47', '2026-02-26 10:55:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181434058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166693002', 'Gemie McLeod', '2/26/2026', 'Gemie called in saying she was working with Cierra from lyric about scheduling an appointment and needed to speak with her, I went ahead and transferred her to lyric...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 10:47:06', '2026-02-26 10:47:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181434053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112215002', 'Brenda Harms', '2/26/2026', 'Brenda called in asking if the provider she chose said they did accept the PHCS network would they be good to go there, I answered her saying yes if the office said the provider is still operating under the PHCS network they should be good to go...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 10:18:26', '2026-02-26 10:18:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181427049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178425052', 'Robert Ryan', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 3/26  after 1 month on the membership.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-26 10:15:59', '2026-02-26 10:15:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181417048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176164009', 'Richelle Turley', NULL, 'Member updated payment method via website portal', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-26 10:11:09', '2026-02-26 10:11:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181419175', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169727001', 'Amanda Kuhn', '02/26/2026', 'She called in with questions about the 1095c form and how her tax preparer said she would need the 1099 hc form for mcc (minimum creditable coverage) or a different form for marketplace coverage in massachusets so she could avoid paying the tax penalty, Leo and I let her know that the 1095c form we send will suffice for her taxes and then Leo advised her on opening an hsa through fidelity.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-02-26 10:09:03', '2026-02-26 10:09:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181427039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120770009', 'Matthew Woltman', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Request eff 3/1 due to getting Employer Benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-26 10:05:53', '2026-02-26 10:05:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181434048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141321002', 'Joe Himrod', '2/26/2026', 'Transferred to lyric, he missed his telehealth appointment...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 10:02:21', '2026-02-26 10:02:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181424057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175689002', 'John Kaminski', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Transferred member to Acelyn to answer any questions about submitting medical bills and create a portal with Zion. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 09:58:34', '2026-02-26 10:03:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181434043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004648009', 'Julia Fisher', '2/26/2026', 'Spoke with Julia via Sales IQ in regard to doing some preliminary PHCS network searches. I did confirm one facility and one provider are on the list. However, they need to always double check when scheduling that they are still operating under the PHCS Multi Plan network...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 09:57:58', '2026-02-26 09:57:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181434038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154951017', 'Jeffrey Andersen', '2/26/2026', 'Phoencian Med center called in on his behalf askng what coverage he has, I let them know he has preventive care covered at 100 percent...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 09:49:06', '2026-02-26 09:49:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181428054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406061', 'Mark Ovind', NULL, '2/26/26<br>member called in to ask how to submit bills. walked him through what to do to start a share request<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 09:48:17', '2026-02-26 09:48:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181428043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173735024', 'Jeremy Sayre', NULL, '2/26/26<br>Sent follow up message to katherine to let her know what i found for labs near her. there is one option coming up within 50 miles. Let her know to please let me know what kind of doctors she would like to search for like internist or family medicine so i can search all of the types of doctors and see if there are any options within 50 miles or not. Then i will walk her through what to do if there are no options near by since they would have to pay up front and get a reimburse if the providers will not just submit the claim.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 09:46:48', '2026-02-26 09:46:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181434033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031476065', 'Michelle Sangster', '2/26/2026', 'Michelle calledin wondering about a referall a telehealth provider had written and wanted to speak to them, i went ahead and transferred her over to lyric...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 09:42:08', '2026-02-26 09:42:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181427029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160015001', 'Paul Beck', NULL, 'I received VM''s from this member re: Cancellation and after he submitted the form.  He will be canceling eff 3/1 due to getting Employer  benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-26 09:38:31', '2026-02-26 09:38:31'),
