  ('zcrm_1579374000181434023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174043001', 'Stephanie Brady', '2/26/2026', 'Spoke to Stephanie on Sales IQ, she needed the telehealth provider to switch her prescriptions.  I advised her she would need to call us at 1(800)519-2969 that way we could directly get her transferred over to the correct department..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 09:24:24', '2026-02-26 09:24:24'),
