  ('zcrm_1579374000181423001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174063002', 'Jill Dawson', '2/26/2026', 'Jill called in wondering what to do with her Mohs surgery, I let her know that she could choose any provider to do the surgery she would need to keep all the itemized bills that way she could submit for sharing. I also let her know that she has a IUA amount of $2500 and could also get a GFE from her provider to submit to the sharing community before hand, she said she would start collecting the bills and submitting would call back if she needed help... rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-26 08:00:59', '2026-02-26 08:00:59'),
