  ('zcrm_1579374000181370024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182477018', 'Gene Greene', NULL, '2-25-26 Sara is now thinking they will choose Premium Care until they have enough money to fund an HSA and have their new business bringing in money. They will look at the C4 plans for Jett.  <span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);"><b>Select Health Value Gold $1500 Medical Deductible looks to be the best at $370.60.</b></span><span style="color:rgb(77, 77, 79);"> Then Premium Care at $1000 is 603 totaling $973 which is far better than Cobra at $2078 with a high ded of $6K. She will share this all with her husband. I sent her the instructions for C4 and a comparison with RMHP and Select Health to include Dr. Cobry and Dr. Ketterman who are both pediatrics. We will meet again next week to discuss for an April 1st start date! They want to keep Dr. Cobry for Jett.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-25 16:20:37', '2026-03-04 19:13:00'),
