  ('zcrm_1579374000181330221', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165196002', 'Paul DiCicco', '02/25/2026', 'I got in contact with Paul over his plan and let him know we can change his plan back to Secure HSA by Friday (feb 27th) and also called his dr.Khwaja Hussain''s office at reliant medical group (they stopped accepting phcs as of january 1st) I emailed him about this, I need to confirm tatyano sayko''s network status (she shows up in phcs search but i need to call her office, her office line does not ring).', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-02-25 14:39:54', '2026-02-25 14:39:54'),
