  ('zcrm_1579374000181330211', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109179002', 'Corey Vincent', '2/25/2026', 'Spoke to Corey about providers in the PHCs network, he said he called one place who told him they were then called back said they weren''t. I explained to Corey it can sometimes be tricky because the providers can take themselves in and out of network so sometimes it requires more than one call. He is going to try a few more providers for his colonoscopy if he is unable to locate one he will submit a DR apt request form...rc', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-25 14:35:26', '2026-02-25 14:35:26'),
