  ('zcrm_1579374000181360018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175654001', 'John Krzykowski', NULL, '2/25/26<br>Carol is upset about how the plan works and that her in-person dermatology appointment is not covered. I explained that the preventive portion of the plan only covers services that fall under ACA preventive guidelines.<br>I also informed her that dermatology visits are typically subject to standard medical benefits unless specifically listed as preventive under the ACA.<br>Additionally, I sent her a form so we can assist her with scheduling her mammogram appointment.<br>Will follow up once the form is received.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-25 13:56:41', '2026-02-25 13:56:41'),
