  ('zcrm_1579374000181345021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175880017', 'Agnes Eide', NULL, '2/25/26<br>member called after son got in a motorcycle accident and went to the hospital. They wanted to know what to do next. Explained that they need to just describe themselves as cash pay patients and collect all the itemized bills for the related expenses for this accident. Then walked him through opening a share request and what to do from there.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-25 08:47:36', '2026-02-25 08:47:36'),
