  ('zcrm_1579374000181312001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177100020', 'Mischa Buchholz', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4953 Question : I had a telehealth appointment on 2/18 to get my prescription filled. I was hoping to use a mail order pharmacy (not knowing which one). I thought I would be getting a call (the doctor told me that and I also received an email about a follow up appointment that I would be called about). I never received any follow up call. I see no way to contact the doctor. Can he send the prescription to my local CVS that I indicated on the form prior to the call? I am worried that I will run out before it gets filled at this point.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-24 13:55:08', '2026-02-24 13:55:08'),
