  ('zcrm_1579374000181278084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176955001', 'Daphne Taylor', NULL, '2/24/26<br>called to get info from Daphne after we had 3 way with advisor about her RX issues. RX valet is giving inconsistent prices and i already let Julia know so she reached out to RX valet due to several members having issues. This is going to be escalated and hopefully they will fix some of these systemic issues. When we find out more we will update the member because she needs to get her medications ordered since they will be mail order and might take a while.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-24 13:18:43', '2026-02-24 13:18:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181300071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165196002', 'Paul DiCicco', NULL, '12.24.26 - Provided info on direct not having a MEC for state MA requirements. Tupac will connect with Paul to go over options to stay on Secure given Planstin rules. Asked for 1095 C. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-24 13:18:22', '2026-02-24 13:18:22'),
