  ('zcrm_1579374000181278063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173925001', 'Jay Adams', NULL, '2/24/26<br>Jay called in to make sure the emails were correct for him and his spouse. I checked everywhere and it is correct<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-24 12:00:50', '2026-02-24 12:00:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181278058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159677037', 'Stacy Otis', NULL, '2/24/26<br>Stacy called to check out what the process would be for getting a colonoscopy she just got schedulued. Wanted to know how billing is handled. Let her know to just give them her ID card and the provider can bill ARM directly with no out of pocket cost for her.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-24 11:59:19', '2026-02-24 11:59:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181264122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161284002', 'Norman Kraakmo', '2/24/2026', 'Spoke with Sherill again and we needed to connect back with ZIon. They never ended up calling her back to resolve the issue. We got into another three-way call, her membership with the emails they can''t seem to figure it out and they are manually doing her sharing request. She also needs to update her email on our end, I sent the change form...rc', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-24 11:57:51', '2026-02-24 11:57:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181300059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178261002', 'Rajesh Patel', NULL, '02.24.26 - Advised for each member over 18 to have unique email addresse for telehealth access and HIPAA. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-24 11:51:48', '2026-02-24 11:51:48'),
