  ('zcrm_1579374000181278045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180365001', 'Matthew Callan', NULL, '2/24/26<br>member called to make sure the email address was correct after they cancelled and re enrolled into the program. Checked everything and it looks like they should be good to go.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-24 11:42:53', '2026-02-24 11:42:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181264117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110468002', 'Emma Mallon', '2/24/2026', 'Emailed Emma an update from Julia and I''s findings. <br><span><br></span><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Emma, </span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">After speaking with my manager, we were able to make an appointment on our end using the self-pay (no insurance option). Remember with this clinic and the phone call we had with the staff that works there, the Dr. you are requesting is not in network and this would also be a diagnostic visit anyway. So, when making an appointment, there just say cash pay or self-pay. </span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">If you have any further questions, feel free to reach out.  I will attach what it looked like on our end when making an appointment for ourselves.</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Ryan </span></p>', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-24 11:35:52', '2026-02-24 11:35:52'),
