  ('zcrm_1579374000181284034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740100', 'Rossana Johnston', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to know why certain preventative items (bloodwork) were covered and other were not.  I told her that there are only a limited amount of things that were covered.  I advised her to contact ARM to ask why these items were not covered and she said that maybe I should speak to them to get them to pay.  Member not happy.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-24 11:31:54', '2026-02-24 11:31:54'),
