  ('zcrm_1579374000181249001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178388006', 'Chelsea Symancyk', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4950 Question : Unable to use multiple aspects of the app. Also not able to open member benefit cards and is showing an error with my plan. Should I have full access to app offerings?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-24 07:37:42', '2026-02-24 07:37:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181242033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176233024', 'Timothy Martin', '2/24/2026', 'ARM card request completed as of today..rc', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-24 07:35:44', '2026-02-24 07:35:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181242024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177689002', 'Vicki L Kensinger', '2/24/2026', 'Vicki emailed wondering about the behavioral health and what is after that. I sent her all the information including: <br><span><br></span><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;"><p style="background-color:transparent;display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> Behavioral Health for acute treatment. (6 baseline sessions, extendable at providers discretion). Call 1-833-483-0831 to contact with intake clinician</span></p></li></ul><ul style="list-style-type:circle;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:72px;color:windowtext;"><p style="background-color:transparent;display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Psychology (Ph.D.): $100/session for in-depth ongoing treatment</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:72px;color:windowtext;"><p style="background-color:transparent;display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Psychiatry: $205 intake, $100 follow-ups. Excludes controlled substances</span></p></li></ul><p style="background-color:transparent;display:block;margin-inline-start:72px;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;"><br></span></p><p style="background-color:transparent;display:block;margin-inline-start:72px;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;">RYAN</span></p>', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-24 07:33:25', '2026-02-24 07:33:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181245006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177124095', 'Sheryl Lock', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-24 07:25:15', '2026-02-24 07:25:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181242019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175880017', 'Agnes Eide', '2/24/2026', 'Called and left a voicemail...rc', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-24 07:11:56', '2026-02-24 07:11:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181245001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157242002', 'Christopher Mitchell', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update email address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-24 07:08:36', '2026-02-24 07:08:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181244001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178463008', 'Carolyn Wood', NULL, '2/24/26<br>Carolyn called stating that she has an appointment with a psychiatrist via telehealth but has not received any information regarding the appointment.<br>I informed her that once an appointment is booked with a provider, it is the provider’s responsibility to send appointment reminders and telehealth access information.<br>I attempted to clarify how the appointment was scheduled, specifically whether it was booked through Behavioral Health services or if she independently scheduled the appointment directly with a psychiatrist.<br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-24 07:07:08', '2026-02-24 07:07:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181238170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177127042', 'Christopher Romanoff', NULL, 'Spoke to member he needed to reschedule the welcome call. Sent an email to do so. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-24 07:02:29', '2026-02-24 07:02:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181242006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176958017', 'Rachel Visintainer', '2/24/2026', 'ARM card request complete 2/24/2026...RC', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-24 06:57:22', '2026-02-24 06:57:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181242001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176939055', 'Ajinder Singh', '2/24/2026', 'Followed up on a ARM card request and let her know that they have been requested as of today...rc', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-24 06:54:50', '2026-02-24 06:54:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181229044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181229023', 'Michaela Phillips', NULL, '2-23-26 I accidentally created this as a Contact instead of a Lead. Michaela came to me via Nikki Boye who''s been talking about health sharing for years. Michaela is 57 and her husband is 53. She''s paying $450and he''s paying $900 right now. They are both self-employed. Michaela takes anti depressants and hormone meds. She does mammo 2x per year and colonoscopies every 3 years due to family history for both. She takes NP Thyroid, duloxetine and progesterone. Her husband has Rheumatoid arthritis and  high blood pressure, both <span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);">managed well with meds. He also takes a med for bladder control and has Barrett''s disease. So, he needs an endoscopy every year for a screening. He also broke his wrist this year.  She watched 7-8 of the 9 minute video. She will share it with her husband. After we talked, she might keep him on his ins and possible move her to MCS. She deciding between Secure HSA or Care+ bc she might also pay for a Concierge Dr. I gave her the pricing for both EO or ES at $1250 or $2500 50-64. She will work towards an April 1st start date. </span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-23 21:58:08', '2026-02-23 21:58:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181114299', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160027002', 'Hannah Rackley', '2/23/2025', 'Spoke to Hannah about the difference between being signed up with us or Zion directly, she also wanted to know the pricing of adding her new born and all of the IUA''s. I let her know member + family that she is already on wont change  adding a newborn, emailed her the pricing as well...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 14:23:59', '2026-02-23 14:23:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181114294', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084187002', 'Jon Jenkins', '2/23/2026', 'Cathy calld in regards to the care coordination team via lyric working on her MRI, i went ahead and transferred her to lyric that way she could get some answers..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 14:15:27', '2026-02-23 14:15:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151152', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176597001', 'Kylie Pina', NULL, '2/23/26<br>Member reached out on sales IQ to get login help for her spouse. Gave member the info to set up the account and get logged in. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 14:12:38', '2026-02-23 14:12:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181111341', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179082039', 'Silvina Rodriguez', '02/23/2026', 'Welcome Call Complete', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-02-23 14:08:39', '2026-02-23 14:08:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181111316', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181020002', 'Lisa Wells', '02/23/2026', 'Welcome Call Complete', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-02-23 14:07:13', '2026-02-23 14:07:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181147016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176597001', 'Kylie Pina', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4949 Question : I’m trying to add it so that my husband can access his own account. When I go to Zion healthcare to login it says I don’t have an account. However, when I click create an account and go to finalize it, it says it cannot do it because I already have an account. Can you please help me figure out next steps for adding my husband so that he can access his own portal please?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-23 14:05:16', '2026-02-23 14:05:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172725002', 'John Emge', NULL, '2/23/26<br>asstsed member with logging into the zion portal<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 14:00:28', '2026-02-23 14:00:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173818039', 'Nicole Janky', NULL, '2/23/26<br>talked to nicole after husband had derma issues. Let her know what the options were and looked up some providers on bluebook<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 13:59:58', '2026-02-23 13:59:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155179001', 'Roxanne Olsen', NULL, '2/23/26<br>Member emailed to see what to do after a member stops smoking. Sent the guidelines and what to do <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 13:59:17', '2026-02-23 13:59:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109789002', 'Martin Smith', NULL, '2/23/26<br>checked with Patti about member getting a refund since he turns 65 in march and was charged for the month. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 13:58:36', '2026-02-23 13:58:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164272008', 'Richard Thill', NULL, '2/23/26<br>Requested an ID for member like they asked about through email<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 13:57:43', '2026-02-23 13:57:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169726005', 'Gregory Walzer', NULL, '2/23/26<br>called janelle and got a new email from her to add to her account so we could activate greg''s account. Now she can access the payment section like she has been trying to<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 13:55:48', '2026-02-23 13:55:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181114287', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177067001', 'Toni Chappell', '2/23/2026', 'followed up with Toni via email about his ARM card request, I let her know I requested one as of today...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 13:40:56', '2026-02-23 13:40:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181114279', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169910081', 'John Carlock', '2/23/2026', 'Marcia called in having some issues with the Zion member portal. I started a three-way call with myself, Marcia, and Kelsey from Zion to try and resolve the issue. Zion sent Marcia an email to send the receipts to Zion so they could manually send them in while they fix the issue, they were able to solve the login issue whilst on the phone Marcia is all set...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 13:28:57', '2026-02-23 13:39:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174052007', 'Bradley Reatherford', NULL, '2/23/26<br>received ID cognito request. Sent email to let him know we requested him a new card.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 13:14:28', '2026-02-23 13:14:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181224205', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177723002', 'Matthew Schmid', 'New Membership:  Eff 03/01/26', 'Member &amp; Sp MEC + Essentials', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-23 13:02:21', '2026-02-23 13:02:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181225174', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177723002', 'Matthew Schmid', NULL, 'All notes below reference membership under Amanda Eden Member &amp; Child MEC Essentials 1/1/26-2/28/26', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-23 13:01:06', '2026-02-23 13:01:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167071008', 'Jaclyn Bianchi', NULL, '2/23/26<br>jaclyn called to see what the process would be for a share request. Husband might need to go to the ER so she just wanted to refresh herself on what the process would look like. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 12:55:57', '2026-02-23 12:55:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175741004', 'Amy Hardman', NULL, '2/23/26<br>Amy called in to see what to do to get her prescriptions. I let her know if she just needs prescriptions she should first try the telehealth to try and avoid the office visit fees if she just needs prescriptions written for her.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 12:43:07', '2026-02-23 12:43:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181224195', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181172002', 'Eric Wende', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-23 12:35:28', '2026-02-23 12:35:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000147520020', 'Troy Huisman', NULL, '2/23/26<br>Maureen sent an email with bills in it for assistance submitting. Let them know the process for preventative and non preventative bills and what to do with each. then she emailed back about share requests so i went through the process on larger expenses for non preventative care<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 12:32:10', '2026-02-24 12:11:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181224177', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176598004', 'Caroline Herzog', NULL, 'Member updated payment method via member portal to same ACH three times', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-23 12:26:45', '2026-02-23 12:27:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143333002', 'Linda Word', NULL, '2/23/26<br>sent update form link after request<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 12:24:28', '2026-02-23 12:24:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179107002', 'Gregory Deckert', NULL, '2/23/26<br>responded to Greg on sales IQ about STD and yearly tests. Showed him <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://healthcare.gov/"><u>healthcare.gov</u></a> and what is covered for preventative.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 12:23:49', '2026-02-23 12:42:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180959018', 'Ryan Hlubb Jr.', NULL, '2/23/26<br>Ryan called to make sure they had different accounts set for him and his dad with the same name. He is a JR. Let him know things like email and birthday and address are all different. Only identical info is name. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 12:22:56', '2026-02-23 12:22:56'),
