  ('zcrm_1579374000181225159', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006102293', 'Michael McClaflin', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to remove dependent.  I advised that I could do that effective 4/1.  I will send out link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-23 12:17:51', '2026-02-23 12:17:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181224157', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176724044', 'Brian Cox', NULL, 'Member updated payment method via member portal', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-23 12:16:21', '2026-02-23 12:16:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181114274', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175827003', 'Jessica Zeldner', '2/23/2026', 'Spoke with Jessica on the phone about Sedera and how to submit a new need. Her son fell skiing, hurt wrist got x rays... etc explained the process she is responsible for her IUA of $1000. Anything after that submit a need for with sedera and they can reimburse her...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 12:13:25', '2026-02-23 12:13:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181224146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181167021', 'Emily Davenport', 'Member & Ch MEC + Essentials Eff 04/26', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-23 12:10:02', '2026-02-23 12:14:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181114269', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662022', 'Jaime Klingelhofer', '2/23/2025', 'Spoke to Jaime on the phone and we did a provider search together for her mammogram. Only one result popped up Akron City Complex Care Center. I told her to call them to try and make an appointment make sure your double check they are in network. IF not they were the only ones within a 50 mile radius so i said ARM could most likely work with us if need be...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 11:59:49', '2026-02-23 11:59:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181108020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179107002', 'Gregory Deckert', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4948 Question : Sent message this morning and then got disconnected', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-23 11:58:28', '2026-02-23 11:58:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181225151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143333002', 'Linda Word', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to update address.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-23 11:49:41', '2026-02-23 11:49:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181114264', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110468002', 'Emma Mallon', '2/23/2026', 'As requested from Julia, I called Emma again to collect all information about the provider and address, number etc... to see if we could help out in what is going on..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 11:47:07', '2026-02-23 11:47:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181114256', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126137002', 'Sean Trebus', '2/23/2026', 'Called Sean In regard to his ear infection urgent care appointment voicemail he left, when I called he had said it has been taken care of...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 11:35:01', '2026-02-23 11:35:01');
