  ('zcrm_1579374000181114238', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178840005', 'Pamela Emison', '2/23/2026', 'Followed up on Pamelas ARM card request and let her know one has been requested as of today..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 11:20:27', '2026-02-23 11:20:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181229001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '2-23-26 Carolyn was able to stockpile her meds to last her for 5 months. She has $3K worth of Emgality which is 3 pens and uses them 1x per month only when needed. She has 16 tablets of Nurtec which is 2 months worth and can be used as needed. She doens''t need a colonoscopy for another 5 years, so good on that front. She''ll pay for her mammo on her own and labs. She will go with Care+ $1250/$668. Premium Care may not be available by April 1st. She''s OK with having to pay for an ER visit or something like that if necessary since she''ll be saving quite a bit monthly by going with MCS vs ACA C4. She''ll call me before March 15th for April 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-23 11:14:55', '2026-02-23 11:14:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181114233', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177095022', 'Courtney Boscoe', '2/23/2026', 'Followed up with courtney via email about requesting a new ARM card, I let her know one has been requested as of today...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 11:14:50', '2026-02-23 11:14:50'),
