  ('zcrm_1579374000181114208', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175408069', 'Paula Acuna', '2/23/2026', 'Followed up via email with Paula in regard to her request for new ARM Cards. I let her know as of today we have requested two new ones...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 11:03:44', '2026-02-23 11:03:44'),
