  ('zcrm_1579374000181224001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082410002', 'Nicholas Burdick', NULL, 'Member emailed in billing email asking us to review the Feb 20th payment.  He believes he updated his payment information to a different bank ending 8476 but the payment was drafted from bank ending 8211.  I replied that the Feb 20th payment was issued from bank ending 8211 and that is the current payment method on file.  There have been no other payment updates recorded.  Told him that 8476 is a prior payment method and if he wants to change it back to bank 8476 going forward, to change the payment method via the website portal.  Member replied stating that he tried to change the payment method because he is in the process of closing 8211, and the portal was down.  I replied to Member stating that if the payment with 8211 declines, with his permission, I can rerun using 8476.  Member replied to confirm that it is OK to rerun with 8476', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-23 07:14:30', '2026-02-23 13:44:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181114094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', '2/23/2026', 'Whitney called about his son and to see if they could get more than one annual visit in before he turned 18. I let him know asfar as the preventive guidelines go they would have to wait until July for it to reset for a yearly..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-23 07:08:10', '2026-02-23 07:08:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181170080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136714002', 'Jana Miller', NULL, '2-20-26 Husband is self-employed. They are considering adding the MEC. Their sons wellcheck for a 17 year old that took 15 min and they did nothing was $400 after the $100 discount. Totally insane. But, adding the MEC for about $1200 per year isn''t really worth it for only one more visit that she may do. She prefers thermography and doesn''t need  a colonoscopy this year but might next year. She''ll do the math and maybe call her doctor to find out the cash price. She''ll keep me posted and possibly upgrade for April 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-20 17:43:47', '2026-02-20 17:43:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181111183', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155206002', 'Kellie Matticks', '02/20/2026', 'Wants her 1095 forms emailed to her. set a followup.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-02-20 16:47:36', '2026-02-20 16:47:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181170075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156781087', 'Christopher Cook', NULL, '2-20-26 Not sure why this is coming through now...<br><span><br></span> Details<br>Member ID:<br>683809066<br>Name:<br>Christopher Cook<br>Address:<br>2130 30th St, Unit 3407<br>Boulder, CO 80301<br>Email:<br><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://poohcook@gmail.com/"><u>poohcook@gmail.com</u></a><br>Inactive Product:<br>$5,000 GigCare PPO HSA 2025<br>Active Date: February 1, 2025 - Inactive Date: July 31, 2025<br>$5,000 GigCare PPO HSA 2025<br>Active Date: August 1, 2025 - Inactive Date: September 30, 2025<br>Christopher Cook,<br><br>We are sending this correspondence as confirmation that we have received your written cancellation request. Your policy, which began coverage August 1, 2025, has been terminated. Please see details:<br><br>$5,000 GigCare PPO HSA 2025<br>Active Date: February 1, 2025 - Inactive Date: July 31, 2025<br>$5,000 GigCare PPO HSA 2025<br>Active Date: August 1, 2025 - Inactive Date: September 30, 2025<br><b>Thank you,</b><br><b>Customer Services</b><br>Monday-Thursday 9:00 am to 5:00 pm CST<br>Friday 9:00 am to 4:00 pm CST<br>Email: <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:support@americaschoicehealthplan.com"><u>b</u></a><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:billing@americaschoicehealthplan.com"><u>illing@americaschoicehealthplan.com</u></a><span></span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-20 16:46:50', '2026-02-20 16:46:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181111178', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179082039', 'Silvina Rodriguez', '02/20/2026', 'called in asking if her mammogram was covered, she did not know that there was a network, i informed her that valleyview hospital (the place where she wants her mammogram done). I told her that she needs to schedule a welcome call with me for monday 2pm her time, 4pm my time, and to reschedule her mammogram so we can get it done in network to avoid an out of pocket cost.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-02-20 16:39:31', '2026-02-20 16:39:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181170065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181170020', 'Tami Schweitzer', NULL, '2-20-26 Tami called to get help in setting up her payment for ongoing. I sent her the instructions from Cigan to do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-20 16:38:21', '2026-02-20 16:38:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181170060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181170020', 'Tami Schweitzer', NULL, '1-15-26 Tami get her payment to go through for C4 and needs to cancel MPB. Calling her now. All set now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-20 16:37:31', '2026-02-20 16:37:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181170055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181170020', 'Tami Schweitzer', NULL, '<span style="">1-15-26 After much go around she finally landed on Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 7200. She will try to pay the cash price for meds to get better prices. They don''t go to the dr. very much. They just do the wellness screenings. They will be moving and this network will remain the same and bigger than Anthem''s Essential plans. She''s familiar with Cigna and likes them. So, that became the winner in the decision making process. She said UCH has accepted Cigna in the past for her husband. Hopefully that will continue to be true. If not, she''s ok with it since they barely go there. Meds for husband are testosterone, albuterol, anestrazole. They all looked affordable on GoodRX. </span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-20 16:37:10', '2026-02-20 16:37:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181170050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181170020', 'Tami Schweitzer', NULL, '<ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">1-15-26 </span></p></li></ul><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Enrolled member(s):Ivan Schweitzer, Tami Schweitzer</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 7200</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$14,400</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$21,200</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">Payment required from:</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">02/0