  ('zcrm_1579374000181111173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181172002', 'Eric Wende', '02/20/2026', 'First call, in california, individual, 41. Self employed. getting his ein numbe rady within a month or two. hasn''t had insurance in years, found us through his mom pamela wende', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-02-20 16:16:24', '2026-02-20 16:16:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181170009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, '2-20-26 I called C4 and I''m speaking with Savanna bc Lorie sent me a text showing it looks like C4 re-enrolled Christian and not Stephen. Savanna says it looks like nothing has been done yet by C4. She''s not sure why Anthem would send that email since the escalation is still open and untouched. She''s double checking right now. Nothing more to do yet other than wait. Case # CAS-640111-Z9B6M4.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-20 15:54:13', '2026-02-20 16:01:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181170001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181168002', 'Benjamin Roman', NULL, '2-20-26 Ben came via Zachary Lovell. He''s 37 and works for Black Tie Ski and Bike Rental in Mammoth, CA.  He''s a mountain ski guide. They have worker''s comp if he gets injured on the job. I let him know this is secondary when other ins is involved. His ins will be $700-$800 a month with BC/BS. His only injuries were when he was 18 and then in 2020 ACL and 2021 shoulder. Those are both stronger now than before and no problems at all! He takes valcyclovir about 1x per year. He stock piled it for about 5 years worth while he had ins. His ins will end Feb. 28th. He will seek out more 1099 work this year to remain compliant. He can do events or even 1099 work for his current company Black Tie. He has many avenues to make sure he has some sort of self-employment income in 2026. He signed up for Secure HSA $1250/$359 and $125/$25. He put in Zachary Lovell''s name correctly as the person who referred him. He also has an English Labrador, so he can make use of the pet telehealth. He''s all set and planning to go to VT soon. No tobacco as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-20 15:35:00', '2026-02-20 15:35:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181151072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176632007', 'Robert Baty', NULL, '2/20/26<br>robert needed help scheduling so i transferred to lyric. he was having issues with the app glitching and cleargin all the info and not submitting it making it to where he could not tell if he scheduled the appointment or not. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-20 15:10:06', '2026-02-20 15:10:06'),
