  ('zcrm_1579374000181114079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128112002', 'Jessica Christianson', '2/20/2026', 'Jessica called in wondering about behavioral health, i let her know it is Behavioral Health for acute treatment for 6-10 sessions extendable at the providers discretion. We also have Psychology for $100 follow ups and Psychiatry for $205 intake and $100 follow ups...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-20 14:36:04', '2026-02-20 14:36:04'),
