  ('zcrm_1579374000181111147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181175005', 'Christine Kelly', '02/20/2026', 'Lives in florida, looking for a plan for her(58) and her daughter (18). No regular doctors/open to new doctors, mainly used millenium medical group. no medications.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-02-20 14:22:20', '2026-02-20 14:22:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181114074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176725019', 'Yumi Kosaka', '2/20/2026', 'Spoke to Yumi about how to access Rx valet, walked her through the steps of getting logged into health Wallet and searching for a prescription. I also let her know the telehealth providers can fill prescriptions so she did not have to pay for an office visit fee. Lastly, We went to telehealth to make her an apointment she got to the screen to start the health screening and said Im good from here if I have any questions i will reach out....rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-20 14:19:07', '2026-02-20 14:19:07'),
