  ('zcrm_1579374000181114064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177236017', 'Arthur Legg', NULL, '<br>Contacted member regarding mammogram coordination. Located facility: Reno Diagnostic Center (2615 Erminia Road, Reno, NV 89523 | 775-323-5083). Confirmed facility is contracted with PHCS.<br>Attempted to schedule appointment on member’s behalf; facility advised they must speak directly with member to complete scheduling due to required personal health screening questions. Facility also requires a referring provider to send mammogram results to.<br>Advised member to utilize telehealth services to obtain referral and ensure timely review of results, as currently experiencing difficulty establishing care with a primary care provider.<br>Continuing efforts to assist member in locating an in-network primary care physician. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-20 13:49:08', '2026-02-20 13:49:08'),
