  ('zcrm_1579374000181114036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084311002', 'Cynthia Delgado', '2/20/2026', 'Spoke to Cynthia on the phone about getting logged into the member portal. Once we got her logged in she wanted to see billing. I directed her to the new billing link within the app. Got her logged into view her billing. It was trying to get her to sign some forms for whatever reason so I am getting in touch with Patti to figure out what they are before having her proceed...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-20 13:12:22', '2026-02-20 13:12:22'),
