  ('zcrm_1579374000181111118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084311002', 'Cynthia Delgado', NULL, 'Member called in with various questions.  She was looking for her billing payment receipts and could not find them in her emails.  She briefly mentioned the price increase as of January 1st.  She talked about the Member Update form we sent to add her social.  She submitted the change form to add her social.  She also could not login to portal and/or the app.  I transferred her to Concierge to get login help so she could locate her payment history.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-20 12:12:24', '2026-02-20 12:12:24'),
