  ('zcrm_1579374000181117005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176950004', 'Wendy Wagener', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4934 Question : Hello, I’m wondering how I can go about getting a prescription to help lower my anxiety/flight or fight I’m dealing with right now. I’ve had a series of events that have caused my heart rate and pressure escalate to the point of not being able to calm down. I was told by my therapist to ask for some beta blocker or an anxiety medication that I could still have a glass of wine or two and not be impacted by. Please advise', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-20 11:58:39', '2026-02-20 11:58:39'),
