  ('zcrm_1579374000181151001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110168002', 'Bernard Huerre', NULL, '2/20/26<br>Bernard called to make sure he knew what to do for a yearly visit. I explained what card he would need due to him mixing it up with some older cards he had. Let him know which card was correct and what to give the provider off of it. Also confirmed for him that his Dr is in network so he should be good to go. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-20 11:53:54', '2026-02-20 14:45:14'),
