  ('zcrm_1579374000181114008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', '2/20/2026', 'basically re did a WC. <br><br><p style="background-color:transparent;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;"><b>Plan Education</b></span><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;"> </span></p><p style="background-color:transparent;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;">Date: Member needed education on how to utilize their benefits. </span></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;margin-inline-start:24px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Explained Telehealth: urgent care, primary care, mental health, pet care, RX Valet and benefits card. </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;margin-inline-start:24px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Explained MCS, cash pay patient, IUA, the need must be in the guidelines and medical necessary, and submission process. </span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;margin-inline-start:24px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Explained preventive care (procedure), PHCS network participation, MPB/ARM card for payment, and balance billing.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;margin-inline-start:24px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Informed to present the MPB/ARM card as form of payment.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;margin-inline-start:24px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Informed of balance billing if out of network.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;margin-inline-start:24px;color:windowtext;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="color:windowtext;background-color:transparent;margin-inline-start:24px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">Informed of diagnostic codes not being part of the plan and member would need to open sharing request if applicable.</span></p></li></ul><p style="background-color:transparent;"><span style="color:windowtext;"><br></span></p><p style="background-color:transparent;"><span style="color:windowtext;">RYAN</span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-20 10:43:30', '2026-02-20 10:43:39'),
