  ('zcrm_1579374000181050046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176230018', 'Kathleen Neal', '2/20/2026', 'Kathleen Neal Called in saying she received her physical cards in the mail and was wondering if her name on both cards is fine since her husband is also on the plan. i advised her that yes the physical copy will always have the primary members name on it. All the providers need are the group number and the address on the back to submit the claims to ALT risk..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-20 07:29:11', '2026-02-20 07:29:11'),
