  ('zcrm_1579374000181050041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170671016', 'Stephanie Holcombe', '2/20/2026', 'Stephanie emailed asking for another lab to be added to her panel, I responded with: <br><span><br></span>Thank you for your message.<br>We can certainly add the Quantiferon Gold test for you. However, as mentioned in my previous email, we are not licensed medical professionals within Concierge. You will need to call our office and ask to be directed to Telehealth so they can properly review and place the order.<br>Once that’s completed, you should be able to proceed with getting your labs done<br>Please let us know if you have any questions.<br>Best regards,<br>Ryan', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-20 07:05:23', '2026-02-20 07:05:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181070056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872009', 'Dante Chupek', 'New Membership:', 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure HSA', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-20 07:04:52', '2026-02-20 07:04:52'),
