  ('zcrm_1579374000181050033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174025019', 'Deborah Worley', '2/19/2026', 'follow up emailed Deborah: <br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">After discussion with IT, upon search it appeared there was an input error on their end when setting it up. </span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">What we have done is reset all of it on the back end, so when you open the app, you will want to hit "create app login" underneath the sign In option. You will enter your member ID: 685825911 so now it will be connected to the </span><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://deworley53@gmail.com/"><u>deworley53@gmail.com</u></a><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> for your app login....rc </span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-19 14:47:43', '2026-02-19 14:47:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181050028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173025002', 'Trina Oyloe', '2/19/2026', 'Leo spoke to Trina, let her know what she was trying to use (deductible tracking) on her HSA account through Lively Bank she did not need to access therefore not seeing us pop up as an insurance option. Let her know that as long as she is in and funded the account she is all set. We also informed Trina there was new cards requested on 2/17/2026 and printed ones back in December of 2025 but there was a shipping issue and they never made it to her..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-19 14:46:15', '2026-02-19 14:46:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181050023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176024001', 'Thomas Kenney', '2/19/2026', 'Spouse Wendy called in and i walked her through the PHCs network link, how to search and make sure when scheduling an appointment you are double checking to make sure they are still operating under the PHCS Multi Plan network ..RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-19 14:37:51', '2026-02-19 14:37:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181050018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529495', 'Keith Purcell', '2/19/2026', 'spoke to Keith about getting an script from a telehealth provider, transferred to lyric to speak with provider..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-19 14:28:24', '2026-02-19 14:28:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181043028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '2/19/26<br>Going back and forth trying to get everyone in the membership logged in. It has to be user error now since everything has been fixed and we logged in to every account on our end so now we need to figure out what they are doing wrong to get them all logged in. It should only be Rick now still having login issues says michelle. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-19 14:20:39', '2026-02-19 14:20:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181049007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175165068', 'Julia Rossi', NULL, '02/19/2026 - Sent member list of MRI canters in her area. Also educated her about medical cost sharing in the event that the procedure exceeds her $1,250 IUA. SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-19 14:16:25', '2026-02-19 14:16:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181042045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180285002', 'Matthew Prestero', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation prior to start due to finding other coverage I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-19 14:16:10', '2026-02-19 14:16:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181042040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180285002', 'Matthew Prestero', NULL, 'Member called in he will be cancelling prior to start.  Says he got something "better"', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-19 14:13:21', '2026-02-19 14:13:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181050011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121660002', 'Amendoa Hopper', '2/19/2026', 'Amendoa called in forgot app password but needed a telehealth appointment asap, I gave her the email she used for her account the first time that way she could reset password at a later date. got her transferred to lyirc to at least schedule the appointment...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-19 14:10:09', '2026-02-19 14:10:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181059001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000181057002', 'Jordan Davis', 'Member & Fam $2500 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-19 14:09:29', '2026-02-19 14:09:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000181043020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079839002', 'Richard Goecke', NULL, '2/19/26<br>Spoke to Richard after submitting his complaint. He is good now because they could not figure out the telehealth and were upset we left cirrus. Now that i explained how things worked they seemed a lot more at ease. They needed a prescription written and did not know they prefer you to use the primary care option for that. Gave them that info and explained about what was going on earlier this year when he first tried to use lyric and we were having IT issues. He had to go to urgent care since he could not use telehealth and was upset about that but understands now that i explained at that time we were upgrading and changing the app/portal a lot and he probably tried to use it then.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-19 14:04:14', '2026-02-19 14:04:14'),
