  ('zcrm_1579374000180969041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173504002', 'Deanna Martinson', NULL, 'Member called in stating she did not see her payment process and wanted to be sure she had the right card on file.  She thought billing was on the 19th.  I told her billing is on the 20th and we reviewed the current active card and exp date on file as she recently updated it.  She is all set.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-19 07:46:41', '2026-02-19 07:49:46'),
