  ('zcrm_1579374000180874111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133865034', 'Astrid Weisseise', '2/18/2026', 'Astrid called in wondering about dermatology. I advised her it is the three visits on virtual end nothing in person, she advised it may be skin cancer. I advised her all the  appointments and possible procedures and anesthia etc.. all could be put towards her IUA amount of 2500 which the rest of it can be submitted for sharing...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-18 13:44:46', '2026-02-18 13:44:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180876088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174208002', 'Todd Palladino', NULL, '2/18/26<br>Todd asked through text about his Dr being in network. Will call to verify if they are or not and then help him make an appointment if they are or send him a list of providers and assist him from there.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-18 13:42:35', '2026-02-18 13:42:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180875112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175862005', 'Angela Garcia', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 3/26 2 months after enrolling in membership, citing fianacial reasons.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-18 13:38:43', '2026-02-18 13:38:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180876067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180507001', 'Brooks Marsted', NULL, '2/18/26<br>Elgin called in after getting frustrated with the multiplan site. She called four different people and said the right things as far as asking if they still use PHCS and they did not. She was thinking we gave them a search option that gave her all results to people who do not accept the network. Will call and verify a few providers then reach back out and let member know so she can pick and we can get her an appointment. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-18 13:34:21', '2026-02-18 13:34:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180876062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134092002', 'Karen Thompson', NULL, '2/18/26<br>Spoke to Karen on sales IQ to answer her questions about yearly blood work being covered. I verified her membership included preventative and then let her know that yes it is covered as long as it is normal yearly blood work.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-18 13:23:54', '2026-02-18 13:23:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180876057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173223017', 'Susie Runkle', NULL, '2/18/26<br>Called and left a VM explaining that we take complaints seriously and that when dr''s cancel appointments or do not show then the Dr will have the file marked and potentially not bu used for their services anymore. Lyric and MPB take the complaints and make sure to address them so things are better for members in the future. Made sure to express all of this to Susie in the VM.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-18 13:21:39', '2026-02-18 13:21:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180874103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156134012', 'Sheryl Hunter', '2/18/2026', 'Sheryl emailed saying she hurt her ankle and might need x rays what she should do, i advised her it is diagnostic she can go where she wants, said I recommend starting with telehealth to save you an office visit fee then proceed for imaging. within the email i also linked a PDF with all the lowest pricing x rays in her area for ankle....RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-18 13:12:08', '2026-02-18 13:12:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180871157', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180915018', 'Stephanie Becker', 'Member & Sp $1250 IUA Secure HSA', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-18 13:05:37', '2026-02-18 13:05:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180895018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134092002', 'Karen Thompson', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4920 Question : Is blood work covered as part of my physical exam?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-18 12:54:27', '2026-02-18 12:54:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180876049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081699002', 'Marcia Johnson', NULL, '02/18/26<br>Marcia called to make sure her address was updated. Zion was telling her they were having issues finding the new address. Let them member know that on our end at least everything has been changed and updated across all platforms as per procedure for when an address update form is submitted.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-18 12:51:21', '2026-02-18 12:51:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180876044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170404002', 'Tara Albrigo', NULL, '2/18/26<br>Perry called to find out more on his preventative care benefits. explained how it all works and what to say to providers as well as guided him to his card in the app so he would have that to give to the provider. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-18 12:43:28', '2026-02-18 12:43:28'),
