  ('zcrm_1579374000180875097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118268030', 'Matthew Garcia', NULL, 'Member submitted a question via the chat wanting to know how much the MEC cost.  After this was looked over by Leo this member enrolled in the Direct membership that does not have a MEC.  After speaking to Leo this member has elected upgrade to the Secure membership eff 3/26.  I will process the change.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-18 12:39:52', '2026-02-18 12:39:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180876039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109171008', 'Sherry Allen', NULL, '2/18/26<br>Sherry called to find out what to do about the upcoming gall bladder procedure she will be having. Walked her through the Share request process and let her know what she needs to get for documents and how to get them submitted. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-18 12:20:08', '2026-02-18 12:20:08'),
