  ('zcrm_1579374000180932011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117877002', 'Angela M Gutierrez', NULL, '02.18.26:  Called Sergio. Asked if Angela and Alfredo want to enroll for a March 1 start date. He said they are out of the country and he will contact them and ask. He said they might prefer to start April 1 but he will find out and let me know today. I told him the deadline is tomorrow if they want to re-enroll. Sergio asked if we could have a video call and I said I would set that up.   <br>I also asked Sergio if they want to continue to pay by credit card (w/a 3% monthly fee) or if they would like to pay through a bank account which would be debited monthly. He said he would ask them that as well. Sergio told me they want the same health plan (CARE+) and asked me to send him the current rate. I emailed him the requested information.  JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2026-02-18 12:04:05', '2026-02-18 12:04:05'),
