  ('zcrm_1579374000180876034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178943145', 'Mary Primo', NULL, '2/18/26<br>Member called to get assistance with verifying if a provider is on the PHCS network. Will call Dr to verify then call member back to inform.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-18 11:54:53', '2026-02-18 11:54:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180914003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064056212', 'Daryl Mackie', NULL, '2-18-26 Daryl is ready to re-enroll his wife and kids to make sure there''s no lapse in benefits. They will go onto Care+ for March 1st from Secure HSA which goes through Feb. 28th. He''s moving to Medicare for March 1st. They do wellness on their own. They completed the application for Care+ $1250/$668 and I removed the $100 since they are active members already and will have no lapse. All set until Ava turns 26 and we''ll figure out the best option for her at that time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-18 11:54:46', '2026-02-18 12:24:45'),
