  ('zcrm_1579374000180932006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135149007', 'Timur Zamaletdinov', NULL, '02.18.26:  Called Tim - l/m to c/b. Also texted him to ask if he''s made any decisions re: his CARE+ plan. Told him, if he wants to do a March 1 start date, he''ll have to make any changes or re-enroll by 2/20. Asked him to call or text me his thoughts.<br>Re-sent my last email as a refresher of the information he needed. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2026-02-18 11:27:31', '2026-02-18 11:27:31'),
