  ('zcrm_1579374000180821048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, '2-17-26 Mindy called to decide what to do to replace the loss of HAB. They are definitely self employed. They own 5 LLC''s and a roofing company. She chose to add the MEC and they do fund an HSA. She said she was trying to get their friends the Fein''s to join When she did the math she said they''ve saved 1/2 milliion dollars!  I did the math and I think she meant 1/4 million dollars. They were about to pay $4K per month back in 2021 if they hadn''t switched to MPB. She''s thrilled. They will pay $1070 for Secure HSA / $1250. Once their son turns 26 in June they will pay $774/$1250. She''s so pleased. She LOVED HAB and is sad to see it go. They reimbursed her within about 24 hrs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-17 15:39:39', '2026-02-17 15:39:39'),
