  ('zcrm_1579374000180787100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177115054', 'Pamela Alma Weymouth', NULL, '2/17/26<br>member very confused when starting. Did not know how anything worked at all. Explained preventative care and share requests and tried to explain the differences and how the membership worked. went through welcome call script but member was only interested in what she was asking about. Did not get to fully explain the benefits because she did not have a lot of time and said she will go to app/portal later. explained this is part of the welcome call but she was going to try and schedule another one later.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-17 12:21:36', '2026-02-17 12:21:36'),
