  ('zcrm_1579374000180821035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089685024', 'Brent Skinner', NULL, '2-17-26  I called Brent back and updated him on what I learned from C4 above. I asked him to let me know when he hears from Medicaid and I will cancel his Anthem plan at that time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-17 12:02:06', '2026-02-17 12:02:06'),
