  ('zcrm_1579374000180821024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089685024', 'Brent Skinner', NULL, '2-17-26 I called C4 and spoke with Savanna. She can see his application is getting sent to Medicaid. She said they''re working faster on approvals now. As long as he has no other income then he should qualify for Medicaid. He will be notified via email and USPS. They will look at his most recent taxes which show $12K in 2024. I can call C4 to check the status before the end of the month and then cancel his Anthem plan once he''s approved. If I cancel now and he''s rejected we have no way to get him back into a plan moving forward. So, it''s best to leave well enough alone. He will just not pay the $1400 premium for March onward.  This call Ref # is CAS-634818-H7F3Y7.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-17 11:51:30', '2026-02-17 11:53:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180782077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178799001', 'Glenn Reibin', '2/17/2026', 'Spoke to Lisa on Sales IQ about husband Glenn and herself having the same email and refusing to make another one for the app so only Glenn would be logged in, explained for HIPPA they would need to have another email for telehealth, rx valet, Zion sharing etc...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-17 11:51:01', '2026-02-17 11:51:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180782072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079839002', 'Richard Goecke', '2/17/2026', 'Helped Richard and his Son charles get their member ID''s and set up the app and get logged in..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-17 11:46:19', '2026-02-17 11:46:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180821014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089685024', 'Brent Skinner', NULL, '2-17-26 Brent didn''t realize his plan was going from $200+ to $418 in 2026. He hadn''t paid at all and was getting rejected by his Dr. So, he called Anthem and paid for Jan. only. He hasn''t paid for Feb. yet and has his appt today or tomorrow. After much discussion he decided he will cancel his appt for tomorrow. He won''t make much this year. His best guess is $20K. He doesn''t know what he made in 2025 yet. 2024 was $12K. He can''t afford $418 and we''re past open enrollment to make any changes to his account. So, Medicaid will be best at this point. He truly thinks $20K is the most realistic. So, I changed it to $20K and it looks like he will qualify. However, in the meantime his plan is $1400! So, he is Not on auto pay. He won''t pay for Feb or onward. He will not wait to get approved for Medicaid and then he can go to his doctor''s appt. <br><span><br></span>Here''s showing the plan at full cost which he''s not going to pay - <br><span><br></span><p style="background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);"><b>Enrolled member(s):</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(232, 241, 212);">Brent Skinner</span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><br></span></p><p style="display:flex;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Anthem Silver Pathway 2800 $0 Select Drugs</b></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Family Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Primary Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Deductible</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Individual Out-of-Pocket Max</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Specialist Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$2,800</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">$10,150</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">30% (after deductible)</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">Urgent Care Coinsurance</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);">N/A</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><b>Payment required from:</b></span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);">01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);background-color:rgb(227, 246, 255);"> $0.00 </span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Exchange policy number:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 2555000488</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Coverage dates:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 01/01/26 - 12/31/26</span></p><p style="display:flex;margin-inline-start:0.5rem;"><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"><b>Last updated:</b></span><span style="color:rgb(43, 49, 60);"> 02/17/26</span></p>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-17 11:35:12', '2026-02-17 11:35:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180787087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177115054', 'Pamela Alma Weymouth', NULL, '02/17/26<br>attempted welcome call, left VM and will send text as they said they respond quicker that way. she called back and we got it done<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-17 11:33:03', '2026-02-17 11:40:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180826001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178799001', 'Glenn Reibin', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Concierge', 'Visit ID : 4903 Question : I’m setting up the App for my husband and I. His went smoothly, but mine wants a different email and I don’t have one. We share the same email address. What do I do?', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2026-02-17 11:22:14', '2026-02-17 11:22:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180787076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178266002', 'Brian O''Neill', NULL, '2/17/26<br>Brain called to find out what to do about leaving his meds in another state. Transferred to lyric for them to help him<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-17 11:16:49', '2026-02-17 11:16:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180814009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178742002', 'Princy Varughese', '02/17/2026', 'Welcome Call Complete.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-02-17 11:11:23', '2026-02-17 11:11:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180782065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173025002', 'Trina Oyloe', '2/17/2026', 'Trina called in wondering if in person dermatology was covered under preventative service. explained to her it was not and that she had access to three virtual visits per family,per year followed by $60 dollar follow up fee''s. She was also asking what is difference between diagnostic and preventive. I explained that... then she asked whats all the preventative services, i rattled off a few but also emailed her a link to <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://healthcare.gov/"><u>healthcare.gov</u></a> for the full list.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-17 11:01:14', '2026-02-17 11:01:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180769227', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177141004', 'Kolbe Pruitt', NULL, 'Spoke to member he needed to reschedule the welcome call. Sent an email to do so. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-17 11:00:40', '2026-02-17 11:00:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180821006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167357006', 'Deborah Pope', NULL, '2-17-26 Deb''s ticket just closed. Talking with Maura from C4 about Escalation. Confirmed that the plan is active. Closed on Feb. 5th.  Sent an email to Deb on the 5th. Joshua active all along. Ref. # 634569-X9S8K8. Ticket is closed and all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-17 10:46:57', '2026-02-17 10:49:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180782060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176611019', 'Angela Lukecart', '2/17/2026', 'Spoke to Ted, he had mentioned he has two residences one in Idaho one in Washington state. for Zion he needed to understand that Washington would not work Idaho could. whoever signed him up made it seem like washington would be fine for submitting sharing requests. rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-17 10:45:36', '2026-02-17 10:45:36'),
