  ('zcrm_1579374000180821001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, '2-17-26 Called C4 and Maura is helping me to get Stephen (son) Roch''s plan to continue on and NOT be cancelled. I worked on cancelling Christian Roch''s plan for the end of the month. She got a job and her new insurance already started last month. Lorie sent me a text asking for me to cancel Christian''s plan. Christian had a plan separately from the family and so did Stephen (son). When I showed that Christian has a new plan that started alredy and selected that she doesn''t need insurance the system ended Stephen''s plan as well! I didn''t touch anything about Stephen''s plan. I also didn''t cancel any plan. The system just suddenly showed it as ending Feb. 28th. Maura can see that I didn''t select anything indicating his plan should end. She''s creating an Escalations ticket right now. Ref# 634551-W3C3D7.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-17 10:36:39', '2026-02-20 15:53:37'),
