  ('zcrm_1579374000180537183', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175756025', 'Audrey Morrison', NULL, 'Member emailed in with an issue that she couldn''t gain access to the app after updateing her email.  She needed to submit a receipt to Zion for a Preventative vist.  She told me that she was not receiving the Reset password email.  The issue was that the user name hadn''t been corrected so it was being sent to the wrong email.  After doing this the member got the email and updated her password.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-13 11:52:38', '2026-02-13 11:52:38'),
