  ('zcrm_1579374000180639006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177165001', 'Linda Robinson', NULL, '2-13-26 Linda called to find out how to handle meds. She needs a new prescription for her Ambien and her Dr. is forcing her to do an in person visit at about $300 (she''s guessing). I suggested she completes the WC and calls the Concierge for help in using the virtual app to get an appt with a PCP to hopefully prescribe what she needs and get help accssing the meds. She was excited to hear that''s an option and will follow through now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-13 11:32:41', '2026-02-13 11:32:41'),
