  ('zcrm_1579374000180639001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008568067', 'Andrea Williamson', NULL, '2-13-26 I left a vm to see if she wants help in bringing down the cost of the membership. Patti said she reached out to cancel. Hopefully she''ll call me back. She lives in CA, so we''re limited with the options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-13 11:22:25', '2026-02-13 11:22:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180568196', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178853010', 'Kimberly Johnson', NULL, '2/13/26<br>spoke to kim who was getting a little flustered with a provider not knowing the network but being in the search. I explained how it works with billing departments and dr offices and how she should describe her coverage to providers once she finds them in the search. Let her know unfortunately there are some inconsistencies on the search site. explained where her card was and how to flip over for the info the provider was asking for.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-13 11:14:27', '2026-02-13 11:14:27'),
