  ('zcrm_1579374000180568104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447059', 'Florie Glusman', NULL, '2/12/26<br>Florie called to get more info on telehealth and how it all works. Let her know that it is unlimited because she thought after she missed an appointment she wasted one. Told her she gets as many as you would like. Explained how telehealth works and the recent upgrades and all the different ways she can save money using it.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-12 13:59:21', '2026-02-12 13:59:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180570050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177082041', 'Christine Kokoska', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she wanted to cancel membership due to the fact that she now had a DPC provider and that she would be going direct with Zion.  I will send out link and I directed her to reach out to Lou.<br>2/13/26-I received a response from Rachelle/Planstin on this cancellation.  She is questioning this as the Zion Essentials is only open to companies.  So she thinks that she won''t be successful in enrolling.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-12 13:58:09', '2026-02-13 07:07:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180537105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521288', 'Robert Glowczewsky', '2/12/2026', 'Cindy has been having issues getting reimbursed for her Colonoscopy, they have been trying to bill plainstain old address and not bill ARM for last 3 months they refuse to update the address for preventive claims.I told cindy send me all the information you have and I will reach out to Lori At ARM to contact the proivder specifically ...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-12 13:55:25', '2026-02-12 13:55:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180591066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173925001', 'Jay Adams', NULL, '2/12/26<br>Called to follow up on his sharing request his advisor did send him an email guiding him on how to do it and Zion is now in contact with him  AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-12 13:52:04', '2026-02-12 13:52:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180566037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166459011', 'Cindy Lee', NULL, 'Member called in asking permission to speak with Spouse regarding the billing of Membership and asked when it is billed and coverage dates and the process to cancel as they are going to get other insurance.  I told him to be in touch with Mike Montes and that I would send out via email the cancellation link and to submit it in before the 20th to avoid being charged on 2/20 for March. Wanted to know that she will be covered through February.  I told her yes. Sending link to Member &amp; advisor.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-12 13:50:28', '2026-02-12 13:50:28'),
