  ('zcrm_1579374000180537076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169447050', 'Scott Burton', '2/12/2026', 'Scott called in wondering about how much they share for his colo, I told him up to $2500 with his plan. He said they wanted to charge him 9 grand I sent him a healthcare bluebook list of 3 facilities that would do it for 4-5 thousand cheaper..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-12 13:05:02', '2026-02-12 13:05:02'),
