  ('zcrm_1579374000180591001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076023', 'Amie Brown', NULL, '2/12/26<br>Amie called because she is having very concernig sympotms and wanted to know how to use her plan. I instructed her to use telehealth so a licensesd medical professional can adviced her what to do. They sent her to the ER, I adviced her to present as self pay AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-12 12:19:57', '2026-02-12 12:19:57'),
