  ('zcrm_1579374000180582026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, '2-12-26  I called Matt back to let him know that since he has the additional MEC that he can go anywhere in the PHCS network for his colonoscopy and not via the places I showed him on the app. Those were all far away and he has to stay in network. He is planning to go Gastroenterology of the Rockies which I told him is notorious for changing to diagnostic coding when recommending 3 yr return. I coached him to advocate for himself and to ask questions before going in. He knows if it''s diagnostic that he will have to pay $1000 and it turns into a need with sharing above that. He was shocked to hear that they''ve billed $5K-$8K for other clients in the past. So, he will ere on the side of caution.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-12 11:44:03', '2026-02-12 11:44:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180537061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176543001', 'Stacy Hudson', '2/12/2026', 'Again, Stacy called in wondering what to do with a lump that she had going, let her know it is diagnostic you do not need to worry about in Network providers and I also made sure she understood anything attached to this could go towards an IUA...Rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-12 11:39:26', '2026-02-12 11:39:26'),
