  ('zcrm_1579374000180582001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171948133', 'Sarah Whelden', NULL, '2-12-26 Sarah is still getting emails from C4 about proof of income. I called C4 and spoke with Jesse. He looked it up and can see they now want her tax form 8962. Her new deadline is May 6th. I sent her an email letting her know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-12 10:25:10', '2026-02-12 10:25:10'),
