  ('zcrm_1579374000180524001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163967002', 'Alicia Thompson', NULL, '2-11-26 Alicia called bc she''s scheduled for  a hip surgery and is getting declined from sharing with Sedera. She first started having hip pain on Oct 2025 and did massage, then went to chiro, then PT and then got imaging. The imaging showed she has bone on bone in her hip. They are recommending surgery which is scheduled for March 2nd. Her Needs Coordinator told her to get in her appeal by March 3rd which is too late. So, I recommended she sees if they''ll expedite the Sharing Request Determination. She will also make sure all of her records indicate no pre-x, no symptoms, etc. There was one sentence that might be the problem from the chiro indicating the consistency of one leg longer than the other. The chiro already noted no pre-x. But, she''s see if she can do more. She was in good spirits. Worst case is she can get onto ACA by marrying her partner and may just keep her membership in case it will pay for the ded or mop as secondary. She will inquire with her Needs Coordinator, Daphne.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-11 16:34:06', '2026-02-11 16:34:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180486161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106957012', 'Elizabeth Hoisington', NULL, '2/11/26<br>Assisted Elizabeth with finding a provider AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 14:54:13', '2026-02-11 14:54:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180475170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178062022', 'Carolyn Szalinski', '2/11/2026', 'Carolyn called in with a Zion not receiving their membership information. had a 3 way call the representative had said they have not received anything. When she checked with her admin they had also mentioned there must''ve been a file issue....rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 14:50:05', '2026-02-11 14:50:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180473228', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093542002', 'Donna Due', NULL, '2/11/26<br>member called to get some info on the membership and how things worked. used to be a member and had zion and is now with sedera so wanted to see if that means things worked different. let them know we switched a couple of providers but the products are basically the same. i also explained the change from Planstin to ARM.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 14:23:58', '2026-02-11 14:23:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180486142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176224019', 'Dustin Young', NULL, '2/11/26<br>Sent Dustin an rx quote AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 14:21:49', '2026-02-11 14:21:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180504036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, '2-11-26 Matt called to better understand his benefits from wellness to allergy to possible imaging, etc. He''s 53 and going in for his annual screening tomorrow. He knows to ask for whatever is included in wellness screening olny plus some labs he might want. He said he used his own PCP for allergy discussion and that lead nowhere. So, he used MPB''s virtual drs. and that was actually much more helpful. I think they prescribed him something. He also used it for when he got the flu. He connected with them in about 20 minutes and got what he needed. He was very pleased with the services via MPB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-11 14:21:10', '2026-02-11 14:21:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180482239', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180500006', 'Kayla Blantz', NULL, 'Member only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-11 14:16:31', '2026-02-11 14:16:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180475132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178139002', 'Renato Orozco Pereira', '2/11/2026', 'Renato called in looking for assistance getting logged into the Zion portal. I started a three way call with zion and the member the Zion rep said she saw both accounts one he has and the accidental one he made too. However the file appeared to not be sent over yet or it was still in transit. Told Renato he would need to follow up with them or myself. I told renato I will folow up with him...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 14:10:25', '2026-02-11 14:10:25'),
