  ('zcrm_1579374000180475111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153516001', 'Gavin Smith', '2/11/2026', 'Spouse Erin called in asking about her change form for new born Nikoali. She filled out the change form and received the confirmation from Patti. Son has been added in on our end in zoho and admin. She called zion to make sure and they did not have record of it. Zion assured her they could back date it so there would be no concern but they would need to talk to their agents who deal with affiliates like us to see if they have it. Possible file transfer issue waiting to hear outcome..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 13:10:13', '2026-02-11 13:10:13'),
