  ('zcrm_1579374000180482123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170441001', 'Glen Randall', 'New Membership eff 3/26', 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Premium Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-11 11:47:54', '2026-02-11 11:47:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180504011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064056212', 'Daryl Mackie', NULL, '2-11-26 Daryl is in CO for the week visiting. He''ll be back in AZ next week and will focus on setting up his family on their own membership. They do their own wellness screenings and don''t need that. His wife doesn''t need a mammo or colonoscopy. So, Care+ will serve them well. We''ll re-enroll them onto Care+ for March 1st, 2026. Their original start date was March 1st, 2021. Member plus children will be $668/$1250. I''ll waive the $100 and they will be all set. We will talk early next week or later this week. He knows of the 20th deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-11 11:45:41', '2026-02-11 11:45:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180482115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170441001', 'Glen Randall', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to change membership to Premium Care eff 3/26.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-11 11:45:24', '2026-02-11 11:45:24'),
