  ('zcrm_1579374000180475083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', '2/11/2026', 'Allison called in asking if i could check and see if a providr was in network, using the PHCS list i found the provider let her know that. Also, mentioned that she needs to always double check with the provider when making an appointment to check to see if thy are still operating under it...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 10:52:26', '2026-02-11 10:52:26'),
