  ('zcrm_1579374000180475073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179098019', 'Tiffany Blair', '2/11/2026', 'I called Tiffany back in regards to getting a follow up scheduled with telehealth, I transferred her over to lyric...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 10:29:25', '2026-02-11 10:29:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180504006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115984002', 'Colleen Patrice', NULL, '2-11-26 Collen is leaning towards Direct or Care+. She might want a colonoscopy which leads her to Direct but she doesn''t have to get it this year. She sort of needs ins for March 1st but might put it off until April 1st. She will ponder and keep me posted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-11 10:28:52', '2026-02-11 10:28:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180504001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182477018', 'Gene Greene', NULL, '2-11-26 Sara is going to send me the cost of Cobra to help us compare whether or not it makes sense to do one of the Premium memberships. Leaning more towards Premium HSA again to get the tax benefits. She''s looking towards April 1st start date. Son Jett has type 1 diabetes that we have to factor in. We are meeting again on the 25th after her mom''s visit for 10 days.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-11 10:27:31', '2026-02-11 10:27:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180475062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177233004', 'Suzanne Roth', '2/11/2026', 'Suzanne called in wondering how to present herself for diagnostic services (cash pay), how preventative services work, also explained how the pre membership condition clause works..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 10:24:41', '2026-02-11 10:24:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180486055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175843021', 'Anna Levesque', NULL, '2/11/26<br>Anna called to see if we could assist her with comparing price for vaccines. I informed her that for that she would have to go to the pharmacy as they can not give prices before until they run it through their system AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 10:17:15', '2026-02-11 10:17:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180475053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112127002', 'Christopher Kanotz', '2/11/2026', 'Provider sent them mail that arrived 2 days before the scheduled colo saying they weren''t covered. What happened when I made the appointment is that the front desk must have fed me the wrong information and allowed me to schedule him. With that being said i sent an email saying: <br><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">It does appear there was some miscommunication with the verification.</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">I understand this is a very unfortunate situation, especially given the short notice. Based on the information provided, I would most likely recommend canceling the appointment at this time to avoid the risk of being responsible for that bill.</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">If you would like, you can resubmit a request form and we can help you find another provider. </span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">They are going to make another appointment...rc</span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 10:06:19', '2026-02-11 10:06:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180475048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178892022', 'Todd Monter', '2/11/2026', 'Jane called in about a billing issue with a primary care that is in network. They were telling her that the address they had on file for ALT risk was different than the card and it couldn''t send it. I told her she needs to tell them thats the billing for alt at the end of the day and if they need to get paid to send it to the Eagan Minnesota address....rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 09:58:43', '2026-02-11 09:58:43'),
