  ('zcrm_1579374000180473090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173818039', 'Nicole Janky', NULL, '2/11/26<br>Assisting nicole find out if she would be able to get her hormones and follow up visits to monitor the results of the hormones through telehealth or if it is absolutely necessary for her to go to an in person OB/GYN in order for her to get these services provided. I also have julia reaching out to see why she was not able to get her hormones prescribed through telehealth since it is not a controlled substance<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 09:32:44', '2026-02-11 09:32:44'),
