  ('zcrm_1579374000180473071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088259002', 'Ian McGiffen', NULL, '2/11/26<br>called to find out why her birth control is not being paid for now in the last two months when it was being covered before. <br>WIll find out what she needs to do to get her meds at no cost as they should be and then let member know what to do. sent email to Lori at ARM for her to help answer my question and assist member in getting her birth control.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 09:24:46', '2026-02-12 09:27:54'),
