  ('zcrm_1579374000180473007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179124001', 'Clay Anselmo', NULL, '2/11/26<br>Sent rx quote and cc''d leo. estradiol was better on Good RX and and the other two medications were cheaper on cost plus. Sent the member instructions and let them know to reach out if they need help getting set up on cost plus or if they need guidance with the good rx coupon. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-11 07:23:40', '2026-02-11 09:23:30'),
