  ('zcrm_1579374000180431048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165360', 'Connie Mansour', NULL, '2-10-26 I uploaded Connie''s proof of Medicare to her account in C4. She should be all set. She knows to set up payment again with Anthem. They kept the same plan. She''s hoping the deductible will be carried over since she met her $2050 ded. I let her know she may have to fight for that with Anthem bc it''s likely not automatic since they had to reapply now that she''s been removed for March 1st from the plan. She understands. Hopefully it won''t matter and Eduardo and Fernanda won''t need anything this year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-10 12:24:08', '2026-02-10 12:24:08'),
