  ('zcrm_1579374000180431033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153586188', '(Boyce) Ben Ford', NULL, '2-10-26 Ben is looking for business liability insurance as follows, "<span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Hi Wendy, thanks so much for all your help finding health insurance for me. i’m wondering if you offer liability insurance for businesses? It’s time for me to renew my general liability policy for my general contracting company. I’m wondering if you have access to those policies as well? I’m looking for about $2 million of coverage. I do residential general contracting service services that does include some structural building."  I sent him to Gail and Steve Longnecker. Steve is the one to connect with on this front. I connected them all via email.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-10 11:57:57', '2026-02-10 11:57:57'),
