  ('zcrm_1579374000180319182', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175874017', 'William Tighe', '2/9/2026', 'William called wondering about how sharing works if he were to ever go to the ER,assured him he would only be responsible for his initial IUA of 2500 and the rest could go to sharing, also explained how to use his card for preventative services<a style="" target="_blank"> only.rc</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-09 11:26:47', '2026-02-09 11:26:51'),
