  ('zcrm_1579374000180319169', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176271025', 'Wendi Hinrichs', '2/9/2026', 'Daughter Gabrielle reached out saying pharmacy needed to contact rx and verify with her prescription, we walked through some details trying to figure out what they needed and who they were contacting becaause we had no record, realized they may have been trying to contact the actual provider, connected her with telehealth and the provider to see if they have gotten anything...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-09 11:16:54', '2026-02-09 11:16:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180319159', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173201002', 'Michael Lammers', '2/9/2026', 'Michael reached out via phone in regards to a left shoulder injury leading to pssible MRI and Surgical, let him know the process of sharing and how to go about it with sedera reimbursing him specifically..rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-09 11:13:22', '2026-02-09 11:13:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180319154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173757002', 'Suzanne Ginter', '2/9/2026', 'called in wondering if I could walk her through rx valet nad finding prescriptions, i walked her through the app where and how to do that. also walked her through where to find sharing...rc', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-09 11:08:28', '2026-02-09 11:14:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180349053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177236017', 'Arthur Legg', '2/9/26', 'Advised patient that the facility they selected is <b>not in the PHCS network</b>.<br>Informed patient that <b>preventative services coverage cannot be guaranteed</b>.<br>Explained that coverage <b>cannot be predetermined</b> and may be <b>fully covered, partially covered, or denied</b>.<br>Offered assistance to <b>find an in-network facility</b> to ensure coverage.<br>Documented for follow-up if patient chooses to proceed with out-of-network facility.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-09 10:48:11', '2026-02-09 10:48:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180318176', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176877001', 'Drew Mersereau', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Drew and Madison. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-09 10:34:53', '2026-02-09 11:03:25'),
