  ('zcrm_1579374000180323013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178034002', 'Kathleen Lopatowski', NULL, '2/9/26<br>Kathleen called to see if an ultrasound would be covered along with her mammogram. Let her know they consider things for dense tissue not covered under preventative such as thermography and ultrasound. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-09 07:38:38', '2026-02-09 07:38:38'),
