  ('zcrm_1579374000180272001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, '2/6/26<br>Nicole called having login issues. getting member not found error message when trying to use telehealth and her son is sick and needs a visit ASAP. Me and Aba reached out to Sarah to see what they can do to get this situation fixed so they can use their telehealth. Will keep member updated. <br>AJ.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-06 11:06:22', '2026-02-06 11:06:22'),
