  ('zcrm_1579374000180209021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174954035', 'Adrian Montemayor', NULL, '2-5-26 Adrian wasn''t sure how to complete the welcome call. He wasn''t sure if they would call him or if he was supposed to login somewhere. They called him and all is well. Although, it looks like he had to reschedule according to the above notes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-05 14:05:53', '2026-02-05 14:05:53'),
