  ('zcrm_1579374000180168107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177883001', 'Hilary Lee', '2/5/2026', 'Also spoke to Hilary to clear up questions from welcome call, she is all good now..RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-05 13:28:41', '2026-02-05 13:28:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180209006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000182477018', 'Gene Greene', NULL, '2-4-26 Looks like we spoke 10 years ago in 2016. She''s interested in re-visiting this as an option. Here was our communication before we talked.<br>Very interesting video!  A few questions I will have during our meeting:<br><br>-My husband is turning 62, when is he eligible for medicare and is that his best option at some point?<br>*** Yes, he will need to move to Medicare at age 65.<br><br>-My son is type 1 diabetic.  I listened to the pre existing clause and this seems reasonable.  We are currently on an HDHP so we basically are paying 100% with a 6K deductible.  I just want to make sure this would cover him.<br>*** Yes, remind me of this when we talk. There''s a good membership for this.<br><br>-employment status: I''m building a business right now and my husband is self-employed.  I may go back to work while I continue building the business but that is a possibility later this fall or next year.  What are the implications of employment status?<br>*** Having proof of self-employment is all we need.<br><br>-We are a family of 2-3 (depending on medicare) with myself and my son (potentially my husband.). We would like the $1000 plan, potentially.  We are not tobacco users.<br>*** Perfect!<br><br>Thanks, Wendy!  Looking forward to connecting!<br>Sara<br><br><span><br></span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-05 13:28:21', '2026-02-05 13:28:21'),
