  ('zcrm_1579374000180183162', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006639', 'Ashley Semidey', NULL, '2/5/26<br>provider called to check if the child Alex had coverage and to check eligibility, I explained that we cover preventative appointment based on the aca guidelines not office or sick vists are included AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-05 13:19:24', '2026-02-05 13:19:34'),
