  ('zcrm_1579374000180183131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177753008', 'Adrianna McDonald', NULL, '2/5/26<br>I went over several details with this member regarding her request. She has multiple chronic conditions and requires frequent, ongoing visits with her physician to manage her health and receive prescribed medications.<br>I explained to her that these services are considered ongoing treatment rather than preventive care. As such, they do not qualify as preventive services and may not be eligible for a sharing request.<br>I also informed the member that due to the severity of her health concerns and the need for constant medical follow-up, these expenses may not be eligible for sharing under the program guidelines. AC<br><span><br></span>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-05 12:48:24', '2026-02-05 12:48:24'),
