  ('zcrm_1579374000180165017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129405219', 'Patrick Dew', NULL, '2/5- Member called in to review a payment update form that he submitted after hours on 2/4. He was not sure that his 02/26 payment went through, so he submitted this update in hopes that his membership was not cancelled.  I told him that he had updated his payment on 1/22, so his account is current.  I did not process the payment update request on 2/4, because it is the same as active card on file.  Member stated that he may submit a Bank ACH to avoid the processing fee.', 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-05 07:01:50', '2026-02-05 07:01:50'),
