  ('zcrm_1579374000180104046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117101001', 'Nicole Murad', NULL, '2-4-26 Nicole submitted to get reimbursed for her preventive from HAB and it got rejected since it was in 2026. She is now double paying for their Co-op and MPB. She requested it to be cancelled and backdated if possible. She didn''t understand and our emails aren''t getting to her since her email address is showing as blocked.  I sent an immediate note to HAB as follows to hopefully get her membership cancelled.<br><span><br></span>Hi Member Services,<br><br>Nicole Murad joined Health Access Preventive Jan. 1st, 2025. As you can see below, she submitted for reimbursement for her wellness screening which ended Dec. 31st. She joined for the wellness benefits only and has no need for the Health Access Co-op. She joined a health sharing membership June 1st, 2023 and remains active.  She does not want to be double paying for duplicate benefits. I just spoke with her and she''s requesting immediate cancellation and backdating to the original Dec. 31st end date for her preventive benefits. <br><br>Please assist. Thank you so much!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-04 15:09:48', '2026-02-04 15:09:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180093122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000180130001', 'Tracy Stahl', NULL, '2/4/26<br>Tracy called back after getting a voicemail telling her to make a payment form update. She said she chose list bill due to being under the impression she is in a group plan under Courtney Cowan gray agency/farm bureau. Will f/u with admin tomorrow to look into this and reach back out to Tracy to let her know if she needs to update anything. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-04 14:43:40', '2026-02-04 14:43:40'),
