  ('zcrm_1579374000180106016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161590011', 'Laura Garran', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation eff 3/26 due to getting Employer Benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-04 08:50:09', '2026-02-04 08:50:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180106011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122226002', 'Karin Nance', NULL, 'I spoke to member who wanted information on how much it would be to add spouse &amp; dependent.  Member had originally contacted Zion and she told me that she it took her about 20 mins on the phone with them before they sent her to us. Member told me that she had been given a lower price by Zion and I advised her that that would be the Zion only price and that she received more services with us.  She then wanted an itemized list of all of our services.  I then recommended she be in contact with Wendy.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-04 08:45:10', '2026-02-04 08:45:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180091007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462222', 'Ann Apfelbeck', NULL, 'Spoke to ANn regarding her pending bills. Zion had let us know they had emailed her a request for further information.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2026-02-04 08:39:10', '2026-02-04 08:39:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180100033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176703036', 'Jason Rhodes', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent an email to reschedule the welcome call. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-04 08:35:11', '2026-02-04 08:35:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180109001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173025002', 'Trina Oyloe', NULL, '2/4/26<br>Trina requires a colonoscopy. She had already selected a provider and was reportedly told the provider was in network. The provider later contacted us for eligibility verification, and during that call Susan mistakenly informed them that we are a health share. As a result, the provider declined to render services, stating they do not accept health share plans.<br>I explained to Trina that the portion of her plan she is using is not a health share, but a TPA that functions similarly to private insurance. This situation caused significant frustration for her. I asked her to bear with us while I attempted to assist and explore available options; however, she became impatient and later called in again. At that point, Adam took over the call and assisted her, making several attempts to locate an in-network provider. He was able to find one, but Trina later called back stating she was unhappy because she could not travel that far for the colonoscopy.<br>I then resumed assisting her and referred her to UC Health. I also sent her an email confirming that UC Health is in network. She expressed frustration with the length of time the process was taking. I explained that we contact each provider directly to verify eligibility, as provider directories can be outdated, and that this verification process can be time-consuming.<br>An email was sent with the UC Health information, and she has not yet responded. I will follow up on 2/4/26 to determine if she needs further assistance.<br>AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-04 08:33:17', '2026-02-04 08:33:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180108001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178967007', 'Richard Huey', NULL, '02/04/2026 - Member did not respond to phone call for scheduled WC.        SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-04 08:26:46', '2026-02-04 08:26:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180107001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178804001', 'James Burns', '02/04/2026', 'Welcome Call Complete.', 'Tupac Manzanarez', 'Tupac Manzanarez', '2026-02-04 08:23:48', '2026-02-04 08:23:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180106001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122273001', 'Jill Gregory', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 3/26 due to finding other coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-04 08:18:06', '2026-02-04 08:18:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180093009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176459038', 'Donna Nelson', NULL, '2/4/26<br>Donna called to double check the price for a prescription quote she receive from us. I looked into it and was able to find her cheaper prices through cost plus. Gave her the info and explained how to use them. I believe the quote given was for the requested pharmacy she put in the quote request and there was better prices at other pharmacies and she was not opposed to going to a different pharmacy. I think whoever ran the quote thought she wanted to go to that pharmacy.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-04 08:14:15', '2026-02-04 08:14:15'),
