  ('zcrm_1579374000180093001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175210002', 'Steven Ezell', NULL, '2/4/26<br>Michelle called to make sure she would be able to get her medications even though Stevens name comes up when she enters the RX valet section of the app. let her know to just order her meds because her name shows everywhere else in the health wallet. If there are any issues, the provider can speak with us or RX valet to make sure they know the prescription is for her and not Steven.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-04 07:51:10', '2026-02-04 07:51:25'),
