  ('zcrm_1579374000180001194', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171833002', 'Michelin Smith', NULL, 'After speaking with member we determined that the advisor submitted a change form due to the fact that she did not send it to member when she should have.  Member wanted to add spouse eff 2/26, now I won''t be able to add him until 3/26.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-02-03 11:54:46', '2026-02-03 11:54:46'),
