  ('zcrm_1579374000179999041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142457002', 'John Sapio', NULL, '2/3/26<br>made f/u call after welcome call to clear up a couple things for john that he was a little confused about. explained where ID cards are and the difference between the two(RX Valet and ARM). also explained preventative and that dermatology and urology would not be covered under those benefits. They would be out of pocket until the IUA then he could make a share request<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-03 11:43:47', '2026-02-03 11:43:47'),
