  ('zcrm_1579374000180069004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179984002', 'Dolores Nogaro', NULL, '2-2-26 Dolores 41 and her husband Enrico 45 live in Aspen, CO. She works for Aspen Skiing Company and their ins is $1200 a month. They never use it. They are from Argentina and do all of their wellness screenings back in Argentina. They are citizens. They also do their dental cleanings and she sees an endocrinologist in Argentina for screening. They don''t have any pre-x, no tobacco, no meds. They are healthy. Their plan through ASC is with Cinga/Allegiance with a $2500 ded per indiv and $3750 per family with a $7K mop indiv and $12,750 mop family. They want the basic membership for medical. They also have an accident plan with Aspen Skiing Company too, I think. They chose Care+ ES $1250/$494 and $125/$25. Their friend Silvina Rodriquez referred them to me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-03 11:37:42', '2026-02-03 11:37:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180052044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175041007', 'Mark Taylor', '2/3/2026', 'Called in wondering about reimbursement for annual visit with zion, they denied his request because it wasnt a 6 month waiting period with the DIrect membership...RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-03 11:29:23', '2026-02-03 11:29:23'),
