  ('zcrm_1579374000179999030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000166459011', 'Cindy Lee', NULL, '2/3/26<br>member called and asked me to talk to husband after giving me permission to speak with him. They wanted to clarify how the IUA process works and what to do with bills and things like that. Explained to submit the bills after letting provider know you are a cash pay patient. then pay the IUA and any other related expenses will be taken care of by Zion. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-03 09:41:45', '2026-02-03 09:41:45'),
