  ('zcrm_1579374000180007035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117877002', 'Angela M Gutierrez', NULL, '02.03.26:  The phone numbers Bern provided were no longer in service and I looked up Angela and Alfredo''s company website which had a different phone number but it did not work either. <br><br>I emailed Sergio to introduce myself and ask what the status of a healthcare plan for Angela and her hustand, Alfredo is currently. I told him if he wants to re-enroll Angela in an MPB plan (she was in the  CARE PLUS plan) I would be happy to help her enroll and service her account and to let me know either way.   Bern texted me to ask if I got in touch w/Sergio. I responded that I emailed Sergio and copied Bern on it.  JSP<br><br>Sergio emailed me. Said Angela and Alfredo want to re-enroll in the same health plan: CARE PLUS. I responded I would assist them. Asked if they want to continue using a credit card or debit a bank account. I also explained they would have to re-enroll themselves. I cannot enroll for them. I told Sergio their start date would be March 1, 2026. I told him if he helps them enroll, I can assist and guide him if he has questions. I asked him to let me know how he wants to move forward. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2026-02-03 09:18:35', '2026-02-03 14:38:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180003110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179090002', 'Tanya Barnicoat', NULL, '02/0-3/2026 - Completed WC.   SW', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-03 09:16:10', '2026-02-03 09:16:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000180007030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117877002', 'Angela M Gutierrez', NULL, '01.29.26:  I responded to Bern, apologized for the delay as I was away and didn''t see his email until now. When I didn''t hear from him (call or text) I assumed he got this resolved with Sergio. I asked him the status of this matter and told him I can do the enrollment and service the account if he would like and to let me know. He responded he would appreciate that and I could take it over.  I responded I would do so and asked if he would send me Sergio''s contact information so I could get hold of him.  This is the information he sent me:  <br><br>Sergio Piedrahita<br>Operations Officer<br>305-471-0428 - ext. 112 (no longer in service)<br>305-900-4809  (cannot be completed as dialed - error message)<br><br>323-554-1116 (this one is on his email of 2.3.26)<br><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://operations2@anicamenterprises.com/"><u>operations2@anicamenterprises.com</u></a><br><br>Anicam Enterprises Inc.<br>1770 N.W. 96th Ave., Doral, FL  33172 USA<br>Tif:  305-471-0428     Fax:  305-735-5930<br><br>Bogota: 6760923  ext 112<br><a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://www.anicamenterprises.com/"><u>www.anicamenterprises.com</u></a><br><br>JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2026-02-03 09:12:46', '2026-02-03 13:57:50'),
