  ('zcrm_1579374000180007016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117877002', 'Angela M Gutierrez', NULL, '01.09.26:  Recvd. an email from Bern. Patti Baron told him he needs to re-enroll Angela to continue her membership. She also suggested having Angela designate <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="http://billing@mympb.com/"><u>billing@mympb.com</u></a> as a safe sender so she will be sure to get any future notifications. Bern emailed me he has no idea how we are doing enrollments anymore and he is okay with giving this to someone who can service it. Asked if I had any thoughts on the matter.  JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2026-02-03 08:48:28', '2026-02-03 08:48:28'),
