  ('zcrm_1579374000179994010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171438009', 'Daniel McCarthy', NULL, '2-2-26 This IS Andrea''s client for sure. The one with Kristy McCarthy is Andrea''s. That will help keep is straight.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-02 23:21:00', '2026-02-02 23:21:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179979032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, '2-2-26 Patty is double paying for MPB and Health Access Co-Op by accident! I submitted for cancellation and refund for HAB since their communications indicated no further billing into 2026 for the preventive membership. She has an obgyn screening tomorrow and wanted to know how to handle it. However she never upgraded to Premium HSA like she thought she did and is paying $299 not $363. She will cancel her appt and schedule it for a later date. She''s self-employed so she can add the MEC when she''s ready.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-02 16:48:16', '2026-02-02 16:48:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179979025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125045', 'Jonathan Glendinning', NULL, '2-2-26 I left a vm for Jon bc he''s wanting to cancel.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-02 15:57:47', '2026-02-02 15:57:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179979020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, '2-2-26 Sandy is all set for now. Some family member might need surgery. So, she wanted to understand how to go about submitting  a new Need if they get to that point.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-02 15:25:46', '2026-02-02 15:25:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179979015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, '2-2-26 Left vm for Patty Nilsen.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-02 15:23:05', '2026-02-02 15:23:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179979010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '2-2-26 Suzy is re-enrolling since she couldn''t get her membership to continue into Feb. She re-enrolled into Premium Care for March 1st, $1500/$267. She prefers thermograms but will do that on her own and rest of preventive. I waived the $100 since she was already a member. She''s good to go!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-02 15:20:04', '2026-02-02 15:20:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179979005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167357006', 'Deborah Pope', NULL, '2-2-26 Deb Pope is inquiring about her above ticket. Sarah said they are waiting for the carrier to respond. C4 re-sent the enrollment file via email to the carrier on Friday. They are now requesting the RMHP to confirm coverage which will include Josh. Then they will send an email to Deb showing that it''s complete and the ticket is closed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-02-02 15:05:26', '2026-02-02 15:05:26'),
