  ('zcrm_1579374000179933101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, '2/2/26<br>Allison reached out to ask about hormone replacement therapy. I let her know she would need to get a share request for a determination on what they would share towards that. let her know to get a treatment plan and good faith estimate along with any related itemized bills and submit those for a share request<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 14:03:01', '2026-02-02 14:03:01'),
