  ('zcrm_1579374000179933069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, '2/2/26<br>Kirsten called to see what to do about a bill she got for some bloodwork related to an infection. Let her know that would not be preventative so get that bill and any other related bill for this medical incident and put those together for a share request. Let her know also to reach out if they need help through that process<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 12:56:46', '2026-02-02 12:56:58'),
