  ('zcrm_1579374000179933061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176459038', 'Donna Nelson', NULL, '2/2/26<br>Donna called after not answering the phone for her welcome call. I checked with Susan who was still available so i transferred her over to get her welcome call completed<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 12:44:05', '2026-02-02 12:44:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179933052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000170142007', 'Patrick Dittoe', NULL, '2/2/26<br>member reached out to cancel so i sent the form with instructctions. He said he attempted twice but we do not see a form submitted already so we think he just emailed in and requested to cancel but did not get the form. Now he has it so he should be able to get it done this time around<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 12:42:33', '2026-02-02 12:42:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179933047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178239002', 'Harold Thompson', NULL, '2/2/26<br>member called to find out when the next webinar is so i let him know that is is going for the same day and time every week at the moment. He said thank you and that is all he needed<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 12:41:18', '2026-02-02 12:41:18'),
