  ('zcrm_1579374000179946076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174010021', 'Alan Pomeranz', NULL, '2/2/26<br>Miriam called to see if a DEXA scan was covered I informed her that is would be as long as she hit all the requirements such as going through menopause and being younger then 64 and if the provider codes it as preventative AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 12:34:25', '2026-02-02 12:34:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179933033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137015002', 'Alexander Galaska', NULL, '2/2/26<br>Responded to email asking about rehab options. Looked it up in the guidelines and quoted him the information<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 12:34:24', '2026-02-02 12:34:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179933028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175926023', 'Simon Smeddle', NULL, '2/2/26<br>Simon called to make sure he was still active. After checking E123 i let him know his status is still listed as active so he should be good to go<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 12:32:45', '2026-02-02 12:32:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179933023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, '2/2/26<br>Coltan called to see how to start a share request. Guided him to his Zion portal which we had to call Zion to get the portal activated. Then explained to initiate a share request and upload the documentation from there like his bills and such then a needs coordinator would reach out after he gets the share request started to help him with his share request. Said that was all he needed and was happy i made it easy for him<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 12:31:38', '2026-02-02 12:31:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179933018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178391006', 'Rebekah Terrey', NULL, '2/2/26<br>Member called in with login issues. After talking to IT we realized the member info was not sent in the backend like it should have been. Informed member to give us at least 24-48 hours to get the problem fixed and if after that time she still had issues to call back so we can find out what is wrong.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 12:29:59', '2026-02-02 12:29:59'),
