  ('zcrm_1579374000179940079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178062002', 'Alejandra Arevalo Acosta', '2/2/2026', 'member having an issue with telehealth and logging into it and seeing member not found, went to IT about it looked like the information needed to be sent over should be fixed in 24 hours..&gt;RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 11:02:20', '2026-02-02 11:02:20'),
