  ('zcrm_1579374000179940069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176271003', 'Steve Dayton', '2/2/2026', 'spoke with steve in regard to documetation from telehealth that he had spoke to them about an hour prior and they said it would get uploaded. I advised steve sometimes it just takes a little while for them to input it..Check back in a few houra and if it is still not uploaded we can further assist...RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 10:58:42', '2026-02-02 10:58:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179940064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000178266002', 'Brian O''Neill', '2/2/2026', 'i sent brian the welcome call schedule form so he could fill it out..RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 10:57:27', '2026-02-02 10:57:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179940059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209114', 'Kelly Shafer', '2/2/2026', 'Kelly called in regarding a ear nose throat doctor in network, I advised her that when talking about diagnostic ventures the provider does not need to be in network she can choose. I also then walked her through the PHCS Network list when using it for preventative services..RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 10:56:50', '2026-02-02 10:56:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179940054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179020001', 'Daniel Peterson', '2/2/2026', 'Both Daniel and Leslie where getting a member not found error when opening up telehealth, went to IT about the issue and they confirmed the information needed to get sent over to lyric so they could access it. Was told it would take 24 hours at the most to do so, I went ahead and let them know..RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 10:54:50', '2026-02-02 10:54:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179940049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176734001', 'Gregory Birchler', '2/2/2026', 'Sent greg the change form..RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 10:53:03', '2026-02-02 10:53:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179940044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152321002', 'Zachary Lamkin', '2/2/2026', 'I emailed mallory in regard to her wondering how to find a pediatrician i the network, sent her the link and instructions on how to go about it..RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 10:52:34', '2026-02-02 10:52:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179940039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173870026', 'stephen Costello', '2/2/2026', 'Stephen called in asking about labs that should have been submitted to ARM from the provider, instead they sent to labcorp and labcorp tried billing him for full amount for preventative labs.. instructed him to either call provider or labcorp and have them sent the invoice to arm the address on the back of his card..RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 10:51:34', '2026-02-02 10:51:34'),
