  ('zcrm_1579374000179933013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109086001', 'David Wayne', NULL, '2/2/26<br>responded to email to update member info. Sent the link and explained what to do to change info. Also explained to her what would happen if she changed the primary email to hers. let her know everyone over 18 needs their own email for login purposes.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 09:41:32', '2026-02-02 09:41:32'),
