  ('zcrm_1579374000179933008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176724044', 'Brian Cox', NULL, '2/2/26<br>Nicolette called to get help with some guidance on starting a share request. Walked her through where to go to do so and what she needs to do to start it. Showed her where to go in the app/portal then explained to her some of the new benefits that are available such as tier 1 and 2 med discounts. She also requested i email her some more info on her membership which i did<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 09:38:44', '2026-02-02 09:38:44'),
