  ('zcrm_1579374000179933001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176455020', 'Matthew Hoit', NULL, '2/2/26<br>Member reached out to ask about preventative benefits and the card they would have for that. Explained a physical one will be mailed out to them but they can get a digital one in the app. Also, explained how things have changed with preventative since she was last a member. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-02-02 07:58:05', '2026-02-02 07:58:05'),
