  ('zcrm_1579374000179916009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179893004', 'George Alvarez', 'Member & Fam $1250 IUA Secure HSA + Tobacco', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-02 06:21:21', '2026-02-02 06:24:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179916001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179894001', 'Jaren Thueson', 'Member & Sp MEC+ Essentials', NULL, 'Michele R', 'Michele R', '2026-02-02 06:17:40', '2026-02-02 06:17:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179868099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '1-30-26 Suzy''s current new job isn''t working out, so she wants to stay with MPB. We will re-enroll her on Monday for March 1st onward. She''ll go back onto Premium Care and probably choose $1500 IUA again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-30 16:36:07', '2026-01-30 16:36:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179868094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112994002', 'Carol VerMeer', NULL, '1-30-26 Carol called bc she''s considering helping to pay for her employees health benefits. She has about 9 employees and most work only part-time. If at full time it would be around $60K or so. But, some are making only $30K. So, C4 would be great for some folks with only one tax payer in the household. She thinks only 3-4 would probably choose to join. I called her back and let her know if he company is paying for health benefits then the employee doesn''t qualify for the tax credits. That might impede what she''s thinking of doing. She''s also open to offering MCS to those interested. Since we are past open enrollment now, she will likely revisit this later this year for open enrollment next year. She has a lot to think about now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-30 15:52:11', '2026-01-30 15:52:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179857074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118299002', 'Alex Platz', '1/30/2026', 'Alex called in regarding canceling his membership, sent him the cancelation form..RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-30 14:57:38', '2026-01-30 14:57:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179854136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108211002', 'Karen Sachs', '1/30 Reached out to Karen via text', 'Sent her  a text to check in and welcomed her back. (Hopefully it''s more than a month.) She answered back and admits she did not call the concierge due to a lack of energy. I encouraged her to contact the concierge when she can for a refresher.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2026-01-30 14:52:27', '2026-01-30 15:01:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179857069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176472047', 'Gopal Krishnan', '1/30/2026', 'Priya''s provider for the OBGYN called concierge and cancelled her appointment for no longer accepting the network, spent the last few days calling around to find a new provider none of them will elt me speak for her. I provided her with that information via email and let her know because of HIPPA reasons. Also sent her one provider specifcally with name and addres that is accepting new patients under the netowkr...RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-30 14:44:58', '2026-01-30 14:44:58'),
