  ('zcrm_1579374000179865045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175165085', 'David Hammond', NULL, '1/30/26<br>Response to webinar questions cognito form:<br><span><br></span><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Question:</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Is Kimberly Bankston NP 61704 a provider in network?</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Answer: </span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Hello, this is Adam with the MPB health concierge team. Unfortunately, Kimberly Bankston does not appear on the PHCS specific services network check. We still recommend reaching out to the provider and asking if they utilize the </span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><u>PHCS </u></b></span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><u>Multiplan network</u></span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> due to the providers being responsible for updating the website to reflect if they are still in network or not. Alot of the providers do not do that like they should, so your provider might be using the network even though they do not pop up in the search. </span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Let us know if you need help searching for alternative providers or anything else. Have a good day!</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Best regards,</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Adam</span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-30 14:22:22', '2026-01-30 14:22:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179857041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105145010', 'Gelene Santa Maria', '1/30/2026', 'Gelene called in, she was wondering about a cyst shes having removed surgically and how the IUA an sharing works, informed her on all the information, responsible for the<a style="" target="_blank"> first.RC</a>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-30 14:20:29', '2026-01-30 14:22:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179857036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141070002', 'Jerry Barnwell', '1/30/2026', 'Tina called in wondering about if a nutritionist would be covered, I gave her the details upon that...RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-30 14:17:37', '2026-02-06 13:08:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179857031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132697002', 'Timothy Mills', '1/30/2026', 'Had member submit change form, also let him know they could not do refunds as it was a deadline fo the 20th...RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-30 14:15:44', '2026-01-30 14:15:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179865037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149300002', 'Angela Rank', NULL, '1/30/26<br><span><br></span>Response to webinar cognito form:<br><span><br></span><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Your Question:</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">I have a preventative wellness exam this Friday and I’m wondering if my provider is in network</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Answer:</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Hello, This is Adam with the MPB health concierge team. Can you please let me know the name of your provider and the practice/hospital they are working in, and I can assist you with searching the network?</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Best regards,</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Adam</span></p><p style=""><span style="color:rgb(24, 90, 189);"><br></span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-30 14:13:01', '2026-01-30 14:13:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179865032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174154004', 'Jana Bravo', NULL, '1/30/26<br>Response to cognito form for webinar questions:<br><span><br></span><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Question:</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Where can I get a physical card? I did not receive on in the mail. I can''t find a place to print one from. Which PCHS plan should I be searching when looking for a preventive provider?</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Answer:</span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);">Hello, this is Adam with the MPB health concierge team. I will double check and make sure a physical card has been requested and shipped out to you. I will also attach a digital one to this email. The digital version you have is in your app/portal and you should be able to print that one. When searching the PHCS network make sure you select the "</span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b><u>PHCS Specific Services"</u></b></span><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b> </b></span></p>', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-30 14:11:14', '2026-01-30 14:11:14'),
