  ('zcrm_1579374000179865019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130212001', 'Ryan Olson', NULL, '1/30/26<br>Ryan called in to see what to do about a situation with his daughter and a possible share request. Walked him through opening request and let him know to get any itemized bills for expenses already incurred and a treatment plan and good faith estimate for any possible upcoming procedures or courses of treatment. I checked the guidelines and it does not look like her hearing problem is something they will deny so i advised to start a share and see what the determination is<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-30 13:01:26', '2026-01-30 13:01:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179865014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176241042', 'April Bennett', NULL, '1/30/26<br>April called in to see what to do for upcoming preventative visit. I checked her provider and the dr did not show up but the medical group Carle health listed PHCS as an accepted network. Let April know to call providers office and verify that information but if they do then she can go there for her preventative care and keep her appointment and her dr<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-30 12:53:51', '2026-01-30 12:53:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179868074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000171948133', 'Sarah Whelden', NULL, '1-30-26 Sarah called to make sure I received the tax docs. I just reviewed the file and it''s only the back of the document. She has to wait to get upstairs to see what she did wrong. She''ll resend the correct front of the document as soon as she can today.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-30 12:53:15', '2026-01-30 12:53:15'),
