  ('zcrm_1579374000179857026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175654001', 'John Krzykowski', '1/30/2026', 'Sent spouce carol link to multi plan network and how to search a provider for her mammogram...RC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-30 11:51:54', '2026-01-30 11:51:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179865001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173735024', 'Jeremy Sayre', NULL, '1/30/26<br>Katie called in to get her and the family set up on the app/portal and make a few changes to some member info. I explained the update form and she had the link for that. she is going to change katie to katherine since that is her legal name. she is also going to send change forms to update her email address as well as her two over 18 kids, jackson and hayley. helped her login and activate all of those accounts as well.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-30 11:49:05', '2026-01-30 11:49:05'),
