  ('zcrm_1579374000179773122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118133001', 'Stephen Hultquist', NULL, '1-29-25 <span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34);">Thanks, Wendy. We’re set around Medicare.</span>', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-29 20:59:31', '2026-01-29 20:59:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179773117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168301001', 'Gretchen Clark', NULL, '1-29-26 I left a vm at 4:50 pm and told her to get it sorted out by 3:00 EST tomorrow if possible. I gave her many numbers to call, incl Billing, Concierge and my #. Hopefully she''ll find her email as well to proceed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-29 16:51:50', '2026-01-29 16:51:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179773112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000168301001', 'Gretchen Clark', NULL, '1-29-26 I never received the first notice. I only received the one today. I''m calling Gretchen now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-29 16:48:36', '2026-01-29 16:48:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179773107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086950002', 'Summer Deaton', NULL, '1-29-26 Summer and I talked bc she was asking about international sharing. I sent her the verbiage from the Sharing Guidelines and she was shocked to see it''s only now for urgent and ER. She''s international at the moment. She will look over her records to see if she has anything within the last 36 months. If her record is clear then she may switch to Premium Care for the better international sharing. But, she also prefers alternative care which is no longer good with Premium Care. So, she will ponder and see if she will remain on Care+ or move to Premium Care.  She definitely wants alternative care and international care benefits if I find something that good on that front in the future.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-29 16:23:42', '2026-01-29 16:23:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179773102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136256011', 'Brian Coffey', NULL, '1-29-26 Brian was able to login to his Anthem account and access his new cards since he needs a medication Feb. 1st or so. He will also call C4 to update his address. He should be all set. He''s still figuring out what he wants to do for dental and will keep me posted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-29 16:02:51', '2026-01-29 16:02:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179773097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179773046', 'Teresa Moebius', NULL, '1-29-26 I''m not sure who this is or where she came from. She might be a spouse of a current member or a friend.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-29 15:21:28', '2026-01-29 15:21:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179773092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179773046', 'Teresa Moebius', NULL, '1-29-25 Call 844-833-8440 or go to <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://directvisioninsurance.com/"><u>https://directvisioninsurance.com</u></a><br>Dear teresa moebius,<br>Congratulations on purchasing a Direct Vision plan! You have just made a great investment in protecting your vision health. Please SAVE this important membership information. If you have any questions, call us at <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="tel:800-620-5010"><u>844-833-8440</u></a> or e-mail us at <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:directbenefits@directbenefits.com"><u>directbenefits@directbenefits.com</u></a>. Please do not respond to this confirmation email.<br>Here is what you need to know.<br><b>If you chose electronic delivery of your plan documents, you will not receive paper copies.</b> Instead, you will be able to access your information through your member portal. If you chose to have your plan documents delivered via direct mail, please allow up to 10 days for delivery to the address you provided in the Primary Applicant section. Your provider will verify benefits using your 9 digit policy # below. Do not use your SSN. Please note: While your vision insurance is effective on the date noted below, your application may take up to five business days to be processed and be accessible in the system through the network providers. Please make sure your provider is able to verify benefits before you schedule an appointment.  <br><b>Access your ID cards, benefits, claims, and more electronically via your member portal account (s).   </b><br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">For billing information and ID cards, please register for your Ameritas Member Portal Account here: </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="http://track.smtpsendmail.com/6009018/c?p=lOsVvE3-mtewp-k8krzDNvaeW5-rlbQAdI0yIZ0c6VW23MrK3fj71w59DjsGJFySWemzbNbq05_3HQxQkXqZaYqi7XEoQ8d_43zd1x1unkheZU5d1sJFdOSRQ1yvTR5S2g8jAdGTvBplEktjYaMg68q3OoB7ZJ_q2TOoaaHB_wQ1vw4cFAjcy24a2pQm_6Bi"><u>https://www.ameritas.com/sign-in/</u></a></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">If you have an EyeMed policy, you can access your benefits and claims through your EyeMed Member Portal Account. When registering, please use your 9 digit policy number from your confirmation email below. Do not use your SSN: Register here: </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="http://track.smtpsendmail.com/6009018/c?p=Y0cQGqOz2AB8N5L6KPERqhD9Yddmkgj9qHliVlW7YWxTvd7Da1i6m-WcRROzTK5wVlI6__PHqEqGadrbAsOC9jaewv17qqqdI3vVHkJIrHrXbZQ0HWFkQ1fgyxqoVVOpC3aIJRTh239Db7B60S63RFQO88K0k-Ozp2RNVvB5UKNSbVXBH_7L1Et3PTaZqYRD"><u>www.eyemedvisioncare.com/member/</u></a><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">If you have a VSP policy, you can access your benefits and claims through your VSP Member Portal Account. When registering, please use your 9 digit policy number from your confirmation email below. Do not use your SSN. Create an account here: </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="http://track.smtpsendmail.com/6009018/c?p=i-%2069TYz3RN7Ku80j0yCcyvHOmWvWz9V5BK5nymvkuLdoXV6FMdbo6ERf0LowsAYVN-gC3T3HSV4BzhiDwb7s2uIm9cPXYrSqo9BIyUoZYcoLo3XkWpaolPGiw1vDYBUwD---tNKiu4SAikPdWbA1XMasJDbFiInoPktPRiLqr5U="><u>www.vsp.com</u></a></p></li></ul><b>Ameritas </b>(ID cards and billing):<br>5900 O Street Lincoln, NE 68510<br>Customer Service 866-619-6095<br>Fax: 402-309-2598<br>Email: <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:SpiritIndservice@Ameritas.com"><u>SpiritIndservice@Ameritas.com</u></a><br><b>EyeMed</b> (verification of benefits and claims):<br>800-521-3605<br><b>VSP </b>(verification of benefits and claims):<br>800-877-7195<br>Initial premium will be withdrawn within 3 days of your policies effective date, subsequent premiums are due on the day of the month in which the policy was effective. Plan includes a one-time non-refundable enrollment fee of $25. This charge will be made at the time of purchase and may appear as a se parate transaction from your insurance as Direct Vision or Direct Benefits, Inc. <br>Your specific coverage information is as follows:<br><br>Plan Selected: VSP Choice Plan B<br>Who’s covered: Applicant<br>Effective Date: 01/30/2026<br>Carrier: Ameritas<br>Monthly Charge: <b>$12.22</b><br><br>Policy Number: <b>300178881</b><br>Agent Info: <b>Wendy Scipione (Phone : (720) 259-1555)</b> <br>Questions? Call (844)833-8440', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-29 15:20:53', '2026-01-29 15:20:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179773036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161588012', 'Stephanie PageWise', NULL, '1-29-26 Stephanie is being billed by Health Access for $375! She''s about to be billed again for Feb. I left her a vm. I''m guessing she completed their upgrade process by accident instead of letting the billing end on Dec. 31st. Sounds like she''s unavailable today but hopefully we can talk tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-29 15:08:02', '2026-01-29 15:08:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179773031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177351427', 'Abigail Hernandez', NULL, '1-29-26 Abigail is the spouse of Kayden Wilson. Kayden is the primary on their Care+ membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-29 15:00:14', '2026-01-29 15:00:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179773019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000177351427', 'Abigail Hernandez', NULL, '1-2926 <b>Subject:</b> Confirmation of Your Health Plan Cancellation<br><b>Dear Abigail,</b><br>This is to confirm that your health plan with us has been successfully canceled, effective <b>January 31, 2026</b>.<br><b>Policy Details:</b><br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-style:normal;"><b>Policyholder Name:</b></span><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> Abigail Hernandez</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-style:normal;"><b>Policy Number:</b></span><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> 21202543814</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-style:normal;"><b>Cancellation Effective Date:</b></span><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"> January 31, 2026</span></p></li></ul>If you have any remaining premium charges or refund due, our team will process it within <b>10 business days </b>and notify you accordingly.<br>We’re sorry to see you go and hope we had the opportunity to support your health needs during your time with us. If you have any questions, or if you decide to return in the future, we’ll be here to help.<br>If you did not request this cancellation or believe this was done in error, please contact our billing consultants at <b>support@kmg-services.com</b>.<br>Thank you for being a valued customer.<br>Warm regards,<br>Your LifeX Research Billing Team<br>support@kmg-services.com', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-29 14:58:01', '2026-01-29 14:58:01'),
