  ('zcrm_1579374000179616384', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109967002', 'Ronald Johnson', NULL, '1/28/26<br>Provider called to verify claim status so i explained how the bill was processed, only discount applied and was not preventative so nothing was paid on the bill by ARM. It is patient responsiblity<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-28 15:01:46', '2026-01-28 15:01:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179616379', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157410002', 'Alison Krupnik', NULL, '1/28/26<br>Ali reached out requesting 1095C again saying it is urgent. I relayed the message to accounting and let them know the member is getting upset and would like it as soon as possible. i let the member knwo she will get it ASAP<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-28 15:00:33', '2026-01-28 15:00:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179616374', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097817002', 'Jennifer Hooker', NULL, '1/28/26<br>member called in for login assistance. walked him through geting accounts activated so they could use the telehealth since their son is feeling ill. Walked them through how telehealth works and how to access it. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-28 14:59:34', '2026-01-28 14:59:34'),
