  ('zcrm_1579374000179616354', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000167313007', 'Paul Rettmann', NULL, '1/28/26<br>Paul called to see what to do to set up an HSA account. Let him know we just give him the product to make him compliant and let him know about HSA bank since that is our only somewhat affiliate.<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-28 14:54:39', '2026-01-28 14:54:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179616349', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000173025002', 'Trina Oyloe', NULL, '1/28/26<br>Sent trina f/u to let her know we are still finding her a dr and facility in her area. sending her a couple of options of providers so she can then pick one and make an appointment. She has a tight schedule so i will be letting her know what places she can go to that will be 100% in network so she can work with them to make an appointment that will work with her schedule<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-28 14:52:57', '2026-01-28 14:52:57'),
