  ('zcrm_1579374000179616329', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174059007', 'Jesse Lownsbury', NULL, '1/28/26<br>Jesse called in to see if we could help merge his zion accounts together since he was a member with them before joining us. Let him know he needs to reach out to Zion to get them to merge the accounts to make sure any new share requests do not have to be subject to his new start date since he has been a member longer than that<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-28 13:29:16', '2026-01-28 13:29:28'),
