  ('zcrm_1579374000179616324', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151170108', 'Lynn Thomas', NULL, '1/28/26<br>Member called and asked about 1095C, if she had dental coverage and if a colonoscopy is covered. Let her know the colo is covered and i will request the 1095 C for her. Let her know it will take 24-48 hours for 1095. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-28 13:05:00', '2026-01-28 13:05:00'),
