  ('zcrm_1579374000179616309', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176115001', 'Ligia Miles', NULL, '1/28/26<br>Looking into getting a coupon for amox in husbands name since pharmacy is giving issues giving her the medication at the RX valet price. After speaking was able to help her find the card with husbands name on it. She is going to wait till the RX quote is complete and attempt to go again. Pharmacy should accept card now and if not she is advised to call 855 line to try and clear up issue. If not resolved then she will call us back to see what we can do to make sure she gets her RX valet discount on her meds<br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-28 12:09:09', '2026-01-28 12:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179649083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114144002', 'Jan Carteaux', NULL, 'Member initially submitted cancellation request to be effective 3/26.  Then 3 days later I received submission for 2/26 citing going on employer benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2026-01-28 12:08:13', '2026-01-28 12:08:13'),
