  ('zcrm_1579374000179616304', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176146001', 'Sarah Starr', NULL, '1/28/26<br>Sarah called to request she get her Physical ID cards and her welcome packet since she haas still not gotten them. Let her know i will re request those be sent out to her along with send her digital versions. She is aware of the digital copies that are in her app but woudl prefer a physical version of verything. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-28 09:46:27', '2026-01-28 09:46:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179616299', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174010021', 'Alan Pomeranz', NULL, '1/28/26<br>Member called to see what to do for a tetanus shot since it has been 10 years in March but her annual visit is in August. Let her know shot would be covered but depending on how the dr codes the visit is if she will have any out of pocket charges for the office visit itself. <br>AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-28 09:36:51', '2026-01-28 09:36:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000179635347', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000176438018', 'Jennifer Pollock', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sent over message to Reba to reach out to members /advisor with info about dental and vision. Member stated she was not informed of that information. Seem very overwhelmed. V.O.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2026-01-28 09:35:28', '2026-01-28 10:27:27'),
