  ('zcrm_1579374000179654044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000179654011', 'Geetah Ardessai', NULL, '1-26-26 Call 844-833-8440 or go to <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="https://directvisioninsurance.com/"><u>https://directvisioninsurance.com</u></a><br>Dear geetah Ardessai,<br>Congratulations on purchasing a Direct Vision plan! You have just made a great investment in protecting your vision health. Please SAVE this important membership information. If you have any questions, call us at <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="tel:800-620-5010"><u>844-833-8440</u></a> or e-mail us at <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:directbenefits@directbenefits.com"><u>directbenefits@directbenefits.com</u></a>. Please do not respond to this confirmation email.<br>Here is what you need to know.<br><b>If you chose electronic delivery of your plan documents, you will not receive paper copies.</b> Instead, you will be able to access your information through your member portal. If you chose to have your plan documents delivered via direct mail, please allow up to 10 days for delivery to the address you provided in th e Primary Applicant section. Your provider will verify benefits using your 9 digit policy # below. Do not use your SSN. Please note: While your vision insurance is effective on the date noted below, your application may take up to five business days to be processed and be accessible in the system through the network providers. Please make sure your provider is able to verify benefits before you schedule an appointment.  <br><b>Access your ID cards, benefits, claims, and more electronically via your member portal account (s).   </b><br><ul style="list-style-type:disc;list-style-position:inside;"><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">For billing information and ID cards, please register for your Ameritas Member Portal Account here: </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="http://track.smtpsendmail.com/6009018/c?p=x0bZOM_Bkw6N2zQgxKHQqz6v7fRCuhvryjXuDK5sydfQqLtJkZVAozkFDQ10PqVIxAFOKDHLGikvGRA_Bab3EuXVZi4xnVcqhMKPTv8nW8ZEXW5pgAt8qG3wx9kZe81mVLmGGNuUg9pddhjJmofYbghGPVzY6JEP90zSBmPK1Jrt071Bgj3ZJ35ArOC1WRd5"><u>https://www.ameritas.com/sign-in/</u></a></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">If you have an EyeMed policy, you can access your benefits and claims through your EyeMed Member Portal Account. When registering, please use your 9 digit policy number from your confirmation email below. Do not use your SSN: Register here: </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="http://track.smtpsendmail.com/6009018/c?p=mc_91emkhNlZsES980T6I8PRoXfIW50TQvntyPQpSJVWXCLJeAAgznFy05L1t7TOrV9h8ujGm4wdE5-fR5N3gFH1WjhFaFmBKLg_Vrzg0jrtTC8jPwDkjkGC00Xyj_hclxwnO-AoawTDNpfB2u-CpijAhnQyrhDWBM91Y4puDHXhY7JM-Q_ai0wAQaumdSl4"><u>www.eyemedvisioncare.com/member/</u></a><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-image:none;"><p style="display:inline;"><span style="margin-inline-start:25px;color:rgb(51, 51, 51);font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;">If you have a VSP policy, you can access your benefits and claims through your VSP Member Portal Account. When registering, please use your 9 digit policy number from your confirmation email below. Do not use your SSN. Create an account here: </span><a style="display:inline;margin-inline-start:25px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;" target="_blank" href="http://track.smtpsendmail.com/6009018/c?p=M%205emqyeJvWSaUKxUmZBXqvMcRVEowhgOJIfq5c40lknWjz4k95G-AnbS259X7hHgm5q454HO9Cn_wqEHGyEvS86UMd7UX-uOBGt2mwXmsGHCEYlKbSfQ3okeJuRUJO7B8WV9iwioCTHZaV38ATcU-Et6tcXMLmrhegHWRvlpE8g="><u>www.vsp.com</u></a></p></li></ul><b>Ameritas </b>(ID cards and billing):<br>5900 O Street Lincoln, NE 68510<br>Customer Service 866-619-6095<br>Fax: 402-309-2598<br>Email: <a style="display:inline;" target="_blank" href="mailto:SpiritIndservice@Ameritas.com"><u>SpiritIndservice@Ameritas.com</u></a><br><b>EyeMed</b> (verification of benefits and claims):<br>800-521-3605<br><b>VSP </b>(verification of benefits and claims):<br>800-877-7195<br>Initial premium will be withdrawn within 3 days of your policies effective date, subsequent premiums are due on the day of the month in which the policy was effective. Plan includes a one-time non-refundable enrollment fee of $25. This charge will be made at the time of purchase and may appear as a s eparate transaction from your insurance as Direct Vision or Direct Benefits, Inc. <br>Your specific coverage information is as follows:<br><br>Plan Selected: VSP Choice Plan A<br>Who’s covered: Applicant<br>Effective Date: 01/27/2026<br>Carrier: Ameritas<br>Monthly Charge: <b>$15.97</b><br><br>Policy Number: <b>300178483</b><br>Agent Info: <b>Wendy Scipione (Phone : (720) 259-1555)</b> <br>Questions? Call (844)833-8440', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2026-01-26 17:19:47', '2026-01-26 17:19:47'),
